<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Issayaasikaa Raaga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Issayaasikaa Raaga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Issayaasikaa Raaga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Isa.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Issayaasikaa Raaga</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wabeeki Issayaasi Kiristoosi ilemebaa edi darre saddeeta dhibba woggake muuxama'n Iyyerusaalemi hedhammake ege'nemeeke lumoke wabeeki summinni ye'emeekeni; kunni Maxaafi sase umo umo kaddeexxe kutuwwaa'n qoodemaan.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Hafuura adhdha 1-39 qico'n hexxeexxi kuta bita'ika boga galchammaki moyaanji, Yihuda, Asoori hiyyemaak hunna affeexxe ola'iinxe mootumma'ni loli ke'ee'naa gelteexxe miidhenshaxxe yaane haaso'aani. Issayaasi Yihuda'ni miidhensha geessise'eki Asoorike hunnameessa manna kadebaangi ardiinxi cubbonna Magenokee ajajema gopha, iittanni, Mageno amana'ni anfeexxe xe'ya'ni kaddeexxa uude. Ca'a hiyyeeke orinninna hujenni wabeekichchinna akeekisanjuwwi qullumatanna dhugaa calli wo'miteexxa hedho he'no'a iyyedageexxe kaddeexxa xexxe'achchiseeni. Lebeexxi Issayaasi dagaake baro'nina butta duuchcha'ninna nage'a wo'mishakenna dhugati galchaaki Daawwitixxe sanneki moyanji daggaaxxe yanna hexxeexxa ediseen haaso'een.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Hafuura adhdha 40-55 qico'n hexxeexxi kuta Yihudiinki ardi Baabiloonii'a booji'emee rakkote'ni ibeexxi godoba kulte hophpholemmaxxee yannaxxa haasottaaxxen. Wabeekichchi, Mageni ifika arda garbummatenaa'n fulcheexxanna jiro insa'neexxiki galdumi ke'aashsha Iyyerusaalemi'a hingaaxxi yanna shiqeexxa kuleeni; tenne hafuura adhdha giddo umoke kaddeexxi Mageni jirtetike anna kadeexxannaa isi arda ifikee afeek yaadi, Isra'eeli ga'mii'n ardi duuchchi'a erga geessisiyyo hasisaxxe kaddeexxa kuldaaxxe kutan. «Duuchchi Woddike Goottike erganjixxa» (49:1—53:12) kuldaaxxi kuluwwa dullaate kakonaa'n saxxeexxe lummollamma erguwwanni laakko'endaaxxen.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Hafuura adhdha 56-66 qico'n hexxeexxi kuta umoke assite kulda'neexxi kula ardi Iyyerusaalemi'a hige me'exxanna Mageni Isra'eeli'a uwwemmaka addachchiisatika hiyyichcho duuchcha muuxa'neeke kadoole kokeessaaxxa yanne harisa'neke ardixxeteni; gargaritti hexxeexxa xonxomachcho assinaashsha hasendeeki qullumma, dhugaa mura, Edi Sanbaata ulfeessanna tolcha shiqisha, iittanni sodaachchote'ni jabaataten. Tenne kuta'n ege'nemeeki hiyyichchi hafuura adhdha 61: 1-2 hexxeexxe kaddaa wodda, Yessuusi ergatensha isixxixxe ye'ensha'a sirende'n shiqinsheexxi kuluwwa afeendaan.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">E'yichchoo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 1:1-31">1:1-31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihudakeenna Isra'eeli'a ergendeexxa ergguwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 2:1-5:30">2:1—5:30</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihudakeennaa Isra'eeli'a higgeenna ergendeexxa erguwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 9:8-12:6">9:8—12:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageniinxi mufe wele arda'n <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 13:1-23:18">13:1—23:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Rakkote'n hedheeke ardi'a Mageniinxa addachchiisatixxa erga <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 24:1-27:13">24:1—27:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageni jallichcha arda'n mufe isixxa dirrisaake kadeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 28:1-31:9">28:1—31:9</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageni Eedoomi'n mufe isixxa dirrise, Iyyerusaalemi kinni eebbisaake kaddeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 32:1-35:10">32:1—35:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Asoori, Baabilooni, moyaanjo Hiziqiyaasinna Isayyaasi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 36:1-39:8">36:1—39:8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageni arda anjiraake kadeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 40:1-48:22">40:1—48:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageniinka erganjo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 49:1-53:12">49:1—53:12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageni uwweexxa addachchiisatika hiyyichcho heqedhaake kadeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 54:1-55:13">54:1—55:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ardi duuchchi Mageniinxe gamo kada dande'aaxxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 56:1-8">56:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Addatendabaaxxe akekanoole'n Mageni mufe dirrisaaxxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 56:9-59:21">56:9—59:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyerusaalemi edi'a affeeka ulfinna <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 60:1-62:12">60:1—62:12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageniinxa manbe'iinxa haarooxxa dada <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 63:1-66:24">63:1—66:24</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />Ooziya, Iyyo'ataami, Akaazinnaa Hiziqiyaasi Yihudiinke moyanjuwwa kande moonemmake sane'ni Mageni Amootsike belto Issayaasi Yihudiinxeennaa Iyyerusaalemixxee uudeexxi waleella konneechchi butta hexxeexxen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">2 Moy. 15:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:32">15:32</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:20">16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:1-20:21">18:1—20:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:1-32:33">2 Odo. 26:1—32:33</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Arda Xixee Qico</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Iimuwwa laqqe!, Butta caqasi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">«Oose i'lennen; nossedhennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">insa'ne kinni ane'n jalline.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Qotiyyichchi horateeka ifika anna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">harretinna gootti iseki isee itisamaxxa bakka egendaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">Isira'eeli kinni egendebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">ardi ankinna qaabbateba'a» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Ha'no cubbaaleeyye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">balleessa callik ard!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Fuggoxxa hujjinaaxxi ila!,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">Hedho ha'nooxxi baxxe'ek!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Duuchchi Woddika Gootta waaldine'ekinnaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">Isira'eelika woyyichcha Mageno tuffatine'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">duddurokanna iso'n wirri assitineen.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Mayee higgeenna mufeti mayee ganedina?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">Mayeeta jallonde'n jallo lephphitina'ne?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">Umi ha'nooki duuchchi ela gophe'een</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">qalbe ha'nooxxi duuchcha gophpheen.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa lekkatike qe'yanaa'n umiinke ordichchi qico'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">bisi ha'nooki fayya afeebi hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">Miseeriinke madatikennaa mala callike kadeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">tinni ha'nooxxi mada malootebaan; usurendebaan bunqe'ebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">zayitetinna shaqqitebaan.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Bogi ha'nook duwwike kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">qachchuwwa ha'nookanna giira itte brteen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">Uudinaa'naa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">fichcha ha'nooka naaphi adhdhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">duuchchiingechcho balleesse birenaa boga ha'nooka duwwi gatisaan.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Tsiyooniki ardi woyinetike fichchi giddo hedheeke fooqishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">baaquliinke fichchi giddo hedheeke minishshannaa qachchishsha buqeendeexxe kadde'een.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ba'netenaa'n gattaaxxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">sanne no'aa gatisa gopheele</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:9">Soodoomishshanna Gomorashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">kande ganteennan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Dada. 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:29">Rom. 9:29</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Ha'no Soodoomik akekisanjuwwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">Duuchchi Woddike Goottika hiyyichcho laqe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:10">Ha'no Gomorake arda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">no'oke Magenika seera caqasse;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:21-22">Amo. 5:21-22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />«Ha'nooke tolchixxi bira sa'ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">ani'a maa woyifulda?» hiyya'nen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">«Techchi qico'n ani'a tolchitineeki gedhebiinxi korbeeyye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">cincaatiki tolchinnaa horiinxi ha'yo anee gelteen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">Ani jibootiinxa gedhebiinke buruusixxa re'etixxe korbeeyyexxa munde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">eeyyabe'non.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Anee magenoofatino'a dagginaashanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">konnelchuwwa duuchcha iyyedaginaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">anke galmixxa baxxe haxxinaashsha ayyete ha'noo laqe?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Konne toliinka tolcha yoona ani'a shiqishinoqqe'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">gubbina'neeki hixaani ane gibiseedheen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">Baate reefi leellitaa woddika ayyaanannaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">ha'nooka sanbatuwwixxe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">Magenooffachchoti bukki wodda hujjinaaxxa cubbo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">eyyeeben'on.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Baate reefi fuldaa woddikanna wele ayyaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">jibbeennen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:14">Kunni ayyaanuwwi ha'urtammaxxe ba'oshsha ane'ni ha'uremmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">ko'we gibeennen.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Soodachchotee anga ha'nooxxa aniba'a diriirsitinoole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">ha'noba'a mi'latabo'non;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">Manjo anga saxxineeke manna kaddinemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">fedhee qico kadha birasa'issitinooelnna laqabo'non.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Ifi ansheexxine ca'a hiyye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">fuggoxxa ha'nooxxa huje anxe ille edii'n fuggusse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:16">Balleessanna waalle.<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />Eloxxa assa baratte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">dhuugaa dabbabaashsha asse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">Miicemeeka anjirre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">annanna ama affebaaxxe oose'a gamote kadde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">aro'ir eyeexxa melaalluwwi'a baasse.<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />«Amme mari'aanto»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">«Cubbo ha'nooxxi sorsiinsha diimmattoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">ani anshe kaadetishsha ca'a assannon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">Mundetishsha diimmattoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">fuutinsha golalooxxe kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Ani'a ajajendinoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:19">butta fulchitechcho misee'naa ittinaan.<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />Ani'a ajajema gophphine jallatinoole kinni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:20">wolaantichchik muddinaan»</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="ISA 1:20">Tennee hiyya'neeke ante Duuchchi Woddike Goottan.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cubbo Bira Saxxeeka Qachcha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Addatememmaki qachchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">hitta yababuldeexxe areshsha kade!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">Edo dhugaa callikennaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">qulliyye hexxa'nemmakemman.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">Ta'a kinni manjo anga sa'eeke manni itti wo'meeke kadee'en.<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Birretiki siblijji atik ciile'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:22">atiki woyinetixxi booka wode'eke kadde'e.<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />Atiki akeekisanjuwwi jalliyyetennaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">moodhaalsheti gudditeeke kadeen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Mitti mitti matta adhdha'neen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">anga iblshanna jaba qicinni halsaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Annakannaa ama affebaaxxa oosennaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">aro'o affeebaxxa melaalle gamote kandebaan.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Tennexxee, Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">Isira'eelik hunnameessi Mageni hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">«Anka naaphuwwa hunnati ganaane'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">anee gibammakeera'n halo fulannon.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />Jabaqi cinni atee xixannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">ciila atenaa'n hoyyannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:25">Xurekanna atenaa'n ca'a assannon.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />Galchalluwwa atika olmishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">gorsammake atika mannanna edi woddishsha ati'a ke'issannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:26">Ookkoneechchi uduma dhugaatikennaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">addetemeeke qachcha hiyyendatton.»<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Tsiyooni dhugaatixxe murtenni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:27">Iyyerusaalemi giddo hedhaake manninaa'ni aade agaaka anjiraan.<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Yaane kinni cubbaaleeyyetinnaa jalliyye mitteba biraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:28">Duuchchi Woddika Gootta gibaaki duuchchinna ba'aan.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />«Ha'no eettinammaxxa dharichcha magenuwwa magenoofattinammaxxee haqqe'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:29">shookinaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:29">Ha'no fi'litinemmake hiddichchiinke boonchuwwa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:29">salphatinaan.<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Shafa harcalsemmake qilxishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:30">xeena gophemmake hiddichchinke fichchishsha kaddinaan.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />No'o hunnaameeyyeten hiyyaaki manni ba'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">huje isixxinna gooffaaxxen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">Lamiingi giirate'ni gubantaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">ayyinna insa'nee tenne ba'neenaa'n gatisaaki hedhebaan.»<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddika Nage'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MIC 4:1-3">Mik. 4:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Amootsiki belti Issayaasi Yihudakeenna Iyyerusaalemike qachchi'a haaso'eek Mageniink hiyyichchi konneechchi butta hedheeken.<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Bariinxi muda geltaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">Duuchchi Woddike Goottika woyyichcha galma ijaremaaxxi kooba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">wele koobuwwa duuchchanaa'n saxxe leellitaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">Koobuwwa duuchchanaa'ninna lumooshsha saxxaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">lumooki ardi isiba'a yaa'aan.<verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Tennexxee lumoki ardi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">«Amme Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe koobaba'a me'ino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">Ya'iqoobike Magenike woyyichchi galmiba'a me'ino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Isi eeyyaaxxa hunjannoshsha no'oo barsiisaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">no'onna isike ora'n me'inannon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Seeri Tsiyoonii'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi kulanna Iyyerusaalemi afendammaxxe» hiyyaan.<verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />Isi lumooke moyanjuwwixxe oddo'n murte uwwaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">weli gonphe balleessaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Tennexxee wolaantichcha insa'neeka qottote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">bagedo insa'neeka haantote giissinsaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Mitti moyanji mitte moyanjo'n lola ke'issabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">ookkoneechchi uduma loliinxa baranno barataaki hedhebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:10">Iyu. 3:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Ha'no Isra'elke arda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:5">Amme! Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ifi giddo mammaremmo!<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fuggaalleeyyetixxa Ba'ne</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />Mageno! Arda atika Ya'iqoobixxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">sanne wocci assite waaldetten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">Bogi duuchchi boroti darrekenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">Filisixemike mannike morotike adabinni wo'meen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">ardikinna dharichcha mageno magenoofatammake ardinni welti guddee'en.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Boga insa'neeke'n birretiki sibljinnaa worqe wo'mitemmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">karra insa'neexxa qixxe egenneba'a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:7">Bogi insa'neeke fadhadi callike kademmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">fadhadiinxi gaaruwwa yo'oshsha bira saxxeen.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Boga insa'neeki giddo duuchcha magenoofattaneexxi fakkuwwa wo'mitee'en;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:8">insa'ne anga ifixxe'n giissinemmachchuwwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:8">Insa'neexxe angaxxe huje'a saganda'neen.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa duuchchiingi shooke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:9">salphateen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:9">Duuchchi Woodike Gootta! Balleessa insa'neexxa gattowwaali hitoxxe!<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe mufenaa'ninna sodaachchiisaake isike gaachchanninaa'n baaji;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">wolo'o giddo me'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">kinjuwwiinxe oddo'ninna bale giddo sho'omme!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:10">Wal. 3:10</ref>. </char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:15">Wal. 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:9">2 Tes. 1:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Hollaameeyye salphataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:11">caaqalleeyye ibbaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:11">Eettene yanna'n Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti calli ulfaataan.<verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">ifii dukaakannaa caaqaaleeyye duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:12">Hollaameeyye duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">salphataaxxa barra mureen.<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />Isi lumollamma Libaanoosixxa haqqe duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:13">Baasanke bogixxa lumolla haqquwwa duuchchanna salphisaan<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />Lumollamma koobuwwa duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:14">tulluwwa duuchcha dirrise'e dirrete assaan.<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />Qeeraaramma qachchixxa heqqatixxa xeelephuwwa duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:15">kinjiinka dalla'uwwa duuchchanna hojoggi assaan.<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />Terseesixxa lumolla hoboluwwa duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:16">Yo'oshsha biifaaka mi'yuwwa duuchcha midde lixaashsha assaan.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Manniinxi holla baxxan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:17">ifi saadatinna gattaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:17">Eettene yanna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti calli ulfaataan.<verse eid="ISA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />Fakkuwwa duuchchanna hara baxxaan.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti butta daassebiro'a dagaaxxa yanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">isixxe mufenaa'ninna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">Sodaachchisaake isike gaachchanninaa'n gatatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">manni wolo'o giddo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">kinuwwatixxe oddo'n yookaan bale qoltine'e sho'omo'a wo'laannaan.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />Eettene barra manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:20">magenoofato'a anga ifixxenni giissedhemmaxxa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:20">Birretike sibljixxannaa worqetixxa fakkuwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:20">tuquwwakeennaa cirrichchuwwakee wala'n me'aan.<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti butta daassaaxxa yanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">ardi isixxe mufenaa'ninna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">Sodaachchiisaake isike gaachchanninaa'n gato'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">wolo'o giddonnaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">kinotike baqaqi giddo sho'omaan.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Yoona reyaaka manjo addatinoqqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:22">isi mittechchonna woyi fulabaan.<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yihudakeenna Iyyerusaalemi'a Uwwendeexxa Murte</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Kunnise Dada Duuchchik Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">Iyyerusaalemikinna Yihudiinki ardi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">gargaareme galaammaxxa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">Iitanna wode'e iittanni welechcho duuchcha hoyye biraan.<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />Insa'neeka jannuwwa, loollinka mannuwwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:2">insa'neeka hayyichchuwwannaa wabeeka, insa'neeka gojaammaka mannuwwannaa akeekisanjuwwa,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />Insa'neeka looliinka manna ajajammakaranna gorsammakaara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:3">insa'neeka moraaka mannuwwanna edi'a kaddaaxxee faro uudaakaara duuchchiinga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:3">hoyyeexxi bakka insa'neexxa balleessaan.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Shiixaaro labbaxxa oose insa'neeke akeekisanuwwa assaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:4">reefixxi oose insa'ne galchitaan.<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Ardikinna weli'aani weli mitti mitte miicaani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">manji manjoke'n jaali jaalonge'n ke'aani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">Oosichchi gedhee ulfeessabaani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">tuffantaaki manji ulfeessinaake manjo'n hollaan.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Mitte annixxi oose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">dayyuwwa insa'neeki giddii'n mitte fildeexxi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">«Ati weleechchonna gophphottole oddo'witattoxxa seemma afeettaxxee no'oke akeekanjo kadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">duuchchingechchi ati assiteteshshanni kadowwali» hinaani.<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Isinna eettene barra'ni hafuura gikki asseexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">ha'no gargaara dande'abo'non!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">«Ani mini anki giddo itanna seemma afa gophennaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">ha'nooke akeekanjo assitine fildinoqqe'e!» hiyye hiissaani.<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Iyyerusaalemi daaqate'n hexxeeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">Yihudikinna iba shiqeen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">Tinninna kaddeechchi insaa'nee hunjaaxxe hujenninna haasonnaake haaso'i duuchchi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta hega uundammaxxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">isike gaachchanixxa afenshanna shollishshaaxxen.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Insaa'ne uudaake manji'a albi insa'nenngi ege'nishaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">Sooddoomike mannishsha cubbo insa'neexxi farri hite ege'nendeexxen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">sho'ne dandeenabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">Rakko ifi'aani adhdhinemmaxxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">insa'ne'a aanne.<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Eloxxa assaaki ebbiseemaaxxa insa'ne'n kuli;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:10">insa'ne eloxxe ifixxe hujeka hira alfinaan.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Fuggaalleeyyete aanne! Ba'ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:11">insa'ne'n daggaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:11">huje insa'neexxika hira alfinaan.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Maalaqa liqeesaake manni'a aane'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">insa'ne dhaala dhaalchinsa'n adhdhanee arda anka duwwi gatisa'neen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">Anke arda, akeekisano ha'nooxxi ha'no dedhissa'neeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">dabiinke ora'n me'itinaashsha assina'neen.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Arda Ifike'n Murte Uwwe</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti murtetike barcuma'ni ofo'leeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:13">ardakeenna murte uwwo'a qophpheffateeni.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ardiinxa akeekisanonna gorsa uwwammaka manna murtetibaa shiqisheexxi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">«Woyinetike hiddichchika fichcha saandineen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">hiyyeeyyetenaa'n saandinemmaxxa karra mine ha'nooke'n wonshexxineen.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Anke ardika micco enqitino'aanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">hiyyeeyye miiccino'a seera ha'no'a uwweeki hedhebaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:15">Tenneenna haaso'aanek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">ani Dada Duuchcha Ajajanok Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Magenon.»<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyerusaalemixxa Melaalle Xexxe'achchiisa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">«Iyyerusaalemixxe melaallexxi holla birasaxxeeni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">Gooba qeerrisee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">illeti qiphaa'neeni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">Mususuqqe laana tarkaafata'n me'ita'neeni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">lekkate'n usudhitemmaki seesi caca'issane'neen.<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Tennexxee dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti umo insa'neeka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:17">sanqe birtaashsha assaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:17">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti biso insa'neekanna duwwi gatisaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />Eettene barra Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ulfiniinka insa'neka seessuwwa kunniirinna: insa'nexxa lekkatixxa sageetto, umiinka seesuwwa, agenjiinxe fakkeekka gobiinka seesuwwa, <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />insa'neka mashatika gutichchuwwa, angatika hirbooruwwa, alba buqeccatichchuwwa, <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />insa'neka umo buqe'namachchuwwa, ciqiletika seessuwwa, boonduwwa, shittotixxa bilqaaxxuwwa, moro morsiisatixxi borro giddo borreeseneeka subbuwwa, <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />qubbatixxa qubuwwanna sanotixxa qubuwwa, <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />biifaaka zuuruwwa, giddixxa layinuwwa, kaabbuwwanna angatika borsuwwa, <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />daa'wituwwa, shimelik gandeexxa seemma, umiinka seesuwwa, illetike gaarika seesuwwa duuchcha insa'nenaa'n qoxaan.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Shittotixxa bakka bochcho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">eloke sabbatixxa bakka wodaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">Goofaaretixxa bakka sanqe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">ejjiinxa baka muddexxa seemma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">danchuuwwi shooko odo'waan!<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Ha'nook labballi wolaantichchike qarinni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:25">ha'nook jajjabbi ka'umuwwi bagedoke'ni reyaani.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Iyyerusaalemike qachchixxi huluwwa oose isexxa shinnee'naa duwwitti hexxe yaadda'nee ooxxaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:26">isenna dedhende qofi hexxeexxe manjichchoshsha kaddaani.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />Eettene yanna torbaane melaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">mitte labbaka abixxite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:1">«Ifixxa sagale indaannen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">ifixxa seemmanna oddo'winaannen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:1">No'o atike summi callinni ye'emunnun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">isixxe aruwwani hiyyemonna'a calla no'o aadhi» hine isoo kadhantaan.<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyerusaalemixxa Haarro'ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />Eettene yanna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti buttate'n hedheeke hiddichchuwwanna haqqetixxa damoole hanjise danchondeexxenna ulfeessendeexxe assaan; Isira'eeliki ba'netenaa'n gateki ardi duuchchi butta fulchitaaxxe midha'ni gammanda'n hollnaan. <verse eid="ISA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Tsiyooni giddo bagedokenaa'ni gateeki Iyyerusaalemi giddo booji'emebaaki gatekiiri Iyyerusaalemi giddo lubbo hedhaashsha fi'leek manni woyyichchake hiyyemaan. <verse eid="ISA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti arda ifixxe murtenaa'ni hafuuriinxe hunnanni balleessatenna'ni ca'a assaan; isixxe murtenn isike ulfinninninna isixxe hunnanninn Iyyerusaaleminaa'n mundetixxa dunensha hoyyaani. <verse eid="ISA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti qachchuwwa duuchcha'ninna ookko bukki hiyyammake duuchcha'ni barra jabaka duumancha, hashsha hashsha giiratike bubeniinki ifi hedhaashsha assaani. Mageniinki ulfinni qachchuwwa ba'lake dunkaanishsha buqee heqqaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21">Fula. 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 24:16">24:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ISA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />Isiki ulfini qachchuwwa barrike arishshotike holatanaa'ni gollaan; xeenakenaa'ninnaa hobonbaltetenaa'ni gollante gantaaxxe bakka kaaddaani.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Woyinetike Hiddichchixxe Kulendeexxa Gence</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />Anike jaalike woyinetike hiddichchi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">jaalalatixxa faaro faarso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">Jaali anki yo'oshsha shamoxxe kaddeexxe tullo'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">woyinetika hiddichcho afeemman.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />Fichcha ookkone ko'we kino giddii'n qoce bire</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">eloxxe sanneka woyinetika hiddichcho kaase;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Fichchi giddonna heqedhatixxa xellebo ijaadhdhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">bale umeexxi woyinetixxa gumma miicaaxxa bakkanna giisse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Ookkoneechchi uduma eloxxa gumma gummisaashsha heqqedhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">yaane kinn woyinetiki hiddichchi qaraartaaxxa gumma gummise.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:33">Mat. 21:33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1">Mar. 12:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />«Ha'no Iyyerusaalemi giddo hexxina'neeke koo Yihudiinke arda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">Anixxennaa anke woyinetike fichcha ankixxe oddo'ni amme murte uwwe.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Ani assennexxe iimi darre konne woyinetike fichchi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">wele isi'a assemiyyo hasisaaxxi maachchomma?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:4">Mayete'ni eloxxa gumma gummissaani hiyya'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">heqqedhaa'naa mayee majajjaaxxa gumma gummisse?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Yoona anke woyinetike fichcha'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">maa assannexxa ha'no'ni kulo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Isi'a ijaarennaka dalla'a diige balleessannoni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">dalla'uwwakanna diigannon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">biniinchi ita'ni hirbeessaashsha assannoni.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma ququme giissabe'non kuufisabe'non:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">bago boga assannon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">gorikinnaa ute itti lattaashsha assanoni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">Xeeni ganabashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">Duumancha ajajannoni.»<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">woyinetik fichchi Isira'eelike ardan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">Yihudaki ardinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">gammashsho isixxike hiddichchon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">Isinna dhugaatixxa murte halseen; yaane kinni munde dunedaa'naa afe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">yaane kinni dhugaa gorsine arda raarshinshe.<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ardiinxa Fuggoxxa Huje</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Mitti boonchinna weleke hedhabaa qico'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">minenge'ni hana mine lebat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">Bogange'ni hana boga lephphitine abixxatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">arda giddii'ni fulchitina'n qofitinni barqaaqqine hexxina'neeke ha'no'aa aanne.<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti mansha anixxi laqqa'naa hiyye haaso'ee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:9">«Lumolli minuwwi duuchchi diigemee onake kadaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:9">elolli minuwwi giddo hedhaak manjinna afemabaan.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Shoole hekitaareke boga'ni kansexxe woyine saddeeta neetiro booka calla kaddaan: mitte dhibbanna saddeeta tomme killo ronkeexxi midha tommenna saddeeta killo calla aaggaani.»<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Machcheessaake ha'wika hasito</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">bariisa diiphiin ke'a'neekeeri'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">bubbi talli assaa qico'n woyine ha'wati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">soodisaakeri'a aane!<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Itate'ninnaa ha'wate'ni masinqonna kiraara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">okolekannaa suusu'le iittanni woyinetixxi bookanna hedhdhaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hujaashsha bakka isi'a uunebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">egenne isixxe huje'a isoo galateefantebaan.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Tennexxee anki ardi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">ege'na afa gophphemmaxxe'e booji'emaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:13">Hayyooletinna solo'ik rertaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">ardikinna wode'e dheebo'we gubataan.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Tennexxee hirreessi adda haani hiyye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">insa'nee heqqedhaani geyeeni hiyyabaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">Iyyerusaalemixxa hayyoolenna mitteba bukki hiteexxi gammadaaken welti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">ookkonne ardiba liqiinsemaani.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Manji duuchchi shookaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:15">hollammaki duuchchi salphatan.<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti kinni dhugaatixxa murte murati ulfaataan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">woyyichchi Magekeninna dhugaa hujati woyyichchumma ifixxa leellishaani.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Gedhebiink buruusuwwi, edo allalemmamaba bobba'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:17">ha'yeek re'etiki buruusuwinna qachchi diigememmaba badda'a dheedaani.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Dhara haaso'aati cubbote'ni ibaake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:18">balleessatanna sarageelik harkissina'neeke'e ha'no'a aanne!<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />No'onna illeti undannoshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyyemmaxxa rake assowwaal:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">hujetanna muddansowwaal</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:19">Isira'eeliki woyyichchi Mageni hedemmaka yaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">no'onna egennannoshsha shiqqowwaal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">muuxowwali hiyyaake duuchchi'a aanne!<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Eloxxa elobaaxxe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">elobaaxa eloxxe hiyyaake'e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">Dukkana ifaake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">ifakanna dukkanate assakeri'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">Xe'maachcho qaraarake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">qaraarak xe'make hiyyaake aane!<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Ifi qarote asse uudaake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:21">ifike yaadinni beekichchake ifi assaake manni'a aanne!<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Woyinetixxa booka ha'wati jannomaakee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:22">machchossitaaxxa ha'wa makiyote'e soda'a gophaakee aanne!<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />Matta adhdhiyoti balleessanjo balleesesbaake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:23">balleessebaaka kinni dhugaa'a alfabaashsha seera gorsaake manni'a insa'ne'a aanne!<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Tennexxee giira hicaacekanna huura itte birtammashshani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">korikinna giirate'ni iteme ba'ammashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">Insa'neeki hiddinna iittann alo'aan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">daraari insa'neekinna huurake kade gataan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddik Goottika seer tuffantemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">Isira'eelik woyyichchi haaso'emmaka hiyyichcho shollinshe'en.<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi mufe ardake'ni ibbe'een</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">isinna anga ke'isse insa'nee ganeen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Koobuwwa sheke shekete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">renshuwwikinna orake'ni hunemeeke kora kade.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Kaddo malee kinni tinni duuchcha kadde'naa'n mufe isixxi ille iima higgeba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">anga isixxinna qophphiteeshshanni hexxeen.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti bayyii'n gosa gosaka arda ye'o'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">beesisa uurrisaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:26">Buttatixxe gabala duuchchanaa'n insa'nee ye'aa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">insa'neenna wii'nama'ni dangaan.<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Insa'ne giddii'n mittikinna shaqqaaki guggufataaki hedhabaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">mugaaki diiphaaki hedhabaani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">Mixe insa'neexxi laffabaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">kophe insa'nexxiki usurrinna ta'abaan.<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Bagedi insa'neeki qaraken,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">gabe insa'neexxi qophphooteexxen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">Fadhadi insa'neekixxi kotte cabbetishsha jabaxxen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">insa'neeke sarageeluwwixxi moluwwa hobonbaltetishshaten.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Insa'nenna neenqinsha ittannaani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">Oosichcha neenquwwishsha baroondaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">Neenquwwi adame abidemmachcho gurura'n adhdhee me'aani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">ayyinna angii'ni ibisaaki hedhebaan.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />Eettenne barra'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">abbaayyatike danbala'ishsha luula'ni Isra'eelike ardiba'a dagaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:30">Ayyinna boga uudaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">dukkanatinna rakko buqqee'naa anfaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">duumanchakenaa'ni kexxeexxa ifikinna dukkanaani.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Issayyaasi Wabeekummatee Ye'ee Qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />Moyaanji Ooziyaani reyeexxe wogga'n ani Duuchchi Woddika Gootta uudennen: isinna lummexxeexxenna ulfaattexxe moote'ni ofo'lee'naa seemma isixxinna galma wo'mitemmani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:7">2 Moy. 15:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:23">2 Odo. 26:23</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Suraafeelite hiyyendaaxxi erganna erqe kayyii'ni isoo buqqemman: mitte mittendi erganna jaane jaane keela affeemmani; lame lame keelinni alba buqexxammani: lame lame keelinni kinni lekka buqexxee lame lame keelinni phirri hite me'itaaqmman; <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />Mitte mittindi erganna bado badonni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:3">«Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti woyyichchaken, woyyichchaken, woyyichchakeni!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:3">Butta duuchcha'ninna ulfinni isiki wo'mee'en!» hita'emman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:8">Wal. 4:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />Hiyyichcho insa'neekixxe raarexxe bira sa'nenaa'ni kexxeexxa galmiinxi booso linqi linqi hite: galmi giddonna wiliille wo'mite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:8">Wal. 15:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Aninna, «Afo'i isiki cubbo calla haso'a'neekixxe ardixxe oddo'ni hedhennekeni; afo'i anki cubbo calla haaso'a'neeke manjon; aninna ille anxinni Moyanjo, Dada Duuchcha Ajajaka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta uudennaxxee ani'a aanne yoona ani'a ba'nenden» hiyyenneni.<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma eettene erganuwwa giddi'ni mitti anibaa phirri hiyye dage; tolchimalchokenaa'n adhdhemmaka kashilo abixxemmaxxa qaraba anga abixxeemman. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />Giiratike kashilinni suume anxa tuqeexxi «Kunni kashili suume atixxa tuqemmaxxe ta'a ati balleessa affeeboxxoni; cubbo atixxi gattowwaali hiyyendee'eni» anee hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Dada duuchchiki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti «Ayete erganno? Ayete no'aa maraak?» hiyya'naa laqenneni; aninna «Kunse ani! Anee ergi!» hiyyenneni.<verse eid="ISA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Isinna ane'n hiyyee qici: «Konee ardiba marte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">« ‹Laqqina'inni hexxineeni; yaane kinn qalbeefatina'nebaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:9">uudinaa'ini hexxineeni yaane kinni affiina'nebaani› hite kuli hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Konne ardixxa qalbe dilloos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">mansha insa'neexxa duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">ille insa'neexxanna affabaashsha assi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">Itta kada gophphoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">ille ifixxenni anfeexxi; mansha ifixxeninna lanqeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">qalbe ifixxeninna qalbeefanteexxi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">Ille iima hingeexxi fayyinaan.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:14-15">Mat. 13:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mar. 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:10">Luq. 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:40">Yoh. 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:26-27">Erga. Huj. 28:26-27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Aninna «Anke Gootta, tinni kaddaaki haani qico'nite?» hiyye qorenneni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 6:11">Isinna hiise hiyye haaso'ee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">«Qachchuwwi diigeme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">minuwwikinna giido hedhaaki gophemee'naa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">Minuwwi onake kadaa qico'ninna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">bogi urime duwwi gataa qico'niteni. <verse eid="ISA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna ardakanna bayyike bogiba'a me'aashsha assannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:12">bogikinna urimake kade gataa qico'n.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Tomme anganaa'ni mitte anga ardi okkone boga'n gatoole midde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">isinna ba'aan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">Yaane kinni waaccotike yookaan qilxiinke haqichchi kareme</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">tutunji gatammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">woyyitte sanne okkone boga'n tutunjiinsha gattaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Moyanjo Akazi'a Uwwendexxa Erga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />Ooziyaanik belt Iyyo'ataami i'leeki Akaazi Yihuda galchammaka sane, Sooriyaki moyaanji Retsinina Isira'eeliki moyaanji Remaliyaki belt Faquhe lola ke'issino'a hanseexxi Iyyerusaalemi'a dagaani; yaane kinni Iyyerusaalemii'i lolle injifanto'a dandeennebaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:5">2 Moy. 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:5-6">2 Odo. 28:5-6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Sooriyaa Efireeminni welti mitteba hingee lolakee weli aange'eeni hiyyendaaxxa odo Yihudiinki moyanji laqee wodda isinna Yihudiinki ardi alayye diidallo gandemmake haqichchishsha eeriqennaa kayya daaqe.<verse eid="ISA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Issayaasi hiyyee qici, «Belto atika adhdhite Sheeriyashshubi adhdhite seemma borcammake mannike fichchiba me'inammake ori giddo marte moyaanjo Akaazinni afemi. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />Isoonna hitato qici, ‹Daaqqoxxe'e, sodaattoxxe'e; giiratenaa'ni gateexxi wiliilaa'neeke konnee lame itisane haqichchuwwa, Sooriyaxxeenna moyaanjo iseke Re'asoonixxee iittanni Remaaliyake beltixxee mufexxe mee weekemi. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Sooriya Efireemik ardinninna iseke moyaanjinni welti mitteba hinge'eni, <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />«Insa'nenna Yihuda'a lollo'a, ardakanna rakkinse ifixxe gamo assedhat Xaabi'eelika belto moyanjo insa'neeke assate mudhdhine'een.» <verse eid="ISA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:7">« ‹Tinn insa'neexxi mari'e qabbabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:7">haranga kaddaaxxebaani,<verse eid="ISA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />Mayee hiyyendeexxe kadoole, Sooriyaki umi Demaasiqoteni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">Demasiqoki uminna Retsinten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:8">Jaane tommanna onde woggaa giddo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">Efireemik ardi xexxereme luggee'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">mootumumati ege'nemiyyo isexxinna gattaan.<verse eid="ISA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Iittanni Efireemik umi Samaariyaate kadaa wodda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">Samaariyaaki umi moyanjo Faqu'eteni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:9">Yoona amanate'n jabaata gophphinoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">ha'noonna haranga uurra dandetinabaani.› »<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanu'eelixxa Daga Leellishaaka Beesisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti higgeenna Akaazii'i hiyyee qici, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />«Buttatixxe dhi'monaa'ninna kadi iimati iimi darree'n mitte beesisa ati'a uwwonna'a anee Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Mageno laqi.»<verse eid="ISA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Akaazinna kinni «Beesisa ani'a uwwi hiyye laqabo'noni; atee Duuchchi Woddika Goottanna hega uudabe'noni» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Tennexxee Issayyaasi hiyyee qici, «Ha'no moyanjo Daawwitike mini hado! Laqqe; manjo ko'wisa hanqattamale Magenokanna ko'wisinaa'nee? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Yoona umo isiken Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ha'no'a beesisa uwwaan; kunse duuddo dubarichcho sila'witaan; labbaka beltonna ildaani; summa isikanna Amanu'eeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibirawootinke laagadinni Amanu'eel hiyya Mageni no'onni welti hedheen hiyyoten. </char></note> hite fulchitaan. <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />Isinna nophphe elobaaxxa gibe eloxxa melledho'a geessissaxxa ege'na afaa wodda adotanna malebo la'ataan. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Yoona kunni belti eloxxa elobaaxxenaa'n gargar hiisse ege'nebaa edi darre kunni ati sodaataateke lame moyanjuwwiki bogi urumme gataan. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />Yaane kinni Efireemi Yihudanaa'n gargari higeexxe yannanaa'n Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti uudende ege'nedebaaxxe jabaxxe rakkoka baro atike annike mootummatike mini hado'n iyyedagaan; tinninna Asoorika moyanjo'ninna ate'n rakko iyyedagaan hiyyaten.»<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />Iikki bari geyaa wodda Gibtseeki manni tiitichchiinke haagansha, Asoorik manninna ifike boga'ni kinniisiinke sannachchiinsha huursa'ni dago'a Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti beesisa uwwaan. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Insa'nenna bukki hine dangeexxi gammoojexxe dhooquwwa giddonna wolo'uwwa giddo, qosorruwwa giddonna hori bobba'ammaba duuchcha'ni ofollaani. <verse eid="ISA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />Iikki bari geyaa wodda Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti umo ha'nooka, areedakanna bisi ha'nookixxa orda duuchcha Asoorika moyanjo Efiraaxisike galaani widii'n aadhe dage haadotishsha ha'noo haadaan.<verse eid="ISA 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />«Ookkonne baro'n mitti manji mitte goronsanna lame gedhebo callanna afo'oole, <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />ookkonne horenaa'n alfaaxxe adotixxe bira sa'nenaa'ni kexxeexxa isi hasisaaxxa ita alfaan; tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa ookkone boga'n gataaki weli manninna la'ataachchi malebokenna adote kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />«Eettene barra'n kuma birre hiraaki eloki kumi woyinetika hiddichcho kanseeke fichcha duuchcha'ni utetixxi haqqenna qu'muudo fuldaan. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Boggi duuchchi utetixxi haqqenna qu'muudo calla kademmaxe'e ardi adamo fulaa wodda gabe abixxe fulaan. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Edi wodda koonne midha ronke'na fulchitammaxxi tulluwwa duuchcha utetixxenna qu'muudo fulchemmaxxee ayyinna okko'a marabaan: yaane kinni lalo, gedhebokanna re'e calla alla'linaaba kadaani» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Issayyaasiki Belti Ardiinxe Booji'ensha'a Beesisake Kadee qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ane hiyyee qici, «Bidiro lumok aaxxe'e ise'ninna, ‹balleessatteenna booji'atee ariifati› hite itti borreessi hiyye. <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Lame addatemaaka manna, ikkinna qeesichcho Uuriyanna Beraakiyyuki belti Zakkariyaasi dhugaate kandaashsha assi» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Shiixxooxxe yanna uduma ani wabeekitte anxe arenni welti galennen: isenna sila'wite labba belto ilde. Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee, «Summa beltiinka ‹Balleessateenna booji'otee ariifati!› hite fulchi. <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Beltikinna ‹Annayyo, yookaani Amayyo› hiyye ye'a ege'neba edi darre Asoorik moyanji Demasiqoxxanna Semaariyaxxa karra booji'e adhdhaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoorike Moyanjixxa Daga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti higgeenna ane'e hiyyee qici,<verse eid="ISA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />«Kunni ardi laana yaa'aaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:6">Selihoommixxe muummeka wode'e gibexxi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:6">Moyanjo Retsininna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:6">moyanjo Faquhe'n gammandeen.<verse eid="ISA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />Tennexxe Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti jabakanna hunnaameessa lola'iinka wede'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">Asoorika moyanjo isike gaachchanni duuchchinni welti insa'ne'ni idagaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:7">Efiraxxisiki galaani wo'me danbala'aamakishsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">isi wede'in qarqara hedheeka boga duuchcha wo'maan. <verse eid="ISA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />Hunnati dhi'me Yihudiinke boga'n timaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">duuchchingechcho buqe bira'ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:8">Goobin qico'n geyaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">Kaddo malee Amanu'eeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:8">Isinna lukkichcho beltanna keeli giddo shoxxe heqqitammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">boga konne heqqaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Ha'no gosa gosake arda bagedokee lasse!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">Yaane kinni muddinan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:9">Ha'no bayyi boga hexxineeki ardi duuchchi caqase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">bagedokeenna qophpheefatte! Yaane kinni muddinan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">ta'anna bagedokee qophpheefatte; muda muddinaan.<verse eid="ISA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Yaada fulche kinni heddineeshsha kadabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:10">Mageni no'onni welti hedhemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:10">mari'e ha'noxxinna qabbabaan.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Wabeekichcho Xexxe'achchisee qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />Ardi me'eshsha me'abe'noshsha Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti jabaxxe ifixxe hunnanni anee hiyye xexxe'achchisee qici,<verse eid="ISA 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />«Kunni ardi xaqarote hiyyaaxxa yaane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">ha'no xaqarote hitinoqqe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:12">Insa'ne sodaantaxxa yaane ha'no sodaatinoqqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">eettenne yaane'aanna alaltinoqqe.<verse eid="ISA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />Ha'no woyyoonsiyyo hasisaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:13">Ani Dada Duuchcha Ajajanoka Duuchchi Woddika Goottan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:13">ha'no sodaatiyyo hasisaak isoonni callanni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:13">ha'no alayyo hasissaak isoten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:14-15">1 Phex. 3:14-15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />Ani woyyimma anixxen ardakee gollake kadannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">lamiinge Yihudakennaa Isira'eelike ardi'a kinni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:14">Ani guggufachchiissake kinjonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">ibissaaxxe rassaa kadannon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:14">Iyyerusaalemike ardi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">abidaaxxe fonxoro ribbo insa'ne'a kadannon.<verse eid="ISA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Tennexxee heddi guggufataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:15">ibeenna enqemaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:15">fonxorote'ninna ibe abidemaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:8">1 Phex. 2:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moramakenna Ekedhati Haaso'ammake Manni'a Xexxe'achchiisa Uwwendee qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Magenokenaa'n baratteettexxa jabeessite abixxi; isenna maxxansi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:16">ookkonee seeranna anxe hordofeeyyexxe oddo'n maxansi.<verse eid="ISA 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isra'eelinaa'n alba hoyyedheeka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:17">ani iso'o heqqedhannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:17">isonde addatannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:13">Ibr. 2:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />Kunniseteni aninna; anxi oosenna ani Tsiyoonixxe kooba'n hedheeke Dada Duuchcha Ajajaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isira'eelike ardi'a xexxe'achchiisatike beesisa kandona'a no'aa uwwe'en.<verse eid="ISA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />«Loqonxa'ninna hashashati mora'ni ekedhati haaso'aaka manna qodhdhe» hiyya'n ha'noo gorsa'neeki manni hedheen: lubboti hedheeki manni'a ifixxe yaane'a ekedha qodhdheexxi mannii'ni Mageno qodhdhexxa woyyabaa?<verse eid="ISA 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Mageniinke seeribanna dhugaaba'a marre tennee assa gibbinoole bariisatiki ifi ha'no'a ifabaan.<verse eid="ISA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rakkotixxa Yanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />Ardi bogi giddo solo'we rakkate doonsakiyya hiyyaan: solo'wemmaxxee mufate iimi'a uuda'n insa'neeka moyanjonna Mageno yowwaan. <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />Ookkonneechchi uduma butti'a uundaa wodda leellaachchi rakko, dukkananna sodaachchissaaxxe yaanen: dukkana dimmi giddi'aanna hunnaan.<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Edi'a Moyaaka Nage'iinka Moyaanjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Iikki rakkateemmaki manni langaxxa rakkatabaan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 9:1">Edike baro'n Zaabilonikinna Nefitaalemik bogi salphatee hedha'nemman: udumike baro'n kinni Mediteriyaanike Abayyake boroti darreke boganaa'ni Yordaanoosi wido hedheke bogi qico'n giddi'ninni wele gosaki ardi bukki hiyye hedha'neeki Geliilaki bogi ulfaataan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:15">Mat. 4:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Dukkanate'n hedhammaki ardi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:2">lumoka ifa uude;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:2">Dimma dukkana bogi giddo hedheeki duuchchi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:2">ifi ife.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:16">Mat. 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:79">Luq. 1:79</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Arda atika bira sa'isitetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">gammashsho insa'ne'ni bira sa'isitetten:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">Ardi midha aasedhaa wodda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">yookaan boji'o qoodemaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">Gammadammashshanni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">ati insa'ne'a assitettexxe yaane'a ardi gammadanni.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Edike baro'ni Midiyaamika manna injifatetteshshanni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">ta'anna atike arda'n hedheeka galchatika qanbaranna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">Dugummo insa'neexxa gandammaxxa siqqo enqitetten:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">arda atika miica'n galchammaka arda injifattetten.<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Loliinke mannixxi kophe duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:5">mundeti laaqendeexxi insa'neexxi seemmuwwa duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:5">Giirate'n wore'ndaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:5">gubattaan.<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Anno no'aa ilendeen!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Labbaki belti no'aa uwwemeen!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Isinna akekisanjo no'oke kadaan!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Summi iskinna «Mambe'iinke gorsallo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">lumoke Mageno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Duuchchi Woddike Anna, Nage'iinke Sooressa» hiyyemaan.<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Moyanjumma isixxixxi baalle gabala afeexxebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">isixxe mootummaxxi galchanna duuchchiin wodda nage'iinxe kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Tenne yanna'n duuchchi woddi qico'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">isixxi mootumma dhugaatinna seerinxi murte'n ijaarendaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Daawwitixxe moote'ni hexxemmashsha jabeessaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">Daawwitixxe moote hana ofo'laan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">boga duuchchanna galchaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti isixxe hinaaffenni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">tennee assatee mudhdheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:32-33">Luq. 1:32-33</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Magen Isra'eelika Arda Mura Woxisaaxxa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Ya'iqoobixxe horte kadeke Isra'eelike arda'ni murtetika hiyyichcho erge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:8">tinni murtetenna Isira'eelinni muuxendaan.<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Isira'eeliki ardi duuchchinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">Efireeminna Semaariyake qachcha'n hedhaaki duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:9">Tenne asseeki Magenoke kadeexxa ege'naan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">kaddoolenna, hollatinna haloonfatati hinaa qici,<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />«Boloketeti ijaaremeki minuwwi diigeemeen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">no'o kinni hiissine bocendeexxe kinnon ijaarrannon:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:10">Odi'iinxe haqqenni haaroba ijaareeki utuphuwwi enqemeen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">no'o kinni hiissine eloxxe Libaanosixxe haqqenni giissinannon» hinaan.<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti insa'nee gibaaka naapha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:11">insa'ne'ni ke'issee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:11">diina insa'nekanna insa'ne'n iyyedagaan.<verse eid="ISA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />Isinna borotibaa'n Sooriyaka manna, dhidhimi darre'n Filisixeemika manna ergeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">Isira'eeli lolaashsha asse; tinni duuchchi kadde'naanni mufee isixxi qiiddebaan; tennexxee anga isixxi ganetee qophphoottexxen.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Ardikinna kinni insa'nee mura woxisemmake Dada Duuchcha Ajajake Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa higebaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:13">yookaani isoonna hasebaan.<verse eid="ISA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti uminshanna eegetishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:14">meexxetishshanna isexxe damuuwwashsha uudemaaka mitte barra'ni Isira'eelinaa'ni kutaan.<verse eid="ISA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Umoke hiyyemeeki geedheetanna ulfeesemeeke mannamman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:15">eegete hiyyeemek hiyyechchi dhara barachchiissaammaxxe wabeekomman.<verse eid="ISA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Konne arda akeekammaki duuchchi arda dedhiseen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:16">ardikinna orakenaa'n gore jeeki hiyye'een.<verse eid="ISA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa dada duuchchiki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti dargaggeeyyuwwa insa'neexxa xixaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">aro'o affebaaxxe melaalle'ana nossaaka affebaaxxa hadi reyeexxa oosuwwa'a mararabaan; duuchchiingi ardi Mageno ege'nebaakenna ajajemabaake kadeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">mitte mitte manjki haaso'a'neexxi xaqaro callan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:17" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Tinni duuchcha kaddee'naa Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi mufe qiiddebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">tennexxee anga isixxi insa'nee ganaate qophphefatteexxen.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Ardiinxi fuggo ha'yitammaxxee giirashshaten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">iitti giiranna qu'muudotanna utet ittaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:18">Gongomiinxa haqqenna ittaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">wiliille, iimi'a tuqu tuqu hitaaxxi toggi hiyye urreechcho fakkattan.<verse eid="ISA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti mufatenaa'n kexxeexxa butta itendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">ardikinna bogi giddo duuchcha giirate'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:19">Ha'yishendammaxxe haqqeshsha gubataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">dayyo ifika marara dande'aak ayyinna hedheba'a.<verse eid="ISA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Mitte gamanaa'ni goddinaa qico'n indaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">yaane kinni solo'i insa'nenaa'n ke'abaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:20">Iittanni wele ga'mii'n tuqanta'n indaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">yaane kinni goddinabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:20">Mitti mittingi ifixxe ooseka maala midde indaa qico'ni gennaan.<verse eid="ISA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Tinninna Minaasek ardi Efireemike arda'n ke'aan, Efireemikinna Minaaseke arda'n ke'aani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">lamiinge minik ardi mitteba higeexxi Yihudake arda'n duulaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:21">Tinni duuchcha kadda'naa'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi mufe qiiddebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">tennexxee anga isixxi insa'nee ganatee qophpheefateeshshanni hexxeen.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />Dhugaa gorsatika seera fulcha'neeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:1">arda anka miiccaaxxa aada fulchitinaake insa'ne'a aanne!<verse eid="ISA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />Hiyyeeyye seera affebaashsha assaakee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">miicemeek ank ardi dhugaa alfabaashsha assaake</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:2">Aro'i reyeexxa melaallenna saamakiri'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">nossaaka affebaaxxa hadi reyeexxa oosexxa karra hunnatti adhdhaakeri'a aanne.<verse eid="ISA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Tenne ha'nooxxe fuggoxxe huje'a duuchchi'a Mageni ha'noo xixaaxxa yanna ma assitinaa laati?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">Bayyike boginaa'n manna iyyedagee ha'noo ganaashsha assanno wodda maa kaddina?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:3">Ha'no gargaro'a ayyiba martina?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">Karra ha'nooxxa haba sho'exxina?<verse eid="ISA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Booji'ematenaa'ninnaa shiyematenaa'n hitta gattinata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">tinni duuchchi kaddee'naa Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi mufe qiiddebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">tennexxee ha'noo ganatee anga isixxi qophphi hiteeshshanni hexxe.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asooriki Moyaanji Mageniinka Loliinke Miya Kadee qico</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti, hiyya'nee qici, «Anxe mufe'a siqqo kadeekee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:5">anke xixichchi'a kuti anga isixxe'n hedheeke, Asoori'a aane atti'a!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:24-27">Isa. 14:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:1-3:19">Nah. 1:1—3:19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Sof. 2:13-15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Karra insa'neexxa saame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">arda ori giddixxe dhoqqeeshsha hirbeessinaashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:6">Mageno ege'nebaake ardiba'a isoo ergannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">anee mufachchiiseeke arda'n Asoori'i ke'isse ergannon» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Insa'ne kinni konne yaada anfebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">hedumi insa'neeki giddo hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:7">Yaane kinni heduma isika balleessatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">yaadi kinni henookee kadebaaki gosa gosaka arda biroo'aatten.<verse eid="ISA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Tennexxe moyaanji insa'neeki hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:8">«Loliinka manna ajanja'neeki duuchchi moyanjuwwakebaa?<verse eid="ISA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />Kalinooka, Karikeemishshika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:9">Hamaatikanna Arifaadika qachchuwwa injifateennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:9">Semaariyanna Demasiqo anga ibilseennen.<verse eid="ISA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Iyyerusaaleminna Semaariya magenoonfantammaxxa fakkuwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:10">laakkossiki saxxaaxxa fakkuwwa afeexxa mootummuwwaka moyanjuwwa injifatennen.<verse eid="ISA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />Semaariyanna isexxa fakkuwwa birenneshshann</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:11">Iyyerusaalemi'ninna ise giddo magenoonfanta'neexxa fakkuwwa biraabo'noo?» hiyyaan.<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Iyyerusaalemi'ninna Tsiyoonixxe kooba'n hana iyyedagonna'a hedennaxxa duuchcha birennechchi uduma Asoorik moyanji holleexxe holla duuchchi'a isoonna ganannon. <verse eid="ISA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Asooriki moyanji holla'n hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">« ‹Tenne duuchcha anten anxe hunnani assennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">ani jabaken, beekakenna qaroten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">Gosa gosaxxe mootummuwwaxxa gaballuwwa diige birennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">Tuu'lineemmaxxa karra duuchchanna adhdhennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">ookkone boguwwika arda duuchcha anxe jannummanni salphisennen.<verse eid="ISA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Manji anga ifixxa ci'atike miniba'a wirri assammaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">aninna iittanni anga anxa buttatixxi mootummuwwixxe karrabaa wirri assenne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Manji waalmeeka quuphphe bukki assammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">aninna iittanni butta duuchcha bukka assennen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Ayyinna keela ifika le'miseek hedhemaba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">afo'okanna haanni hiyye raareke hedhemmaba'a› » hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Maxirabi isinni haqichcho qinxammake manji iimi darre hedhee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">Magaaze isenni haqichcho daramaake manji iimi darree hexxee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:15">Iittanni siqqichcho isee abixxammake manjo'n hunnata dandeetabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">Zange heqichchoke kaddeebaashsha ifi saadama qicishshaten.<verse eid="ISA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Tennexxee Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">fuffurdallamma loliinke manna'ni qa'lise biraaka dhukuba ibisaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:16">Bisi insa'neeki giddo giiratishsha gubaaka eebinjo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">wocci assaan.<verse eid="ISA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />Isira'eeli ifi giirate kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:17">iikki Woyyichchinna bubenjoke kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:17">Mitte barra giddonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:17">eettene qu'mudonna ute giira ittaan.<verse eid="ISA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Jabaxxi dhibo manjo yaayyisse'e shiltammashsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">yo'oshsha biifeeka gongominna shamoki huccinaammaki fichchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">lubbotannaa maala haranga balleessaan.<verse eid="ISA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Gongomi giddo gattaaxxe haqquwwaxxe hee'no'manaa'n kexxeexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:19">oosichchi belti midde tenne haqquwwa laakko'e borreessa dande'aan.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shiixxoke Mannixxa Higa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />Eettene yaana ba'netenaa'n gatemmaki Isira'eeliki ardi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">Ya'iqoobike ardinaa'n gateek</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:20">Ta'anni edi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">insa'ne'n miidhemaake Asoorika manna addata waale;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:20">Eettene bakka Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n woyyichcha Isira'eelike Mageno'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">dhugaati addatan.<verse eid="ISA 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Hafe gateek manni illee iima higaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:21">Isira'eelke ardana'ni ba'netenaa'n gantemmaki Lumoke Magenibaa higaan.<verse eid="ISA 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Tee Isira'eeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">atike ardiki laakkossi abbayyaati maanchishsha bira sa'eeke kadolenna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:22">Insa'ne giddii'ni gateke calla higaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">ardake'ne lumoxxinna dhugaatixxe kaddeexxi ba'ne murnde'en.<verse eid="ISA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Ee! Dada Duuchcha Ajajake Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:23">mureexxa ba'ne boga duuchcha'n iyyedagaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:27">Rom. 9:27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Asoori Mura Woxisaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:24">Hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">Tsiyoonii'n hedheeka lumoka arda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:24">«Edo Gibtseeki manni ha'noo miicemmashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">ha'noo miidheeka Asoorika manna sodaatinoqqe.<verse eid="ISA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Shiixxooxxe yanna uduma ha'no'ni mufateennaxxa mufe balleefatannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:25">ookkonechchi uduma insa'nee birannoni.<verse eid="ISA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />Ani Dada Duuchcha Ajajannoki Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Herebike kinji bira Midiyaamika manna assenneshshani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">insa'nee halngeti ganaannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:26">Gibtseeka manna'n assemmashshanni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">siqqichcho ifixxa wodu'uwwake'n qophphi assaan.<verse eid="ISA 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />Eettene barra insa'neexxa ba'o dugummo atixxenaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">qanbara insa'neekanna atixxe qucenaa'n ke'aan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:27">Atike furdinnenaa'n kexxeexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">iikki qanbar enqemaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naaphi Lole Miidhdhee Qico</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Naaphiinki sannachchi Ayike qachchiba geye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:28">Migironi giddii'ni sa'aa woddanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:28">miya ifika ookkoo uggudhdhe.<verse eid="ISA 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Ora ookkone qaxxaamure hinaa qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">«Gebayi'n kaanbe oltine gallannon»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:29">Raamak qachchi duuchchi alayye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">moyanjo Sa'oolike qachcha'n Gibi'a hedhaak duuchchi baajje.<verse eid="ISA 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Koo Gaalimike arda! Raarre!,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:30">Layyishshake arda! Laqqe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:30">Anaatootike manna hiissichcho uwwe!<verse eid="ISA 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Madimeenahi lubbo gato'a baqake'n hedhenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:31">Gebeemik ardinna sho'omo'a gonga'neen.<verse eid="ISA 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Telcho naaphi Noobike qachcha'n geyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">anga insa'neexxa Iyyerusaalemike qachcha kadeexxe tullichcha'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:32">Tsiyoonixxe beltoxxe kooba'n afo'o fulchedhati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">qubichcho tonge.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">lumoxxe hunnanni damuwwa kurkuuraan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:33">Lumolla haquwwanna fottoqqaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">qeerraramma haqquwwanna ibbaan.<verse eid="ISA 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />Gongomiinxa haqqe qoceti kakkaaran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:34">Libaanoosinna isixxe hunna edo ibaan.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Nage'i Callixxa Mootumma</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Isseyike tutunjonaa'n kichcho fuldaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:1">isike hiddanaa'ninna mitte dame gumma gummissa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:5">Wal. 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:16">22:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki Hafuuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">beekkumiinkinna qalbeefatatiki hafuuri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">gorsatikinna hunnatiki hafuuri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">ege'natikinna Duuchchi Wooddika Gootta sodaatatiki hafuuri iso'n hedhaan.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />Isinna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ajajemeexxee gammadaan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 11:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:3">Ille isixxi uuddeeshsha murabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:3">yookaan mansha isixxi laqqeeshsha woxabaan.<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />Yaane kinni dhugaati hiyyeeyyetee muraan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">gargaarsa affebaake gamo kadee seera heqqisaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">Isike ajajinni ardakee murte uwwendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">isike afo'inninna fuggaalleeyye balleessaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:8">2 Tes. 2:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />Qullumma isike sabbata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:5">xuurameesumma isike hidhixxe hiiton.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe. 6:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Yayyetinna gedhebi buruusinni welt mitteba hexxaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">qeedhanchi re'eti mitteba ciissaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">Jabbetinna harade mitteba dheendaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">belti shiixxoki jabbetanna harade mitteba bobbaasa'nee allalaan.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Lalikinna Dibi hiyyemaak biniichchi mitteba bobba'aani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">laliinxi jabbenna Dibixxi beltanna mitteba ciissaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">neeqquwwi qotiyotishsha hicace itaan.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Ununixxi anno bofiinxe bale bira geebbaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:8">ununa waaleki beltinna buutetixxe bale'n anga ugga'ni geeban.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Mageniinxe woyyitte kooba'n weli miidhaachchi hedhabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">abbaayya wedi'ik wo'mittammashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">Butta duuchcha Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ege'nati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">wo'mitaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:25">Isa. 65:25</ref>. </char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:14">Imb. 2:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Reyotenaa'n Gateeki Boga insa'neekiba'a Hinge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />Eettene yanna Isseyixxe Daawwitixxe sanneki ardi gosa gosak ardi beesisake kadaan. Gosa gosaki arduwwi isoo hasa'nee ulfeessaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:12">Rom. 15:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ISA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />Eettene yanna'ni Dada Duuchchiki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti mittele ifixxe hunnanni hujete'ni ke'aan. Tinninna Asoorike, Gibtseeke, Phaxxiroosike boguwwi giddo: Tophiyiinke, Elaamike, Babiloonii'ni, Hamaatikenna iittanni abbaayyatike qarqarike boguwwi giddonna hiddichchuwwi duuchchi giddo hedheeka gatemmaka ifika arda boga insa'neekiba'a hiissaan.<verse eid="ISA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />Isi mootummuwwatee beesisa uurrisaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">Isira'eelinaaa'n shorremeeka ille iima hiisse iyyedagaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:12">Xexxeremeeka Yihudika arda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">shooliinge buttatike kasanaa'n bukki assaan.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Ookkonechchi uduma Efireemik ardi Yihuda'ni abixxemmaka elobaaka yaada waalaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">Yihudanna Efireeminni naaphiinsha weli uudanna uurrissaan.<verse eid="ISA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />Insa'ne dhidhimi darre'n Filisixeemike gooddo adadde me'inaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">lamiing mitteba hingeexxi borote'n hedheeka arda saammaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:14">Eedoomi'ninna Mo'aabi'n anga qophphi assinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">Amoonik ardinna insa'ne'n hiremaan.<verse eid="ISA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti jabaxxe diidallonni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">Gibtseexxe abbaayyaka suuxxichcha wode'e bassaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">Anga ifixxanna Efiraaxxisike galaana'n qophphi asse ganeexxi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">torbaane shiixxara muummeke wede'e asse</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">Qoodaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:12">Wal. 16:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Isira'eeli Gibtsee'n fuldee wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:16">kaddemmashshanna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:16">Asoorinaa'n gateek hafe ardi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:16">ora insa'ne'a qophpheessaan.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Galatinxa Faaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />Eettene barra, hitato qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">«Ee, Duuchchi Woddik Goottaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">Edi baro'ni no'o'n mufatteettani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">Ta'a kinni mufe waldettexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">no'o dayyeessitettexxe atee galateefataannen.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />Kunnise Magen anjire no'oxxen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">iso'n adatannaxxee anee sodachchisaachchi hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anxe hunna anxe faaron</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">isinna anxe anjira kade'een»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:2">Fula. 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:14">Far. 118:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Ane fayyisaake wedi'iinxe gammashshoti ikki'litinaan.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />Eettene barra hitinaa qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">«Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galateefatte! Summa isikanna ulfeesse!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">Isi asseexxa gosa gosake arduwwi giddo haaso'we!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">Hittee qico lumoke kadeexxa lasse!<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />Lumolluwwa yaane assemmaxxee Duuchchi Woddika Gootta faarse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:5">tinni lumolluwwa yaane butta duuchcha'n ege'nendaashsha asse.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Ha'no Isira'eeliki ardaa ililisse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:6">Gammashshoti faarse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:6">oddo ha'nooxxe'n hedheeke Isira'eelik Woyyichchi lumoken» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Babilooni Xixaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Amootsiki belti Issayaasi Baabiloonixxee uudeexxa yaane;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1—14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:1-15">Isa. 47:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:1-51:64">Erm. 50:1—51:64</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />Mittilchinna latabaaxxe koobaxxe xungo'ni hana beesisa fannisse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">hafuura ha'nooka gikki assitineexxi raarre;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:2">Babiloonike galchatike manniba'a e'yinammaxxe hulaba'n e'yinaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">angati akeekke.<verse eid="ISA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />Anxe injifachcho'n gammaddaaxxa woyyoole ajajaannen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:3">mufe anxanna muunxaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:3">anxa jannoolle ye'eennen.<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Koobuwwatenaa'n hedheka heddo ardike cancishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">laqenda'neexxa raarre laqqe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">Mootummuwwati giddonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">lumoke ardike hafuurishsha hedheeka hoga laqqe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">isika sannachcha lolakee qophphesa'neen.<verse eid="ISA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ifixxe mufeka loliinka mi'ya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">ookkone boga duuchcha balleessatee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:5">Bayyi boginaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">iimatike kasinaa'n dage'een.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />Dada Duuchcha ajajaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi barra gelteen woo! Woo! Hitinaa'n oodhdhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:6">duuchiinxa dande'aakenaa'n ba'ne daggaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:15">Iyu. 1:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Tennexxe anguwwa duuchcha naaafake kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:7">mitti mittinge manjixxi qalbe sodaate culphisaan.<verse eid="ISA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Weekensha insa'ne'n daggaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">wixxirrinnaa ciniinto insa'ne'n geltaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">ciniifattammaxxe manjichchoshsha ciniifantaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:8">Alaayyik weli weli uundaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">alb insa'neek alaayyik kashiloke kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Kunnise Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi barra shiqqeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">butta duwwi gatiso'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:9">Ise giddo hexxeexxa cubbaalleeyyenna balleesso'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">balatinna jabaxxe mufenni dagaan.<verse eid="ISA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Mitte urjenna isek sannachchuwwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">ifa uutaba'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:10">Arishshotinna fuldeenge hirba'n dukkanda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">ageenjikinna ifa uwwabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hiz. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat. 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-25">Mar. 13:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luq. 21:25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Wal. 6:12-13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />Butta fuggo isexxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">fuggaalleessa manna cubbo insa'nexxe xixannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:11">Hollaameeyyetixxa ifi dukanna gatisannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">mararte afeebaaka mannixxa ifi saadanna salphisannon.<verse eid="ISA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Manjo ca'itte worqe caala fiixxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:12">Ofiirixxe worqe caalanna quba sa'eeke assannon.<verse eid="ISA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Tennexxe Dada Duuchcha Ajajannoki Duuchchi Woddiki Goottixxe bala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">isixxi mufenna bubbaaxxa barra</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:13">Iimuwwa le'misannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">buttatanna isexxa bakkanaa'n shekesheke assannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Dada. 19:24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Adamendeexxe geedummshasha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">allalisanjo afebaake gedhebishsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:14">Mitti mittingi manji ifike ardiba'a higginaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">mitti mitting ififike bogiba'a baajaan.<verse eid="ISA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Booji'eeke duuchchi otema</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:15">abidemeek duuchchinna wolaantichchik shiyema.<verse eid="ISA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />Ille insa'neexxi unda'naanni annoole insa'neexxi hoocendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:16">mine insa'neeka saamemaani; are insa'neexxinna hunnat diinphaan.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />Kunnise birretike sibilji insa'nee maachchonna lababaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">worqete'ninna gammadabaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">Meedoonika manna insa'ne'n ke'issannon.<verse eid="ISA 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Gabe insa'neexxi dargaggeeyye birtaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">annooletanna waaldabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">ille insa'neexxi ooseteenna mararabaan.<verse eid="ISA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Mootummatike seesa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">Kalaadayike mannike ifi saada</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:19">Kaddeexxa Baabiloonii'i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">Mageni Sooddoomishshannaa Gomorashsha fonqolchaan.<verse eid="ISA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />Ise giddonna baro duuchcha'n ofo'laak hedhebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">ise giddo hedhaakinna hedhabaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:20">Arabiink manni ookko dunkaana ifika oltabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">allalisanji ore ifika okko bobbaasabaan.<verse eid="ISA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Yaane kinni qiilla gammoojjek biniinchi okko ciisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">jeedaluwwi okko hedheeke minuwwa'n wo'maan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:21">Urunguwwa ookko hexxaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">qiilla gammoojjexxe re'e labbaak duriis ookko burraaqaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:14">Isa. 34:14</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:14">Sof. 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">Wal. 18:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Woraabesuwwi ookko hedheeke kinjuwwike mini giddonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">ookko hedheek jeedaluwwinna danchoomeke mootomatike mini giddo ookko hedhee raraan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:22">Yanna isexxinna sheqqexxeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">barra isexxinna qeerrexxabaan.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Isira'eeliki Ardi Ifike Bogibaa Higaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Ya'iqoobi'a mararaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">Isira'eelinna haaroba fi'laan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">insa'nee boga insa'neegi giddo galchaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:1">Alagikinna insa'nenni welti hedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">Ya'iqoobike ardinninna welt mittek kandaan.<verse eid="ISA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Gosa gosak ardinna insa'nee adhdhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">insa'neenna insa'neexxe bakkaba iyyemarraan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:2">Isira'eeli ardi gosa gosaka arda geegoke assedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">Duuchchi Woddike Goottike boga'n labbakenna meyyake garba assedhe insa'ne galchaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:2">Insa'ne booji'emaaka boojinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">insa'nee miicemmakanna galchinaan.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babiloonike Moyanjixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atixxe wixxirrinaa'n atixxe rakko'naninna atixxe jabaxxe garbummanaa'n atee hafuura adhisseexxa barra. <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />Baabiloonike moyanjo'n gacifata'n hitinaa qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:4">Iikki miicaa'n hitta gate!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:4">isixxi irbo ibisanna hitta baxxe.<verse eid="ISA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti fuggichchixxa zange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:5">galchaluwwiinxa bokko enqe'een.<verse eid="ISA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />Ardi kuta belo mufet ganemaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:6">mararte belo shorrishaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:6">cancaqemaakanna eenqe'een.<verse eid="ISA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Butta duuchcha nage'akannaa afuura adhdha alfite'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:7">gammashshotixxa faaronna lolaasa'neen.<verse eid="ISA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Hineesikinnaa Libaanoosik birbirsuwwi midde gammadeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">«Ati salphattettexxe barranaa'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:8">Haqqe karamma manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">qoce ifixxenni no'oba dagebaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />Ati daggette wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">wiidda dhi'mo atee qophedhatee qophphi hiteen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">Atee qophexxo'a reyemmake mannixxi ekedha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">butta duuchcha galchammakara duuchcha lele'mise'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">Gosa gosake arduwwa'n moyemmaka moyanjuwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">insa'ne moote insa'neexxenaa'n dirrise'een.<verse eid="ISA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Kunniir duuchchi ate'n hiissine haasonna'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:10">«Atinna no'oshshanni hunna gophpheetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:10">no'onde kaddeette» hine.<verse eid="ISA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Atik ulfinni atike lumoke kiraarike hafuurinni welt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">wiidda dhiimoba'a dhidhime;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:11">Oolo ati hunda fayende'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">coroquwwatinna atixxe buyyeccatixxe seemma kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />Ati soodimariinke belto koo bakkalcha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">hitta iimii'ni ibbette</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:12">Koo ati qara moyanjuwwa salphissetteke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">hitta butti'a huneddette!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:10">Wal. 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:1">9:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />Ati godoba ati giddo hitette qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">«Ani iima me'eennen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">Moote anxanna Mageniinxe urjuwwa iimi darre assedheennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">koobatixxe bukkixxe bakka'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">Woyyitte koobaxxe xungo'n, moote anxe'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">ofo'lannon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Midda mugenuw bukki hiyyamaxxe kooba'ni hiyyaake hiyyichchi giddo 1. Magenuwa hiyyaki hyyichci heddo dharchcha magenuwa magenofata'neke Bablonke arike magenuwa male'e dhugatike Magenokeban 2, magenuwi bukki hiyyemaxxe kooba'n hiyyaki kinn insa'ne ifi'a heddamaqico kmale'e insa'neki magenuwi bukki hiyyamaxxi addite kooba hexxemabani. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Duumanchuwwi iimi ga'ma sa'anno</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:14">ifinna Dada Duuchchike Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Mageno assanno.»<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Yaane kinni hundi wiidda'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:15">dhi'mo bale'n dhidhinde'etten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:23">Mat. 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:15">Luq. 10:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Atee uudaak duuchchi dho'o hiyye uudaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">mancira hiyyoti, atixxee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:16">«Iikki butta le'misemmakinna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">motummuwwa shekesheke assemmak konne manjomma?<verse eid="ISA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />Butta duuchcha qiilla gammoojje assee'emmaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">qachchuwwa diige'emmak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">booje'ememmak manni ifike bogaba'a me'abaashsha hoyyeemmak konnetamma?» hinaani.<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Gosa gosake arduwwiki moyanjuwwi ulfinnik reyedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:18">duuchchiing ifi fike mooggi giddo moogemedheen.<verse eid="ISA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Ati kinni gibendeexxe dameshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">mooggokenaa'n fuldettexxi hunendeetten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">Wolaantichchik otememmake mannishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">dhi'motixxe kino hundi darre sa'emmakiirishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">shiyeemeke manni hunda buqende'etten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">Hirbeessemeeke renshishshanna kaddeetten.<verse eid="ISA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />Ati insa'nenni welti mooggi giddo hexxabexxon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">Butta balleessiteetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">arduwwakanna birteexxen.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 14:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">Fuggoxxa assaakerixxi sanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">haranga qalli hiyyendaba'a.<verse eid="ISA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />Insa'ne ke'neexxi butta dhaalabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">butta duuchcha'ninnaa qachchuwwa ifika wonshinabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:21">Annuwwa ifikixxe cubboxxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">isixxi labbaxxi oose dulendaaxxa bakka qophpheessine.<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Babilooni Balleessaaxxa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />«Insa'ne'ni ke'annon»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">hiyya'nee Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:22">«Summa isikanna hafe iseka manna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">horte isixxanna ila isixxa Babiloonii'n qurbi assannon»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />«Ani Babiloonii dhaaddotike galdumixxe bakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:23">caffa'atike boga assannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:23">Ba'netike fiiyisanjinninna ise fiyannon»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:23">hiyya'neen Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Asoorika Manna Bakka Balleessaani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti, hiyye kakatee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:24">«Hedenneshsha dhugaaten muuxendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:24">hedenneshshanna kaddaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:5-34">Isa. 10:5-34</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:1-3:19">Nah. 1:1—3:19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Sof. 2:13-15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />Asoorika manna anke bogi giddo bulleessannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">anxe kooba iimanna hirbeessannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:25">Baabiloonik qanbarinna anke ardinaa'n ke'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">ba'a isexxinna dugummo insa'neexxenaa'n dirritaan.»<verse eid="ISA 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Butta duuchchi'a hedeek yaadi konneten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:26">gosa gosake ardi duuchchiba'aanna diriirisendeexxi anga tennete.<verse eid="ISA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hedee qici iittaten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">aate iso ille iima hiissa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:27">Anga isixxinna diriirrite'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">aate ise'e ille iima hiissa?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Filisixxeemika Manna Biraaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />Moyanji Akaazi reyeexxe wogga'n wabeekichcho Isayyaasi haaso'eki Mageniink jechchi konnechchinni butti'a hedheken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:20">2 Moy. 16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:27">2 Odo. 18:27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />Ha'no koo Filisixxeemike arda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">ha'no gandeexxi siqqo enqendemmaxxee ha'no duuchching mee gamadde;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:29">Bofakenaa'n buute ilndaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">iseke quuphphinaa'ninna keelik ke'aak ha'latike bofi ilemaan.<verse eid="ISA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Hiyyeeyyetike hiyyeessi belti la'ataachcho afaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">rakkiyyetinna nage'ik diinphaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:30">Atika hidda kinni ani solo'ik shiyannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">atixxa gateexxa hafenna birannon.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />Tee, Huluwwa uurritine oodhdhe! Koo qachchi giddo hexxineekeera uu, uu hiyye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">koo Filisixxeemike manna duuchching soda'ati baqqe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:31">Duumanchi middii'n ate'n dage'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">googessakenaa'n fule gataak hedhebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Erm. 47:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Hiz. 25:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu. 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo. 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Sof. 2:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Zek. 9:5-7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />Ookkone ardibaa'n ergeme dagaake erganjuwwi maa hiissichcho uwwema?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">hiissichchi «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Tsiyooni'i jaare'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:32">Rakko adhdhemmak ardinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">Tsiyooni giddo golla alfe'een» hiyyaaken.<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mo'aabixxee Kulemeeka Raaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Mo'aabixxee haaso'emeek hiyyichchi konneechchinni butta hedheeken:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Eerikinna Qiiriki qachchuwwi mitte barra'n diigeme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">Mo'aabik boginna one gatte!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1—16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">Isa. 25:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Erm. 48:1-47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8-11">Hiz. 25:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo. 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Sof. 2:8-11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Dibooniki ardinna galmiba'a me'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">oodho'aanna tulloti iimi'a qabate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">Mo'aabik ardi Neebawixxenna, Medaabike qachchi'a lumoshsha yaada'n oodhaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:2">Umokanna qunqumemeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">areeduwwakanna haaxxineen.<verse eid="ISA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Insa'nenna ora ora'ninni dooniyatixxa seemma oddo'ween;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">fooqete'ninna weldeenate'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:3">Duuchchiinge oodhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">indiddo fixe'naan.<verse eid="ISA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Haseebonikinna Eli'aalek ardi oodhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">oodhishsha insa'neexxinna Yahaatsi qico'n laqisaan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:4">Tennexxee Mo'aabik loliinki manninna raare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">godobi insa'neekinna raafeme.<verse eid="ISA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Mo'aabike ardixxe mitte godobinni oodhaaneen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">baqateek isek ardinna Tso'aari qico'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">Egila Shelshi qico'n baanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Insa'ne indiddo coccosina'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">Luuhitixxa tarba qabante fulle;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Insa'nenna Horonayimike ora'ninna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">balleessa ifixxe'a ke'issine haasonna'n oo'ne.<verse eid="ISA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Nimiirixxi muummuwwanna baggeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">qarqarake'n hexxemmaxxi badda'uwwatinna qoorte'en</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:6">Hiddichchuwwikinna ba'een</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">hanjaachcho hiyyemaachchi hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="ISA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Tennexxee insa'ne anfemmaxxa karra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:7">anfemachcho duuchcha Ahaayyak galaan widdi'a ba'e'ne foossinaan.<verse eid="ISA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Raare insa'neexxinna Mo'aabike bogixxe gabala qico'n laqissaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">hunbaashsha insa'neexxinna Egilayimi qico'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">insa'neke abarixxi oodhishsha Bi'eeri'eelimi qico'n gelteen.<verse eid="ISA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Dimoonike qachchik galaanuwwi mundeti mundete kaddeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">kaddo malee kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Dibonike arda'ni tennee saxxeexxa yaane iyyedagaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:9">Mo'aabii'n baaje fulaakeera'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">ookkone boga'ni gataake manna'n neenqa erge'naa ite biraan.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Qiilla gammoojje wido hexxeexxe Selanaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:1">ookkone bogike galchalli'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:1">Tsiyoonixxe beltoxxe koobaba'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:1">gedhebiinke buruusixxa irbo ergine.<verse eid="ISA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Mine ifikenaa'n shorrendeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">mekki hitemmaxxe ci'ashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:2">Mo'aabixxi melaallenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">Arinoonika galaanixxe foofaba'a iittanni kandaan.<verse eid="ISA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />«Gorsa no'aa uwwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">murte murre;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:3">Barra saafo'a ha'nooxxe gaaddiddonni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">hashshixxe dukkanashsha no'oo golle.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:3">Baajekara sho'we;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">shoremeekara sa'issitine uutinoqqe.<verse eid="ISA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Mo'aabike boginaa'n baaje dagemmaki manni ha'noonni welti hedhowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">insa'nee biro'a dagammake mannanaa'n insa'nee golla kadde.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 16:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Miicammak manni ta'anni edi'a hedhabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">ba'netinna gattaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">rakkisammakirinna ookkone boginaa'n ba'aan.<verse eid="ISA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />Eettene yanna jaalalatixxi mootumma uurritaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">Daawwitixxe sanneenaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">dhugaati muro'a haasaak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:5">Qullummatinna wiinandaashsha assaak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:5">Mitti manjichchi addatensha eettene moote hana ofo'laan.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Mo'aabixxe ifi duka'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">isixxe yo'oshsha ifi saada'annaa holla'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:6">Ane malee hiyya isixxanna wele tuffata isixxa lanqe'ennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">ifi dhaada isixxi kinni toliinxe.<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Tennexxee Mo'aabiki ardi oodhowwaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">duuchching Mo'aabi'a odhowwaali;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:7">Qirheereesi qachchike manna qalli hiyyati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">lumoxxe yaadonni oodhaan.<verse eid="ISA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Haseeboniki fichchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">Sibimaki woyyinetike hiddichchuwwi qoore'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Gosa gosak galchalluwwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">Iyyazeeri sa'eexxi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Qiilla gammoojje qico'n mare geye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">abbaayatiba'a hidda yaalsitemmaxxa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Filendeexxa woyyinetika hiddichuwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">hirbeessine'een.<verse eid="ISA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Tennexxee konne Sibimake woyyinetike hiddichchixxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">Iyyazeeri oodhemmashsha aninna oodhannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Koo Haseeboni, koo Eli'aale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">indiddo anxenni atee corci assannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Gumma gummisseeta wodda hexxemmaxxi gammashshotixxi raare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">midha bukki asecatixxi atixxi mayeexxi gammashsho gatte'een.<verse eid="ISA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Gammashamonna iliilleette eettene hiddichchiinxe bakkabaa'n gate'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">woyyinetike hiddichchixxe bakka'n faarsa hexxeba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">ililisatinna gatte'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">woyyinetinetike miicatike booncho'n hirbeessaak hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">ani hirbeessammake mannika canca balleesseennen.<verse eid="ISA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Tennexxee qalbe anxi Mo'aabike lumoke kiraarsha yaaddotixxe oodhishsha laqisa'neen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:11">giddixxi hedho anxinna Qiirheeressixxee ooxa'neen.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Mo'aabik ardi fakkuwwa magenoofanittammake ifike tullichchuwwibaa qabantoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">la'o alfaaxxi elo callan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">soodachchoteenna ifike gamiba'a e'yoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">isi la'o afeba'a.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mo'aabixxee edo haaso'eeki hiyyichchi konneten. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Ta'a kinni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti «Shiixxoxxe yanna'a maallaqakee manjokee hujaaki mitti manji huje uurrisammashshanni Mo'aabiki ulfinninna heddi isiki ardi sase wogga giddo salphataan; Mo'aabike arda gateeki heenokenna hunna afebaake kadaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Damaasiqoxxee Kulemeeka Raaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Demaasiqoxxee hiyyaa'nee qici, «Kunnise ta'anni edi'a Demasiqoxxi qachchumma gatee'naan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:1">isinna oletixxe tuulo kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Aro'eeriki qachchchuwwi manji hedhabaake ona kadee gataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:2">gedhebikinna lali ookko bobba'aake kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:2">insa'nee sodaachchiisaak hedhaba'a.<verse eid="ISA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Kinjik ijaaremeek qachchi Efireeminaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">mootummatixxa baallenna Demasiqonaa'n gattaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:3">Sooriyake mannixxi hafenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">Isira'eelike gaachchannishsha kaddaan»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">Hiyya'neen Dada duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:23-27">Erm. 49:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo. 1:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1">Zek. 9:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />«Eettene barra Ya'iqoobik lumminni salphataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:4">isike bisik furdinninna shu'mi hiyyaan.<verse eid="ISA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Haamali uurrixxa midha bukki asseexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">haamendemmaxxa angate'n bukki assammashshanni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:5">Tinninna Rafayimixxe dhooqa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">qocendaaxxe deeggeeshsha kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Kaddo malee ejersiink haqichchi uxxemaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">lame yookaan sase gumma dametixxe xongo'n gattammashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:6">Shoole yookaan onde gumma mitte bukki hiteexxe dame'n gattammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">iittanni hee'noxxi deegge gattaan,»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">hiyya'neen Isira'eelik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />Eettene barra manni insa'nee dademmakiba'a uundaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:7">ille insa'neexxinna Isira'eelike woyyichchiba'a uuddaan.<verse eid="ISA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Anga ifixxenni giissinemmake tolchimalchiba'a uundaba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">qubba ifixxenni giissinemmake hixaanike gubisanjuwwiba'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:8">Aheraxxe magenefachchotixxi soodduwwa'anna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">ulfeessinaba'a.<verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />Eettene yanna Isira'eeli lolde miite'naa one gateemmake Hiwaawikenna Amoorake arduwwike qachchuwwishsha ha'nooki jabaki qachchuwwinna one gataan.<verse eid="ISA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Atika anjirallo Mageno deeteetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">golla atika atixxa rassanna qaabbattebexxon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:10">Tennexxee filemeeka hiddichcho kaassottolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">hiri fiixexxa sannenna rokkottole,<verse eid="ISA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />Iitti sanne kaassettxxe barra'n lataashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">rokkotte langa baro daraartaashsha assitettexxe kaddoolenna midde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:11">Iitti midha bukki asseccatixxi maye dhukkubiinxennaa fayyitabaaxxe dhiboxxe barra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">bakka isexxi baxxaan.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Hayi hoola heddo gosa gosake ardixxe mufetik hafuura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">abbaayyatike danbala'ishsha luulaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:12">Hayi hoola manniinxe bira saxxeexxe raaree</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">jabake wodi'iinke luuljishsha gigiwwisaan.<verse eid="ISA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Mannikinna jabake wodi'ik luuljishsha gigiwwisoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">isi insa'nee xixaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:13">Tullichchi hana diidalloti xeeremammake huurishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">hoobonbalteti xeelagemamake korishsha xeeremaan.<verse eid="ISA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Kunnise bogi galgalo'aa wodda dedhange'n weekkensha kadde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">bogi soodeba'a edi darre kinni insa'nenaa'n mittikinna afemeba'a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:14">Saamemmake mannike qoobbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">gudhdhemmake manninna geyaachchi konnende.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Tophphaake Haaso'eeka Hiyyichcho</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Tophiyiinke galaanuwwi qarqara hexxeexxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:1">phirr phirri hiyaake keeluwwik luulji ise giddo laqemaake ookkone bogi'a aanee!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:12">Sof. 2:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />Iikki boginna erganjuwwa ifika abbaayyate'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">galaanuwwi wido qooccetixxe hobolonni ergitaaxxen.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Ha'no butta duuchchik arduwwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">buttate'n hexxineek duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:3">Koobuwwate'n beesis fannisemaa wodda uuddinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">malagati ufuufemaa woddanna laqqinaan.<verse eid="ISA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">«Ani bucuqqi hiyyebe'nok ofo'lannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:4">Galduma ankenaa'n holata arishsho giddo cala cala hiyyammake eebbinjo'inna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">duumanchiinke woja kadee uudannon» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Midha bukki asseccatixxe maye edi darre daraariinxi yanna saxxaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">iikki daraarinna raxxeexxe woyyinetixxe gumma kadaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:5">Woyyinetixxe daalixxa kichcho quqqumamak quqqumaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">barqaaqqemmaxxa damuwwanna kukkuteexxi fuggusaan.<verse eid="ISA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Duuchchiing koobuwwate'n hexxaaxxe bultittaammaxxe ci'a'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">badda'atike biniinchi'anna sa'isssende'e uwwendaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:6">Tinni ci'anna bono duuchcha konnelchuwwa ittaashsha assendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">baddatike biniinchinna haarso duuchcha ita'nee hedhaan.<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />Eettene yanna Dada Duuchcha Ajajaake Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:7">Qeeraarammannaa isik bisik gogi shaqqake kadeeke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">shiqii'ninna bayyii'ninna sodaatemmake ookkone aridinaa'n,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:7">Ookkone jajjabbakennaa laagadi isik aagabaake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">ookkone bogi isikinna galaanuwwi qoqqoodemeexxe mootummanaa'n,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 18:7">Uwwa konne manni'a daggaan; tinni uwwanna dagaabi Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddik Goottik summi hedheeba'a eettene Tsiyoonixxe Koobaba'aten.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Gibtsexxee Haaso'emeeka Mageniinka Hiyyichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Gibtseexxe haaso'emeeki Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi konneechchinni butti'a hedhekeni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Kuniseteni, Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti duumanchake'n hedhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">Gibtse'a rake daga'neen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Gibtseke manni magenooffatammaxxi fakkuwwa isi edo rankitaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">Gibtseki ardinna sodaate culphisaan;<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />«Gibtseeke boga'ni ardi weli'aani weli lolaaki bagedi ke'aashsha assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">dayyi dayyonge'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">olla'i olla'aange'ni naaphake kade ke'aashsha assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">qachchuwwi qachchuwwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">moyaanji moyaanjuwwa naaphake kade lolaan.<verse eid="ISA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Gibtseeki manni hophpholaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">hendeemmaki heduminna muuxemabaashsha assannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:3">Ookkone wodda magenooffantammaxxi fakkuwwa insa'nee gargarto'a morsiilsnaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">ekedha haasossammake manniba marre mari'aantaan; ekedhuwwatenaa'n qorte laqe'naan.<verse eid="ISA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />Insa'nee mararabaake moyaanjixxe angaa'n sa'isse uwwannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">Ani Dada Duuchcha Ajajannoki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti» tenne haaso'ennen hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Abbaayyike galaani wodi'i xe'yaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:5">galaanikinna laana laana bagaan;<verse eid="ISA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Wodi'uwwi bobaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:6">Gibtseke boga'n dareeriki gorsinemmaki wodi'i laana laana xe'ya'ni bagaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:6">baaranguwwanna qooccuwwatinna qortaan.<verse eid="ISA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />Abbaayike galaani qarqara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">hedheeki hiddichchuwwi duuchchi bagaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:7">Galaani qarqara hujendeexxi midha duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">baggee'naa diidallo adhdhitaan.<verse eid="ISA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Qulxume'e abixxammki manni yaadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">Abbaayike galaananaa'n malnxaqqoti qulxu'me darbedhammak duuchchi oodhaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:8">Wodu'uwwi hana manxaqqo darbedhaakiir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">hunna insa'neexxi gophaan.<verse eid="ISA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Fuutta suqa'n giissammakiir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:9">qa'lake shimalinni haarre hiyyendaaxxa seemma ganammakiir shookaan.<verse eid="ISA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Seemma ganammakiir mekki hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:10">runda adhdhamakirinna yaada'ne oodhdhani.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Tso'aanke qachchiki moyanjiki jaliqabuwwi haranga gowwoleten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">beettote hiyyemaaki Gbitseke moyanjiki gorsalluwwi isoo woyyifulabaaka gorsa gorsineeni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:11">Hittata insa'nee moyanjo «No'o beettoten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">hundii'ninni moyaanjumma sanne no'oxenaa'ni daggeexxeni»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">hitta hitina?<verse eid="ISA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Koo Gibtseeke moyaanjoo! Iikki beeki gorsalluwwi habate hedhe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:12">Gbitse'ni hedeeka yaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">ha'no'n leellishaqqata; kulaqqata?<verse eid="ISA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Tso'aaniki jaliqabuwwi gowwe'eeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:13">Memifisiki akeekisanjuwwi sobeme'en;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:13">Ardake umoke hiyyemeeki gorsalluwwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:13">Gibtse'e dedhise'en.<verse eid="ISA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti dillo'atika hafuura insa'ne'ni dune'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">machcho'alli honqo'emmaxxe honqo'o qarara tinitimammashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:14">Gibtsee assitaxxe yaane duuchcha'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">tinnidaashsha assineen;<verse eid="ISA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Dureessake kado hiyyeessi, gurra fuleeke kado yookaani ege'nemebaaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:15">mitte yaannenna Gibtsee'a assa dande'aaxxi hexxebaan.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gibtsexxee Kulemeeka Raaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />Gibtseeki ardi sodaate meyyaxxe kadaaxxi yanna daggaan. Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti insa'nee xixo'a hunnati ke'aa wodda sodaante culphinsaan; <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Yihuda Gibtseeka arda sodaachchisaake kadaan; Yihuda summa ganaa wodda midde lummoshsha weekemmaan; tinninna kaddaachchi Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti insa'nee xixo'a qophpheefatexxa ege'nemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="ISA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />Eettene yannaa'n Gibtseeke bogi giddo hedheeki ondi qachchuwwi Ibraawwika laagada haaso'aan; ookko hedhaaki arduwwi kakataa wodda Dada Duuchcha Ajajaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni kakantaan; konne qachchuwwanaa'n mitti «Arishshotike qachcha» hiyyemaan.<verse eid="ISA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />Eettene yanna'n Gibtseeke bogi giddo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolchimalcho giissemaan; iittanni Gibtsexxe gabala'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a foyendeexxi sooddo kaasendaan. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Insa'nenna Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Gibtseke bogi giddo hedheexxa beesisake kandaan; ookko hedheeki arduwwi rakko insa'ne'n gelteema wodda Duuchchi Woddikal Gootta lanqa wodda insaa'nee anjiraaka ergaan; isinna naphuwwakenaa'ni insa'nee gatisaan. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Gibtseeke ardi'a ifi leellishaan; eettene yanna insa'nenna isi Duuchchi Woddike Gootta kadeexxa egenne isoo magenooffaantaan; uwwanna tolcha isi'a shiqinshaan; werreengemmak werreega duuchchanna muunxaan. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Gibtseeka manna mura woxisaan; yaane kinni wirri hiyye insaa'nee fayyisaan; isiba'anna wirri hinee hingaan; isinna sodaachcho insa'neexxa laqeexxi insa'nee fayyisaan.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />Eettene yanna Gibtseekinna Asoorike ardiixxe oddo'n ba'laki ori banemaani; konne lame bogiki ardi elqe kayyanni mammaremaan; lamiinge bogiki ardi mitteba magenooffataani. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />Eettene yanna'n Isira'eeli Gibtsee'ninna Asoori'ni lebende sakkake boga kaddaan; kunni sase bogiki ardi butta duuchchike ardi'a eebbatixxe kaddaan. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti «Ha'no Gibtsee giddo hexxineek anki ardi, daxxeenneke Asoorike ardanna fi'leenke Isira'eelika arda ani ha'noo eebbisennen» hiyyaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:2-26">Erm. 46:2-26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:1-32:32">Hiz. 29:1—32:32</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Duwwi Me'eeke Wabeekika Beesisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />Asoorike moyanjo kadeexxi moyemmake Sargoonike ajajinni Asooriki loliinke manniki ajajalli Ashidoodi hinaaka Filsixxeemika qachcha lole abide; <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />Eettene yanna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Amootsika belto Issayaasi «Kophetanna dooniyatixxa seemma fulcheexxettexxi duwwixxe lekkanni me'i» hiyye ajaje. Issayaasinna ajajemeexxi saalibelo hedhe duwwixxe lekkanni mammarema'nemman. <verse eid="ISA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti, «Erganji anki Issayaasi saalibelo hedhe duwwixxe lekkanni sase wogga duuchcha mammarema'nemman; kunni Gibtsee'ninna Tophiyake'n daggaaxxe yaaneke beesisan. <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />Asoorik moyanji Gibtseeki ardi salphisaashsha dolla buqedhebaangi dargaggeeyyete kadi geedhe saali belonni duwwixxe lekkanni he'nee'naa Gibtsekanna Tophiyiinka arda booji'e adhdhe me'aan. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Tophake'n addatammakinna Gibtsee dhaadatammaki duuchchi sodaante shoonkaan. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />Eettene yanna abbaayyaati qarqara hedhammaki ardi, ‹No'oo Asoorike moyanjonaa'n anjiraani hine addante insa'neeba'a shikki hinenneke bogike arda'ni dageechcho uuddinaa! No'o fa'i hitta gantanno?› » hinaan.<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Baabiloonixxe Ibaaxxee Kulemeeka Raaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Abbaayyati qarqara hexxeexxe qiilla gammoojjexxee haaso'emeek Mageniki hiyyichchi konneechchinni butti'a hedheeken.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:1">Bita'i ga'minaa'n gandaaxxi diidallo duuchchigeechcho filte adhdhitammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:1">sodaachchisaake mitte bogiki manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:1">qiilla gammoojjenaa'n dagaan.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Sodaachchissaaxxa yaane Mageni ane'ni leellishen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">tinninna mitti mitte sa'isse uwwaan; mulqedhammak mulqedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Elaami ke'e; Meedooni qoqqobe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">ise aassitemmaxxa wixxirri assitammaxxa yaane duuchcha gatisannon.<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa hidhi anee kuteme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">ciniintoti rakkattemmaxxe manjichchoshsha rakkatennen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:3">Uudaaneexxi yaane ane sodaachchisse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">laqaaneexxi yaanenna anee mekki assite.<verse eid="ISA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />Godobi anee culphise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">sodaatenaa'n kexxeexxa gilgilenne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:4">Bogi rake hashshaashsha halchenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">anee alaalshitaaxxa yaane malee mitte ani'a woyya hiyyannoxxa gophenne.<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />Ita ha'wa qophphootee'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">keessumma ofoldaaxxi rachchuwwa fayendeemman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">inde ha'wine;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:5">«Ha'no bagediinki jaliqabuwwi! Ke'we;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">Wonte ha'nooxxa fi'witine qophpheessedhdhe!» hiyyaaki ajaji dedhange'n uwweme.<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Konneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:6">«Marte heqqallo ugge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:6">isinna afeexxa haaso'oole.<verse eid="ISA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Fadhadi harkilsaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">sarageelluwa uudaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">Harrenna gaaluwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">gulufaakaara uudaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">Qalbeefatowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">xonxommachchoti qalbeefatowwaal.»<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Heqqanjikinna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:8">«Gootta anke! Ani xellephphote'n barra duuchcha heqqonde'ni uurreennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:8">hashshanna anxe bakka'n hedhenneni» hiyya'ni cance.<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />Kunnise mitti manjichchi fadhado harkissaa'neexxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">gaarenni dage'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Heyye heqqanjikinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">«Baabilooni ibbeeni! Ibbeen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Ardi magenoofatammaxxi fakkuww duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">enqende butta ibbe» hiyya'n lallabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:8">Wal. 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">18:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />Aldumete'n uxxendineeke anke ardaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">Dada Duuchcha Ajajaake Duuchchi Woddike Gootta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:10">Isira'eelike Magenonaa'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">laqenneka hiyyichcho ha'no'ni kulennen.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edoomixxee Kulemeeka Hiyyichcho</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Edoomixxe kulemeeke hiyyichchi konneechchinni butti'a hedheeken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">Mitti manji Seyiirixxe koobanaa'n ye'eexxi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">«Heqqanjoo! Bogi isi haano sooda?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">Heqqallo Soodo'a hitteexxi yanna gatteexxa ane'ni kuli» hiyyaan.<verse eid="ISA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Heqqanjikinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">«Bogi sooda shiqe'een; yaane kinni hashsha wirri hitee dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:12">Higgenna qortotta'a hassottole qorre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">yaane kinni higgene dagge» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arabiinke Bogixxee Kulemeeka Hiyyichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Arabiinke bogi'a kulemeeki hiyyihchi konneechchinni butti'a hedheeken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:13">Ha'no Arabiinxe qiilla gammoojje giddo hexxineek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:13">Dedaan Siraaraxxi daddaltuwwa,<verse eid="ISA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />Dheeboti ha'noobaa dagaakeeri'a wode'e uwwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:14">Ha'noona Teemaake arda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:14">Baqatekee itaachcho uwwe.<verse eid="ISA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Ardi wolaantichchokenaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">luqqisemeeke wolantichchinaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">darbatematee aggaamendeexxe gabenaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">eebbeeke bagedinaa'n banje'een.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ane'ni hiyyee qici, «Hujjaluwwi hujetike anninni hujetee weli aagemmaxxi barra geltoole huje uurrisammashshanni mitte wogga giddo Qeedarixxe gosaki luminni gataan; <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Qeedarike looliinke mannanaa'n gataaki shiixxoke mogidik lolammake mannan. Tennee haaso'eneki ante Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Magenon.»<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyerusaalemixxxee Kulemeeka Hiyyichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />«Waleellatixxa dhooqa» hiyyemaake boonchi'a kulemeeki hiyyichchi konnechchinni butti'a hedheeken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:1">Ha'noo maachchi rakkisammalete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:1">duuchchiingi fooqete'n hana fuldineeki?<verse eid="ISA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Koo ati canci wo'me'eek qachcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">weekenshatikinna fenxeyatike qachcha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:2">Ati giddo shiyemeekiir wolaatichchike reyeekebaata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">bagedoke'n rennebaan.<verse eid="ISA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Atik akeekisanjuwwi duuchchi mitteba baaje'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">mogido midde darbinebaak booji'emmeen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:3">Naaphi iikki bayyanni hedhee'naa baajjineeki duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">abidendineexxi mitteba usurendineen.<verse eid="ISA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Tennexxee «Hiiqqise oodhonnaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">anenaa'n bayyatte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:4">Anke ardixxe ba'ne'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">anee dayyeessitino'a wolaadinoqqe'e» hiyyeneni.<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">leellatixxe dhooqa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">hunbaashshatixxa hirbessematixxannaa weekkematixxa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:5">Dalla'uwwa diigatixxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">koobuwwatiba'a raaratixxa barra afe'een.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Elaamike mogidiinka gonofa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:6">ifika fadhadonna fadhadiinxa gaaruwwa qophpheesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:6">Qiirinna ifixxa wonte dobbe.<verse eid="ISA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Atixxi elollamma dhooquwwa'n atik sarageelluwwi wo'meen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:7">atik fadhadi ookkone qachchixxe huluwwa'n uurre'een.<verse eid="ISA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />Yihudaki dalla'uwwi duuchchi diigemeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">eettene yanna miyiinke mine'n tuulemeeka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">loliinka miya afette.<verse eid="ISA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />Daawwitike qachcha'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:9">ole bira saxxeexxa uudine'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:9">Aadi gamike balleessanaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:9">wode'e candine'en.<verse eid="ISA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Iyyerusaalemi giddo hexxemmaxxa meelalle laakkotineen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:10">dalla'uwwa qammalchatee minuwwa diiggineen.<verse eid="ISA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Olmke baleessanaa'n kadaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">lame dalla'uwwixxe oddo'n wodi'i camemmammaachcho giissitineen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:11">Yaane kinni tenne asseeka uuddinebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">edo hedeexxi hujeekanna qalbeefattinebaan.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />Eettene yanna Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">ooxxinaashshanna hunbaashshitinaashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:12">Umo ha'nooka haaxxitino'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">yaaddotixxa seemmanna oddo'witinaashsha ha'noo ye'ennen.<verse eid="ISA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Yaane kinni xoo'mama galatinna gammashsho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">gedhechchokannaa ha'yeeka saayya duldineen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">maala ittinaa wodda woyinetixxa booka ha'wa hexxeen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:13">«Soodonni rennaannen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">telcho indo ha'wino!» hitineen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Qor. 15:32</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti «Lubboti he'nee qico'n tenne lumoxxe balleessa'a insa'ne'a gattowwaali hiyyendaabaan; tenne hiyyeenneki ante dada duuchcha ajajaanneke Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Magenon» hiyye ane'n kule.<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sheebina'a Uwwendeexxa Xexxe'achchisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:15">«Martettexxi konne mineka umo akeekisanjo Saaminaasii hitatto qici;<verse eid="ISA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />‹Kaba maa assitaatte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">tenne bakka ati ifi'a hirreessink booncho qopheessitottaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">konne qephphina'n moogendattoxxa bakka bocexxe giissexxottaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">renshi atiki hedhaaxxa rassa qottotto'a aate ati'aa eetti uwwe?›<verse eid="ISA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />«Koo ati worba manjo xexxe'ati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:17">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atee jabeesse abido'aanna anga ifixxenni atee qolaancho'aaten.<verse eid="ISA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />Wirisse wirisse buffiinsha atee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">ba'lake bogibaa atee qolaanchaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:18">Ati atike minike goottike salphine kaddatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">ookkonna rertatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">atike ulfinnik sarageelluwwinna ookkonn gataan.<verse eid="ISA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Atike baallomixxe bakkanaa'n atee dirrisannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:19">affetexxe hujenaa'ni shorrendaton.<verse eid="ISA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />«Eettene yanna erganjo anke Hilqiyyaasika belto Eliyaqeemini ye'issannon; <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />Atixxa ulfiniinxa seemma iso'n oddeessannon; sabbata atikanna isi'a uwwannon; ate'n hexxemmaxxa baalle sa'isse isi'a uwwannon; isinna Yihudiinkenna Iyyeerusaalemi hedhaake ardi'a anniinsha kadaan. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />Daawwitike minixxe qulfeeka banisanjo isi'a uwwannon; isi baneeka cufaaki, isi cufeeka dande'e banaaki hedhebaan. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />Ani iso miya fannissammake jabake fansanjishsha jabeessannon; isiki mini hadi duuchchi isi darree'n ulfaataan. <verse eid="ISA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />Yaanne kinni isika mini hadonna bayyika isika fira duuchcha gargaaraaki isote kadaan; Siinetenaa'n waabiin qico'n hedheeka mini giddika miya duuchcha miya fanninsammak ba'isanji ba'edhammashshann insa'nee ba'edhaan.<verse eid="ISA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />«Eettene barra'n» hiyya'neen Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti, «Tinni duuchchi kaddaaxxa yanna kinni jabaki miya fanninsammalchi gosheme ibaan isi hana hedhemmaki miyi duuchchinna ibe enqemaan» tenne haaso'eeki Duuchchi Woddike Goottan.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Xiroosixxee Kulemeeka Raaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />Xiroosike qachchixxee kulemeeki raagik hiyyichchi konnechchinni butti'a hedheeken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Xiroosi mini belonna oddooli belo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">olete kadeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">ha'no Xiroosixxe lumolla hoboluwwa woo hiyye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Qophiroosik bogi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">higginaa wodda laqqinaaxxi odo tenneten.<verse eid="ISA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Ha'no abbaayya foofe lumolla hobolonn dagammaki manni duroonseek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:2">ookkone oddola'ni hexxina'neek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:2">Sidoonaxxi daddalto ho'no sammi hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Lumolla wode'uwwi hana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">Xiiroosi'a Gibtseke boga'n hujendaaxxa midha iyyedangaaman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:3">Lumoxxe abbaayya gamii'n dagammak maallaqi Xiroosi lumoka qabeenna afeexxe kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">tennexxee Xiroosi buttatike gosa gosake arduwwixxi dikko kaddaani.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Koo Sidoonake qachcha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">tee lumoxxe abbaayyaxxe wolo'o shooki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:4">«Ani labbaxxannaa meyyaxxa atixxa oose nossebo'non.»<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Xiroosii'n daggaaxxi odo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:5">Gibtsee giddo laqendaa wodda wixxirri insa'ne'n daggaan.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Ha'no abbaayyati widi darre bayya hexxinaa'neeke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:6">arda! Yaaddine ooxxinaa'n abbaayya Terseesi'a fooffe.<verse eid="ISA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Lekka isexxi bayyi boga aaxxe iyyemarteexxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">ookko hexxaashsha assiteemmaxxi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:7">Olmiki edi woddik qachchi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">xoo'mamiink gammashshotik ha'nook qachchi koonnendebaata?<verse eid="ISA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Kallachcha uggudhdhiteexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">daddaltuwwa isexxi hayyichchuwwa kadeek</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:8">Buttate'n ulfaateek gurgudhdhaakannaa jijjidhdhaaka manna afeemmak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">Xiroosi tenne'n tenne hedhemmak aatemma?<verse eid="ISA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />Ulfinniinxa ifi saada salphatatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">buttate'n lumedhemmaka duuchcha salphisatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa muredheen.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Koo Terseesike arda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:10">Konneechchinni edi'a atee hoyyaak hedha gophemmaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:10">Abbaayike wodi'ishsha boga atika wo'mi.<verse eid="ISA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anga ifixxa abbaayyate'n dirrise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">isexxa mootummuwwanna alalishe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:11">Kenaanik kinjik dalla'uwwi diigemo'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">ajaja uwweexxi.<verse eid="ISA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Hiyyee qici, «Tee ati bullotte'ettexxe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">Tee Sidoonixxe dubarchcho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">ta'anni edi'a mee gammad!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 23:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:12">«Kexxettexxi Qophiroosi widi'a foofi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">ookkonna midde na'ge'a alfitaboxxo» hiyyeen.<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Kunnise Baabiloonka boga uudde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">iikki ardi woyifulabaake kade'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">Asoorik manni qiilla gommojjeke biniincha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">itti burraaqaaxxe bakka ise assenne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:13">Kinjiinxa xelleephonna ise'ni hana ijaare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">iseka kinjiinka dalla'anna diinge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">iseenna oletixxe tuulo assine.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Ha'no Terseesixxe Lumoxxe hoboluwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:14">ha'nooxxe kolluwwa diigende'een.<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />Xiroosi torbaane tomme wogga qico'n dedhende gattaaxxi yanna daggaan; tinninna mitte moyaanjike hedhotike baron; tinni wogguwwa saxxechchi udumma Xiroosi'a mitte yabaabulto manjichcho'a faarsendammaxxe faaroshshanni Qiroosi'ana hiyyende faarsendaa qici:<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />Ati dedhendettexxi yabaabulto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">kiraara gandaa'n qachchi giddo doyi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">Ate qaabbantaashsha elo eloqico meelta'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">heddo faaruwwanna faarsi!<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Torbaane tomme wogga uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Xiroosi qaabbattan; isenna edixxe isexxe hujeba'a higgaashsha assaan; isenna buttatixxe gosa gosaxxe mootummuwwa duuchchinni welti yabaabuldaani. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Daddalde alfitaaka maallaaqa duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a gargari footeeke kadaani; ise ifi'a tuu'litaake kadebaaki Magenoke ergatemammaki manni hasissaaxxe itanna elolla seemma hidhdhaake kadaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:19">Hiz. 26:1—28:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu. 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo. 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1-4">Zek. 9:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat. 11:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luq. 10:13-14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Buttate'n Mufateexxa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Kunnise Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti butta urmake assaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">haranganna ise balleessaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:1">Isenna oletixxe tuulo assaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">ise giddo hedheekaranna xexxeeraan.<verse eid="ISA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Yaane duuchcha mitte bifaxxe kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">ardake'n kaddaaxxi duuchcha qeesichchoke'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">erganjoke'n kaddaaxxi isike gootta'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">erganjote'n kaddaaxxi isexxe giitte'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">hidhdhaake'ni kaddaaxxi gurgudhdhamake'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">liqeefatamake'ni kaddaaxxi liqeesammake'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">liqa hiisamake'ni kaddaaxxe liqeesammake'ni kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Butta haranga duwwi gattaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:3">harnga saamendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:3">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti konne hiyyichcho haaso'edheen.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Butta yo'oshsha baggee'naa harcataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">butta duuchchi hana hunna harcaataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">buttatixxi hayyoolenna shaqqitaan.<verse eid="ISA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Butta ise giddo hedheeke ardinni battoottaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">ardikinna seera sa'eedheen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:5">Aadatanna enqe'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">duuchchi woddixxa kakonna diige'een.<verse eid="ISA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Tennexxee badino butta balleessita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">ardi isekinna balleessa ifixxe muremaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:6">Tennexxe buttate'n hedheek manni gubate'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">lumooshsha heenok manni calli gate'een.<verse eid="ISA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Reefixxi woyinetixxi booka mudde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:7">woyinetik hiddichchinna bage;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:7">gamadammak duuchchirinna yaade.<verse eid="ISA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Okoliinxi gammashonna sammi hite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">burraaqammake mannik cancinna uurre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">gammachchiisammak lumoo kiraarinna bucuqqi gophe.<verse eid="ISA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Ta'anni edi'a sirbina'n woyinetixxa booka ha'winabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:9">ha'watinna ha'wammake qaraarta.<verse eid="ISA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Diigemeeki qachchi onee gataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:10">mini minixxi hula cufende.<verse eid="ISA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Ora ora'n tee woyinetixxe booka hina'n raarraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">gammashsho duuchcha yaaddotiba'a jijjiierenda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">lumoxxi gammashshonna butta duuchchanaa'n baxxe'een.<verse eid="ISA 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Qachchi findigeme kutti hiyye'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:12">isixxi huluwwanna buttuttee ibbe'een.<verse eid="ISA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Ejersiink haqichchi ganemaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">woyinetixxi roddenna woxendaa wodda deegge gattammashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:13">Ookkonne boga'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">ardake'ninna tennende kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Hafuura ifikanna gikki assinaan gammashshotinna raarraan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:14">dhidhimakenaa'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootitika ulfinna laqinsaan.<verse eid="ISA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Tennexxee borote'n Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ulfeessaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">abbaayyatixxe giddichchonaa'ninna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Magenika summa lummisaan.<verse eid="ISA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Tenne buttatixxe gabalanaa'n lanqennexxi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">«Qullichchi'a Ulfinni kaddowwaali! Hitaaxxa faaro.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 24:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Ani kinni «Huqqate bagenne! Ani'a aanne'e!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">Seera sa'aak manni ane'e sa'isse uwwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Seera sa'aak manni insa'neexxe seera sa'anni anee sa'issine uune» hiyyenne.<verse eid="ISA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Koo buttate'n hexxetteke ardaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:17">baletinnaa fonxoro atee heqqexxa'neen.<verse eid="ISA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Weekenshatike hafuurnaa'n baajak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">balete'n iba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">Baletenaa'n fulaakinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">fonxorote'n abidemaan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 24:18" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">Iimatixxi maskootuwwanna banendemmaxxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">buttixxi boosonna sheke sheke hite.<verse eid="ISA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Butta hacaqqi hite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:19">butta wa'a hite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:19">butta haranga sheke sheke hite.<verse eid="ISA 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Butta machcho'ee manjishsha gatantartaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">diidallo daassitaake minishsha kadde;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:20">Isek bululik ha'ure jabake kademmaxxe ise ibbaan; higge dandeette kexxabaan.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />Eettenne barra Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:21">iima hexxeexxa hunnuwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:21">aadde hunda butta hedheeka moyanjiuwwanna mura woxaashsha assaan.<verse eid="ISA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />Eettene bale giddo hedheeke alallisanjuishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">insa'ne mittebaa gafemmaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:22">Usurriink mininna insa'ne'n cufemaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">heddo barra udumanna murtetee shinqaan.<verse eid="ISA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">Tsiyoonixxe kooba'ninna Iyyerusaalemi'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">Isexxe geedhe edo ulfinnik moyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">agenji rubukki hiyyaan; arishshotinna shookkaan.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Galatiinxa Faaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Ati anke Magenon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">atee lummisaannen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">summa atikanna galatefatannen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">Ati haranga mambe'a kaddeexxa yaane assiteetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">sirendenaa'n ke'issite heddettexxa duuchcha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">hara addachchiisaake orinni muxxetten.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Qachchuwwi diigeme onake kadaashsha assitetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">kolluwwa insa'neexxa diiggetten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:2">Naphuwwi no'oki ijaaremmaka galchatika minuwwa hedhemmabaashsha kadeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">duuchchi woddi qico'n langaxxa ijaarabaan.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Jajjabba gosaaki ardi atee ulfeessaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:3">mararte affebaaxxe gosake qachcha'n hedhaaki duuchchi atee sodaataan;<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />Hiyyeeyyetee, irko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">rakkantaa wodda rakkiyyeetee golla</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">Hobonbalte gollantaak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">arishshotike holati'aanna gaaddisake kaddeetten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">Mararte afebaake mannike hafuur</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">gimote'n mare ganedammaxxe hobonbalteshshaten.<verse eid="ISA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />Insa'ne gammoojje hedhammake eebbinjishshaten; arda miinaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">Algiinxa raarenna bucuqqii kuttatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">eebbinji duumanchike gaadissinni qiidammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">mararte afebaake mannixxi faaronna iittanni sammi hitaan.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Jabaxxa Ita Qophpheessaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti tenne Tsiyoonixxe kooba'n hedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">ardi duuchchi lumoxxa ita ha'watixxa jila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">fuldeexxa woyinetixxe bookaxxa jila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">ha'yo maalannaa filendeexxa woyinetixxa booka qophpheessaan.<verse eid="ISA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />Tenne kooba'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:7">ardi duuchcha'n buyyemeeka seemmatika golo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:7">mootummuwwatanna diriissemeeka buyyisanjo balleessaan.<verse eid="ISA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />Isi reyotixxa hunna duuchchi woddi'a balleessaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:8">Lumok Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">mitti mittingixxa indiddo fiyaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:8">Arda isike'ni hedhemmaka shooko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">butta duuchchanaa'n hoyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">tenne hiyyeeki Duuchchi Woddike Goottan.<verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />Eettene barra ardi duuchchi hiyyaa qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:9">«Kunnise no'ok Mageni iitta hedheeken</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">iso'ni amanenenni; isinna no'o anjireen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:9">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti konneden; no'onna iso'ni amannenen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">anjire isixe'ninna gammando; ililinso!» hinaan.<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Mo'aabii Mura woxisaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottixxi anga tenne Tsiyoonixxe kooba'ni ofldaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">yaane kinni buuyyichchi dhoqqeti welti hirbeesemammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">Mo'aabik ardinna iittanni hirbeesemaan.<verse eid="ISA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Wode'e daakammaki anga banammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">insa'nenna giddo he'ne anga ifixxa bannaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:11">Yaane kinni Mageni insa'neexxe hujexxe shokkonni sobemebaangi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">holla insa'neexxa salphisaan.<verse eid="ISA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />Isinna Mo'aabixxa lumoxxa kinjiinxa kolluwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">diige salphisaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:12">Butti'a aadheexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">huurake'ni hunaan.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Injifachchotixxa Faaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />Ettene barra tinni faaro Yihudiinke boga'n faarsendaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">No'o jabaka qachcha anfeennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">Mageni no'ok konne qachchika dalla'annaa kolluwwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">anjireshsha no'oxxe asseen.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Amana ifixxa heqqedheek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:2">gosa gosak qullichchi ardi e'yaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:2">gosa gosak ardi'a qachchiinxa huluwwa banne.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta amandeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:3">Atee irko assexxaaxxe lubbo'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">wo'ma nage'a uute isee heqqexxatton.<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootta duuchchi woddi'a adde assedhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:4">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti duuchchi woddixxe no'oxxe irkon.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />Ulfateeke booncho'n hedhaaka manna salphisaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">lummedheeka qachcha diigaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">findigeexxinna buttiinki buttinake assaan.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Miicememmaki manninna hana mammaremaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:6">lekka ifixxenninna hirbeessinaan.<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Qulliyyeetika ora giissitatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:7">hodhdhichcha insa'neekanna qajelchitatten.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta, seera atika heqqe'na'ni atee addantannen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">No'oxxixxi halcha lumminne atika ardake'ni ege'nemaashsha assiyyoten.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Ati murte buttate'n uutattoxxa yanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">buttatiki arduwwi qullumma barataan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">Lubbo anxi hashshanna atee yortaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">giddixxe qalbenni atee hasanneen.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Fuggaalleeyyetee eloxxi assendoolenna midde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">qullumma barantabaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">Tenne qullumma wo'miteexxe butta'n he'naa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">fuggoxxa huja waalabaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">Duuchchi Woddike Goottika lumminenna qaabbantabaan.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta, xixxotta'a hirre atixxa iimi'a ke'issitetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">atee jibbaaki manni isee afabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Arda atike hitteexxa hinaaffe affettexxa uudeexxi salphatowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">naaphuwwa atike qophpheessitettexxe giiraa'n ba'nowwaali.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:27">Ibr. 10:27</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta, nage'a no'o'a bira sa'issiteten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:12">huje no'oxxa duuchcha muuxxetteki ateten.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta no'oke Mageno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">ati gadho wele lumooxxi akeekanoole no'oo galchiteen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">yaane kinni atinge summa calla ulfeesinaanneen.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Ta'a ikki duuchchingi reyen; hinge hedhoti he'nabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">hinge ke'nabaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">Atinna insa'nee xixxeten insa'ne kutti assitetten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">insa'ne qaabbatemmabaashsha assitetten.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Ee Duuchchi Woddike Gootta gosa gosaka arda bira sa'issitette</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">gosaka arda bira sa'issitette</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:15">Atinna ulfaatetten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">bogi duuchchixxa gabala ba'lissetten.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />Ee Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Rakkantee wodda atiba dange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">atinna insa'nee xixxette wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">insa'nenna atibaa soodachchote'n ke'ne.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Ee Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Ciniinfattaxxi manjichcho ila shiqqaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">ciniintoti rakkattammashshanna raartammashshan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">no'onna ati edo iittanni kandeennen.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />No'onna siila'witeexxe melaalleshsha siila'winennen, ciniinfante rakkanten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">yaane kinni illenneki finni hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">Boga no'oke'n anjirensha iyyedangebe'non</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">butta duuchchika ardanna illebe'non.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />Yaane kinni renne ke'neexxi hedhotike kandaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">renshi insa'neekinna ke'aan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Ha'no moogendine bale giddo hexxina'neek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">kexxine gammashshotixxa faaro faarse!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Atik woji bariisik fixeensiinshaten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">Mageni lumooxxa yanna edo reyemmak manni ke'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">hedhoti hedhaashsha assaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan. 12:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Murtenna Boji'emmeebaa'ni Higa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Koo anke arda ke'i mine atikiba e'yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">e'yitine hulatanna culfe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:20">Mageniinxi mufe saxxaa qico'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">shiixxoxxa yanna ifi sho'we,<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Buttate'n hedha'neek ardi hujemmaxxe cubbo'a mura woxisatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">kunnise Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti iimike galduma ifikenaa'n dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">Eettene yanna butta ise'ni hana dunedemmaxxa munde farri assite leellishshan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">shiyemeemmaka ta'anni edi'a butta shoxxabaan.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />Eettene barra Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">Carrisa bofa Leewataanii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">Mirqemaaka dhudhdhufa Leewataanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">ifixxe jabaxxe lumoxxennaa hunnaameessa wolaantichchinni xixaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">Eettene abbaayyaka lumooka biniinchanna kukkutaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:1">Iyo. 41:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:14">Far. 74:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:26">104:26</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />Eettene yanna hiyyendaa qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:2">«Eloke woyinetike hiddichchixxa bakka faarse;<verse eid="ISA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />Ani Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti isoo heqqannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">duuchchiin wodda iso'n wode'ekanna ha'wisannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">tennexxee ayyinna isoo miidhabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">hashsha barra isoo heqqannon<verse eid="ISA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />Ani mufatebe'non;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:4">Utetinna qu'muuddo ane'n kexxeelenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">konnelchuwwa lolatee fuleennele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">mitteenba silaan konneechchuwwa gubbannan.<verse eid="ISA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />Kada gophphoole kunniichchuwwi dageexxi anee golla ifike assedhuun;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">nage'ik insa'nenni hedhannoshsha asse'nowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">eetti, nage'ik insa'nenni hedhannoshsha asse'nowwaal.»<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Dagaake baruwwa'n Ya'iqoobixxi sanne Isira'eelik ardi woyinetike hiddichchishsha hidda oltaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">daraaree gumma gummisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">gummatinna butta duuchcha wo'mitaan.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Isee ganeekara ganemmashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:7">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isra'eli ganeedheesi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:7">Isee shiyeekara shiyemmashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:7">isi isee shiyende'eeta?<verse eid="ISA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ifika arda boji'eme me'aashsha assiyyoti xixe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">borotixxi diidallo gandammaxxe barrashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">jabaxxe hobonbaltenni ise shorrishete.<verse eid="ISA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Ya'iqoobike tolchimalchiink kinjuwwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">boo'etike kinjishsha insa'nee dayeexxi bulleessaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">Ashaarixxi soodduwwanna hixaanik tolchimalchuwwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">bakka ififixxenaa'n goshe hunaa wodda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">Eettene yanna balleessa isixxi isi'a gattowwaal hiyyendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">tinninna cubbo ifixxa fuggussitaxxa wo'ma gumma kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Kinjiinke dalla'iki qachchuwwi gataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">qiilla gammoojjeshsha waalendeexxe bakka kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:10">Jabbuwwa ookko bobbaataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">ookkonna ciissaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">damuwwa isexxanna coonqeexxi indaan.<verse eid="ISA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Damuwwa isexxi enqendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">melaalletinna daggeexxi konnelchuwwa giirtaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:11">Qalbefachcho afeeke arda kedeemmaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">daddalikinna insa'ne'a mararabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">insa'nee giisseekinna eloxxa isi'a assabaan.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />Wiisalli dinne huurakenaa'n gargari hiissammashsha eettene barra Efiraaxxisike galananaa'n Gibtseeke bogixxe gabala qico'n hedheeka arda ifika Isira'eeli Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti mitti mittinginni bukki assaan.<verse eid="ISA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />Ookkone baro'n lumooki malagati ufuufemaan; Asoorike bogiba'anna Gibtseeke bogibaa booji'eme me'emmaki Isira'eliki ardi higeexxi Iyyerusaalemi hexxeexxe woyyitte kooba hana magenoonfantaan.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Middixxe Mootumma'a Uwwendeexxa Xexxe'achchiisa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Haanjaaxxe dhooqaxxe xungo'n hana hedheeke Samaarake qachchi'a aanne'e!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">akeekisanjuwwi iseki ha'we machcho'a'neekeran. Yaane kinni insa'ne bage harca'aamake daraarishsha kandaan.<verse eid="ISA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Kunse Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti jabaxxanna worbiteexxa yaane afe'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">tinni kaadetixxe hobonbalteshsha, balleessitammaxxe hobonbalteshsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:2">Hunnaameessa danbala'ishsha, jabake xeenishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">hunnati isee butti'a darbaan.<verse eid="ISA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Efireemike machcho'alluwwiki ifi saadatik kallachchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:3">lekkati hirbeessemaan;<verse eid="ISA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Quffeexxe dhooqaxxe xungo'n hexxeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">isike ulfinniixxi danchumma kade'eeke qooreek daraari</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:4">Midha bukki asseccatixxe yanna edi darre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">manjikinna dedhange'n isee afeexxi qocedhammaxxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">iikki woddi isee liqinsammaxxe balaseshsha kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />Eettene yanna Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">gateeke ifike ardi'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:5">Ulfinniinke kallachcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">danchummatike seesa kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />Isinna murtetixxe moote'n ofo'laake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:6">dhugaatika hafuura</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:6">Bagedokannaa qachchiinxe hulanaa'n ille iima hiissakeri'anna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:6">hunnatixxe muume kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Issayyaasinna Machcho'alluwwa Wabeeko</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Kunniir woyintixxe bookanni gatantarra'neen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">machchoossitaaxxe ha'wanninna tinitimaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Iitti qee'lonna wabeeko machchoossitaaxxe ha'wanni gatantarte</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Woyinetixxe bookanna yaane insa'nee dommi assite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Maachchositaaxxe ha'wanni tinitimme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">waleella unda wodda dedhake'n inbaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">murte uuna woddanna guggufantaan.<verse eid="ISA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Indammaxxi qoruwwa duuchcha honqo'oti wo'miteen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:8">honqo'otinna hanqateexxe bakka hexxeba'a.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />Insa'nenna hinee qici, «Ayyete barachchiisaane isi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:9">erga eettene isi ifisa'neek ayyi'aate?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:9">Ununa waldeexxe annoole'aate?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:9">yookaan guuteexxe annoole'aate?<verse eid="ISA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Ajajange'n ajaja, ajajange'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">ajaja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">aadande'n aada; aadande'n aada<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tenne bakka'ninna 13 laakkosa'n Ibirayisixxike laagadinni lave lasaave saave lasaave, kaave lakaave kaave lakaave hittaan; akimagaada tinni hiyya tika affebaaka haaso'a leellishateete kaddaan; tininna wabeekotika hiyyichcho fakkeesse haaso'ate kada dandeetaan.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">kaba heenoxxi ookkonna heenoxxe kaddaan.»<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Kunse Magen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:11">alagiinke haaso'inni haaroke laagadinni konne ardi'a haaso'aan.<verse eid="ISA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />Isi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">«Tinni hafuura adhdhatixxe bakkanni; shaqqakinna hafuura adhdhowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:12">Tinni hafuura hiissedhatixxe bakkan» hiyyeek ayyi'aatemma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">insa'ne kinni laqa eeneba'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:21">1 Qor. 14:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyyichchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">ajajange'n ajaji, ajajange'n ajaji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">aadande'n aada aadande'n aada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">kabaa heenoxxi ookkonna heenoxxe insa'ne'n kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">Tinninna insa'ne'n kadda'neechchi marreexxi udumi'a inbaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">madoonnashshanna fonxorote'n abidemmashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">booji'emmo'aaten.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsiyyooni'a Dhaadote Kadaaka Kinjo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Tennexxee Iyyerusaalemi hedheeka arda galchitinaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:14">ha'no coortinaak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'neexxa laqqe.<verse eid="ISA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Ha'no «Reyoti welti weli kako angeenneni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">hundike wiiddinninna weli aangeennen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Dharakanna ifike golla assineennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">sobokanna ifixxe irko assineenne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Jabaxxi ba'ne filta'n saxxaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">no'o kisa dandetabaan» hitina'ne ifi saadine'een.<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />Tennexxee Dada duuchchika Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">«Kunni, hega uudemeeka kinjo, boosotika kinjo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">jabaxxe booso'a kadaaka fiixe'eeka dhaaddoti kinjo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">Isoo Tsiyoonixxe booso'n uggannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">iso'n amanaakinna salphataba'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Far. 118:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Rom. 9:33</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:11">10:11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6">1 Phex. 2:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Dhugaatixxa murte wodaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">qullummatanna miniixxe boosotixxe mike assannon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:17">Gollatineek ha'noka dhara kaadetik xeeni itti ganaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">umo uggitinammaka boonchonna lola'i fiyee balleessaani.<verse eid="ISA 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Reyoti weli aagginemmaxxi weli aaggo gattaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">reyemmaki manni hedhemmaba'ninna aagginemmaxxi kakonna diigendaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:18">Jabaxxi bala ha'noo gudhdhita'ni saxxaa wodda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">ha'no'aanna ba'nendeni.<verse eid="ISA 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Ise daggeexxe qixxe'ni ha'no adhdhe me'aani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">ise gorsa gorsa, hashshannaa barra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">gudhdhaan.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 28:19" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:19">Konne Mageniinka hiyyichcho qalbeefattineele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">weekenshatende'n weekensha lebaan.<verse eid="ISA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Kunni manjichchi lekka diriirseexxi taqete'ni diiphabaashsha taqe harumaaxxen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:20">biso buqedhabaashsha buyyedhaaxxi seemma harumaaxxen.<verse eid="ISA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti huje isixxa eeti mambe'a isika hujatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">assaaxxa, haaroxxa yaane assatee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:21">Pheeratsimixxe kooba'ninna assemmashsha ke'aan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">Gaba'oonixxe dhooqa'n assemmashshanni ta'anna assatee ke'aan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:10-12">Iya. 10:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:20">2 Sam. 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:11">1 Odo. 14:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Tennexxee coora ha'nooxxa waalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">iitta kada gophphoole usuraak ha'noo heqqaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:22">Dada Duuchcha Ajajake Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">boga duuchcha balleesso'a lasse mudhdheexxa laqeennen.<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Uwwaaka Beekkuma</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Caqasse hiyyaannexxa laqqe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:23">qalbeefatte hiyyichcho ankanna caqasse.<verse eid="ISA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Wiisallichchi midhatika fichcha sammi hiyye huccaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:24">qote gangane buttina shaqishebangi kaalsaak hedhaata?<verse eid="ISA 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Fichcha qophphessedhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">xillooxxa qimamenna kemuuni hinaaxxa qimame rokaba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:25">Dinnetanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">so'a hasisaa booncho'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">iittanni ajjiinxa gummanna qophphessemeke booncho'ni rokabaata?<verse eid="ISA 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Isiki Mageni barachchiisaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:26">toggichcha oranna isi'a leellishaan.<verse eid="ISA 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Xillooxxi qimamenna uxxisanjiinke miyinni uxxendaba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:27">Kemuuni hiyyendaaxxi qimame'ni sarageeliinxi mole hana me'itaba'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:27">Xillooxxi qimame kutik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:27">Kemuuninna sibiljiinxe siqqonni uxxendaan.<verse eid="ISA 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Buddeena ra'issatee midha dayendaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">tennexxee mitti manji duuchchi woddi'a midha uxxa'ni hedhabaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:28">Uxxatixxi sarageelixxi molenna fadhadi ise hana me'eexxenna kaddoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">fadhadikinna isee bulleesaba'a.<verse eid="ISA 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Kunni beekkumi duuchchi afemeeki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">lumoke kadeeke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottinaa'niten.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Daawwitike Qachchi'a Iyyerusaalemi'a Aanne!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Daawwiti ofo'lemmake qachchi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">Ari'eeli, ati'aa woo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:1">Woggande'ni hana wogga lephphi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">woggatik ayyaani atikinna ulfesema'n hedhowaal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ari'eeli Ibrayyisixxetk laaggada'ni </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tolchi Malchinke boga</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyaak hiyyichchike ye'injoni </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ari'eel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyyaake hiyyichchinn welti fakkatan. </char></note> buqannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">ise ooxxaan woo woo hitaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">ani'anna tolchimalchiinke boonchishsha kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Yaane kinni Ari'eeli'i buqannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">ooxxaan; woo woo hitaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">ise ani'aanna tolchimalchiinke boonchishsha kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />Atike qarqara'n hedhannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">dalla'ikinna atee qoqqobannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">qoqqobatixxa tullubonna atee wixxirri assannon.<verse eid="ISA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Butti'aanna dhidhindatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">buttati hundi darrenna haasottatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">haaso'i buttinni giddii'n iimi'a dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">haaso'i atik bukkotenaa'n hashashaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Yaane kinni atik heddi naaphi bukotike huurishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5">mararte afebaake mannixxi birsa'nenna sa'aake</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:5">Huurishsha kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5">dedhange'n hedendebaangi,<verse eid="ISA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:6">Dindinso, buttiniinxa lele'ma, jabaxxa diidallo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:6">hobonbalitte, danbala'ikinna ittaaxxe giiratike bubenjinni dagaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Ari'eeli lolaaka gosa gosa duuchchika hore;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">ise'ninna isexxe kollo'n miidhaakinna ise'e qoqqobaak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:7">Oojjotishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">hashshanna leellitaaxxe leellaashsha kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Solo'week manjichchi oojjoti iita'n galeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">yaane kinni soodaa wodda solo'o balleesedhemmabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">dheebo'wek manjichchinna oojjoti ha'wa'n galeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">yaane kinni dammaqaa wodda wexeqemeexxanna dheebo isoo waaldemmabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Tsiyoonixxa kooba lolaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">gosa gosak hori duuchchi iittaande kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageniinka Ajaja Tuffata Iyyedagaaxxa Mura Woxisa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Mambe'a hiyye, alayye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">himmi hiyye affinabaakenna kadde;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:9">Woyinetixxe bookannite kaddoqqe malee machcho'we;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">machchoossitaaxxe ha'wannite kaddoqqe malee gatantare.<verse eid="ISA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti jabaka diipho ha'no'n wocci asse'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">ha'noxxa wabeeko, ille ha'nooxxa buqe'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">ha'noxxa wabeeko, sammo ha'nooxxa cufe'een.<verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Wabeekumiinxe waleellaaxxi tika duuchcha ha'nonaa'ni sho'ondeexxi maxxansik maxxansemeeke mirqisanjo maxaafa kadaani; miriqisanjo maxaafa haaseessaake manjiba'a adhdhitine me'itine «No'aa isoo haaseessi hitine» kadhatinoolenna midde «Maxxansememmaxxee isoo haasseessa dande'abe'non» hiyyaani. <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Haaseessa dande'abaake manjiba'a mirqisanjo maxaafa adhdhitine me'itineexxi «No'o'a haaseessi» hitinoole, «Ani haaseessa ege'nebo'noni» hiyyaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti, hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">«Kunni ardi afo'ik aniba'a shiqaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">suume ifixxinninna anee ulfeesaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">qalbe isixxi kinni anenaa'n bayyateexxen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">isi anee magenoofate'neekinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">manji barsiisemmaxxe manjiinxe huje callinniten.<verse eid="ISA 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />Tennexxee kunni ardi masote'n maso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">yaane assa'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:14">Haaroba isoo mambe'a hiyyaashsha assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">beekoletiki beekkumi ba'aan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:14">Qalbefataake mannixxe qalbeefachcho miliqqaan» hiyya'nen.<verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edi'a Hexxeexxa Halcha<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:19">1 Qor. 1:19</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Yaada ifika Duuchchi Woddike Goottanaa'n sho'eccatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">dhi'mo bale giddi'a e'yaakiir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:15">Huje ifixxanna dukkana giddo huccakiir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">«Aate no'oo afa? Aate no'oo ege'na» hiyyakiiri'a insa'ne'a aanne!<verse eid="ISA 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />Ha'no yaane gonbissinaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">waati giissemmaka manjichcho waatiinsha isoo uudinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">isi hujeechchi isoo hujemmaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">«Isi anee hujebaan» hiyyaata?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Waati isoo giissemmaka manjichcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">«Isi mittelchonna ege'neechchi hedhebaan» hiyyaata?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:9">Isa. 45:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Libaanoosik gongomi eloke fichcha kadatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:17">shaqqake kadeemmak fichchinna gongomake kadetee heenoxxe yanna isi'a gattabaata?<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />Eettenne yanna mansha laqqabaaki mirqisanjo maxaafika hiyyichcho laqqaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:18">ille affammabaakixxinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:18">qayootakenaa'ninna dukkanatenaa'n gargar higgeexxi affaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Ba'lak manni Duuchchi Woddike Goottinn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:19">woyi fulabaak manninna ookkone Isira'eelike woyyichcha'n haaroba gammadaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Mararte afebaaki manninna hedhemabaashsha kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">gacifataakirinna miliqee ba'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">fuggoxxee ripheek duuchchi fugussemaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />Manjoke'n yaaneti balleessanjoke assaakiir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">ku'lemeeke manna'n fonxoro fayaakiir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">dhaariinxe dhugaa kullani dhuga'a balleessa afebaakerinaa'n mulqedhaakiir kutemaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Tennexxee Abirihaamii'i wodeek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:22">Ya'iqoobika arda hiyya'nee qici</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:22">«Ya'iqoobi ta'anni edi'a shookaba'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:22">albi isikinna ta'anni edi'a shudhdhudhdhi hiyyaba'a.<verse eid="ISA 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Oddo insa'neexxe'n anxe angaxxe huje kaddeexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">ifixxa oose uunda woddaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">summa anka woyyoonsinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">ookkone Ya'iqoobike woyyichchixxa woyyummanna egennaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">ookkone Isira'eelike Mageni edonna soda'ati uurrinaan.<verse eid="ISA 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Irra ifikenni dedheek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:24">adhumaakiir gorissa adhdhaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Gibtsenni Welti Toliinxa Kako Aaga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />«Jalliyye oose'a aanne»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">«Anke kadeebaaka yaada hordonfaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">anke yaada kaddebaaxxa kako aangaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">cubbonde'ni cubbo lephphinaan.<verse eid="ISA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />Anee qodhdhinebaangi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:2">Gibtsee'a me'ineeni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:2">Gibtseeka gaaddisa gollakee harse'naan<verse eid="ISA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Yaane kinni Feri'oonixxi heqqa insa'ne'a shooko iyyedagaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:3">Gibtsee'ni golcho salphine insa'ne'n iyyedaggaan.<verse eid="ISA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Fedhee qiconna galchalluwwa Xaanosik qachcha'ni anfoolenna midde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:4">insa'ne erganjuwwi Xaanewoosi hinaaba marre gennolenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat. 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:25">Mar. 13:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:26">Luq. 21:26</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13-14">Wal. 6:13-14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />Yaane kinni insa'ne'a salphinnekanna shookoke malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">gargaarsakenna kado la'o insa'ne'a hasisabaak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:5">Mittelchonna insa'nee uwwabaake ardixxe buutonni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">uwwabaake ardibaa me'a ha'no duuchchiinge shookoken</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">duuchchingi shookoke'ni ibaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Negeeb hinaba hedheek hori biniinchi'a kulemeeka hiyyichcho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Erganjuwwi karra insa'neexxa harrete'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">fiixa miya insa'neeka gaalake'ni fe'e'ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">meyyakinna labbak neequwwi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Ha'latik bofinna carri hiyya'ni me'ammaki bofuwwi hedhammaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">rakkonna abara afeeke fuggoke bogi giddi'n sa'neexxi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Mitte la'o insa'ne'a uwwabaak ookkone ardibaa;<verse eid="ISA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />Gargaarsi iseki mitte la'onna uwwabaak Gibtsee me'inaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:7">Tennexxee summa iseka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:7">Raa'abii mitte la'o uutabaaxxe hiyyee isee ye'annon.<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Ta'a me'i xilloke bidiro'ni insa'ne'a borreessi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:8">mirqisanjo maxaafa'ni giddo borreesite uggi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:8">Dagaake baruwwi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:8">duuchchi woddi'a naqaashete kadaan;<verse eid="ISA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Kunnichchinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ajaja laqa gibaake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:9">jalliyye ardanna dhariyye oosen.<verse eid="ISA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />Leella uudamakara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">«Ta'inni udumi'a leella uuddinoqqe» hinaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Wabeekotanna hinaa qici</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">«Dhugaatika raaga ta'anna edi'a raagginoqqee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Gammachchissaaxxa no'o'ni haaso'we</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">no'o eenannoxxa no'aa lallabe.<verse eid="ISA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Ora no'okenaa'ni gamake'ni higge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:11">hodhdhichchakenaa'ninna bayyatte</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:11">Isira'eelike Woyyichchi Magenixxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:11">langaxxa lanqonna'a hansaabo'non!»<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Tennexxee woyyichchi Isira'eeliki Mageni hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:12">«Konne hiyyichcho ha'no shollishinemmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">fuggoxxa assa amandineemmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">soboke'ni irkatinemmaxxee,<verse eid="ISA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />Tennexxee tinn cubbo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">hashakki hashakki hiyye iba shiqeeke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">keekkachcho belo dedhange'ni ibammake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">qeerraake kinjiinke dalla'ishsha ha'no'ni kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />Bututeechchi uduma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">kashilo faashatee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:14">Wode'e qulxuphphate kadaak balchi midde afemabaa qico'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">mittikinna gatebaangi bututammak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">faarink miyishsha bullo'aan.»<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Isira'eelik woyyichchi dada duuchchike Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:15">«Higatinna ti'ni hiyyati anjirendinaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">sammi hiyyatinna addatati hunna alfitinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">ha'no kinni tennee assitinebaan.<verse eid="ISA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Higgeenni ‹Kaddabaan fadhadik baanjannon› hitine</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">tennexxee ha'no baqattinaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:16">Higgeen, ‹Qolchaake fadhadinni baanje fullannon› hitineen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">yaane kinni ha'noo shorra'neeki ha'no iimi darre qolchaken.<verse eid="ISA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Koobatixxe xungo'ni otemeeke baandirishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">tulluchchuwwake'ni hana uurreek beesisishsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">Kaddinaa qico'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">mitte manjichchixxe sodaachchisaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">Kumi manna baqataan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">onde manji'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">ha'no duuchchiingi baajinaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti kinni ha'no'a o'waa ossaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">mararte ifixxanna ha'no'a leellisho'a ke'aan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:18">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Magen dhugaa muraake kademmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">isoo addatati heqqedhaak eebbisemeeken.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Arda Ifika Eebbisaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Ha'no Iyyerusaalemi hexxina'neeke Tsiyoonike arda! Konnechchinni edi'a ooxxinabaan; Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti mararaake kademmaaxxee ha'no gargaarsa hassine isiba'a ooxxina wodda oodhishsha ha'nooxxa laqeexxi hiissichcho ha'no'a uwwaan. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />Dada duuchchik Gootti lumoxxe rakko ha'no'ni geltaashsha assaaxxe hexxeen; yaane kinni isi ha'noo barachchiiso'a isi ha'nonni welti hedheen; higgeenni isoo harsitina'n rakkatinabaan. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Me'itinaaka ora haakkine middannaa bita'i'a doonsa kiyya hitinabaan «Ori konneten! Konne me'i» hiyyaaka hafuura laqqinaan. <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Birretike siblijinninna worqeti bunqeexxa fakkuwwa ha'nooxxanna «No'onaa'n bayyatte!» hitinaa'n raritina'n cancitinaa'ni battotteexxe yaaneshsha aaxxine fugusitinaan. <verse eid="ISA 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Midha facaasitineexxiki mudhi lateexxi nophpho'anna yo'oxxa midha aassexxinaashsha Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti xeena ha'no'a gansiisaan; hore ha'nooka alla'litinaaxxa heddo bakka alfitinaan. <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />Fichchuwwa qottammaxxi qotiyyuwwanna harruwwa eloka maxine fifixendeeka oke'a ittaan. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Ardi bagediki midhemaa wodda lumollamma koobuwwanaa'ninna tulluwwatenaa'n wodi'inxi muume phu'issaan. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />Eettene yanna agenji arishshotishsha wa'a hitee iffaan; arishshotinna edi qiconaa'ni torbaane anga saxxe iffaan; torbaane barra qiciki ifi mitte barra'ni ifissaan; tinni duuchchi kadaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti umi isenginninni arda madeessemmaaxxa mada ci'loome fayyisaaxxe barra'niten.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Asoorii'i Mura Woxisaaxxa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Kunnise Duuchchi Woddike Goottik summi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">ha'yitaaxxe mufenni diimmo duumanchixxe tuqutuqu hitaaxxe wiliillenni welti bayyii'ni dagaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:27">Haaso'i isik mufeti wo'meeken</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">arrabi isikinna ittammaxxe giirashshaten.<verse eid="ISA 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Isiki hafuuri gure adhdhe me'ammake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">goobi qico'ninna geyammake dageeke wode'ishshaten</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:28">Isi moyanjuwwa balleessatixxe diddiqqanni insa'nee diddissaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">gosa gosatik ardik qeqqeshshinni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">ba'netika habooqqe ofo'o insa'neeke'ni bixaalan.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Ha'no hashsha woyyichcha ayyaana ulfeessitinaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">faaro faarsitinammashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:29">Faarsitinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe kooba'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">Isira'eelixxe rassaba'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">manni suusu'le ufuufa'ni gammashshoti qabatammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">ha'nooxxi qalbenna ittanni ililissaan<verse eid="ISA 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ha'yita'neexxe mufenninna ittaaxxe giiranni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">danbala'ikinna balaqik kaadeti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:30">Gaachchanni wo'meeka ye'injo isika manni laqaashsha assee laqisaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">jabaki isik xixxichchi dirraa'naa uundaan.<verse eid="ISA 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottik hafuur Asoorito alaalshaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:31">siqqichcho isixxinna insa'nee gandaan.<verse eid="ISA 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'nee'ni ibisa'nexxi mura woxisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">siqqo duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:32">Lumoke kiraarinninnaa okolik luuljinni qoqqobemeeken</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">lolik hunna ifixxa leellisha insa'ne gane.<verse eid="ISA 30:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Qeeraake baronaa'ni safe Toofet hinaak gubatik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">boonchi qophpheesseme'een</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:33">Asoorik moyanji'anna giisseme'en</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">giira ha'ishendaaxxi balenna ba'laxxenna dhi'mooten</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:33">Ise giddo heddo giiranna tuulendeexxi haqqe hexxeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">Duuchchi Woddik Goottik hafuuri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">ha'yaake kinjinni ha'ishaan.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Gibtse'n Irkata Tolake Kaddeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Ookkone Isira'eelike Woyyichchiba uudabaakiiri'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">Duuchchi Woddike Goottika gargaarsa halsakeeri'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">Yaane kinni gargaarsa alfatee hine Gibtsee'a dirrakiiri'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">fadhado ifike'ni addatekeeri'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">Sarageelluwwiinxe bira sa'ne'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">insa'neek fadhadixxa jabaxxa hunna irko assedhe ifi saadaakeeri'a aanne'e!<verse eid="ISA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti kinni beekaken; bala iyyedagaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">hiyyichcho isikanna muuxaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:2">Fuggoxxa asseke mannike mine'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">balleessanno gariggaarammak manna ke'aani.<verse eid="ISA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Gibtseeki manni manjoke malee Magenokebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">fadhadi insa'neekinna maalake malee hafuurakebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anga ifixxa dirriissa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">gargaarammak guggufataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">gargaremaammakinna ibaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">lamiingi mitteba ba'aan.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Iyyerussaalemi Anjiraake Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee hiyyee qici;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">«Neenqi yookaan neenqiink beltanji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">adameeka abixxeexxi ittaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">Heddi allalisano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">weli yexxeexxi isiba'a daggaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">Raare insa'neexxi isoo sodaachchissammabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">isinna hafuura insa'neeke culphisammabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi woddik Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">Tsiyoonixxe kooba'ninna isike tullichchuwwa'n lolakee iittanni dirraan.<verse eid="ISA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Ciichcho mine ifiki hana keela bande doota'n beltanna ifixxa heqqexxammashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Iyyerusaalemi gollanoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:5">Ise buqaan; anjiraan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">ise hananna sa'aan ise wodaan.<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />«Koo Isira'eelike ardaa! Anee gibbinemmangiba'a wirri hitine higge! <verse eid="ISA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />Cubbo callixxe anga ha'nooxxenni giisexxinemmaxxa birreti sibilijuwwixxanna worqetixxa fakkuwwa magenoofatinammaxxa duuchcha fugussitinaaxxi yanna daggaan.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />«Asoorik manni manjiinke kadebaake wolaantichchinni mudaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">maala oddowebaaki wolaantichchi isoo itaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">wolaantichchi ediin baajaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">insa'neexxi dargaggeeyenna garbummatixxa huje hujjaan.<verse eid="ISA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Weekensha kexxaaxxa yanna insa'neeki kinjiinke dalla'uwwiki qachchuwwi diigemaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">isik akeekisanjuwwinna bagediinka baandira udaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:9">Soda'ati liqisemaan»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">hiyya'neen giira isixxi giddo hexxeek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">ha'ishatixxe bakkanna Iyyerusaalemi giddo kadee'eek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s1">Qullummati Galchaaka Moyanjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Kunnise qullumati galchaaki moyanji moyaaxxe yanna daggaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:1">ardiinki akeekisanjuwwinna dhugaati muraan.<verse eid="ISA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Mitti mittingi diidallotenaa'ninna hobonbaltetenaa'ni gollantammake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">danbala'akenaa'n gollataake kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:2">Qiilla gammoojje giddo yaa'ammake muumetike wodi'ishshanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">bogi giddo hexxeexxe qiidifantaaxxe lumoxxe wolo'oshsha kandaan.<verse eid="ISA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Konneechchi uduma afemaake mannixxi ille himmi hitabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:3">laqammake mannixxi manshanna caqassaan.<verse eid="ISA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Jarjarammakiirixxi sammo egendaan; qalbefataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:4">giggissammak arrabinna tikemeeke kadaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:4">ca'a hiyyenna haaso'aan.<verse eid="ISA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Konneechchi edi'a gowwoole siggake hiyyendabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:5">booso'uwwake ulfinni uwwemabaan.<verse eid="ISA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Gowwoole gowwummande haasottaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">elobaaxxanna hedaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">Duuchchi Woddike Gootti eeyyabaaxxe hujaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n afo'o fulchedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">Solo'weeka itaachcho hoyyedha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">dheebo'weeke wode'e uwwaba'a.<verse eid="ISA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Afeeshshanni kadaake mannixxi huje fuggonxeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">fedhee qiconna hiyyeeyyetixxi ku'la seeriinxe kaddoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">hiyyeessa dhark balleessiyyote</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">fuggoxxe hedaan.<verse eid="ISA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Ulfichchi manji kinni yaadi isikinna ulfateeke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:8">ulfaataaxxe huje ifixxenninna ti'niyye afemaan.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoo'mama Galdaaxxe Melaalle'a Uwwendeexxa Xexxe'achchiisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Ha'no xoo'mamiki hexxina'neexxe melaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">kexxine hafuura anka laqqe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:9">Ha'no eloke ifike galduma'ni hexxina'neexxe melaallexxe oose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">ha'no'n kulaanexxa caqasse.<verse eid="ISA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Wogga reefi saxxeeshshanni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">elo qico galdinammakinna culphissinaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">woyinetiki hiddichchi gummisaba'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">hiddichchuwwa qocedhati mayetixxi yanna daggaba'a.<verse eid="ISA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Ha'noo ifi saada bokossiteexxi melaalle culphisse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">ha'no xoo'mama galdineexxe meyyaxxi oose soda'at roqoonse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:11">Seemma ha'nooxxanna fulchedhdhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">hidha ha'nooka yaaddotixxe seemman usudhdhe.<verse eid="ISA 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Ookkone shamoke bogixxe wi'lishshitinaa'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:12">ookkone gummatike woyinetike hiddichchixxee yaadde.<verse eid="ISA 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />Anke ardike bogixxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">utenna qu'muudo lateeke bogi'xxe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:13">Ookkone feenxe hiyyatike minuwwi duuchchixxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">konne burraaqatike qachchixxe oodhdhe.<verse eid="ISA 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Kollotik qachchi urmake kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">canci bira sa'emmak qachi bucuqqi hiyyaak gophemeeke kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:14">Iitti kollonna xelephpho duuchchi woddi'a wolo'ote kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">diidiinxi harre burraaqqaaba'a, hori boba'aabanna kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nage'akee Uwendeexxa Addachchiisa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />Tinninna kaddaak Hafuuri ale iiminaa'n dagaa qico</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:15">iitti qiilla gammoojje shamo boga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:15">iikki shamo boginna gongoma kadaa qici'aten.<verse eid="ISA 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Qiilla gammoojje'n dhugaa mura hexxaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:16">shamoke boga'n qullumma hexxaan.<verse eid="ISA 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Qullummatixxi gumma nagee'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:17">qullumma iyyedaggaachchinna ti'n hiyyatanna duuchchi woddi'a addatate kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Ardi ank nega'iinke galduma'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:18">addatemeeke mine'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:18">weekensha hexxebaaxxe bakka'n hafuura adhdhe hedhaan.<verse eid="ISA 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Iikki gongomi kaadeti ganemoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:19">iikki qachchi haranga bakka ba'oolenna<verse eid="ISA 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />Wodi'i widi'nxa qaro sanne rorkinaakiir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">qotile ha'nooxxanna harre ha'nooxxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">nage'ik alla'ltinaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">hittata eebbissendineeke.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s1">Gargaarsakee Soodatendeexxa Soodaachcho</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Ati baxxeboxxongi balleessitaatteki!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">koo atee balleesanjo ati'a aanne'e!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Koo ati waakkatendebexxongi waakkattattok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">koo ati wakkattattoke ati'a aane'e!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Balleessa waaldettexxa yanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">ati baxxatton;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Waakkata waaldattoxxa yanna waakatendatto.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />Ee Duuchchi Woddike Gootta no'o'a marar;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">Atee addanteenneen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:2">Gorsa gorsa'n jabeenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">wixxirrixxa yanna no'a anjirate kadi.<verse eid="ISA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Arduwwi hafuur atikixxe diindinsonni bajaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:3">mootummuwwatinna ati kexxatto wodda xeeremaan.<verse eid="ISA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Koo gosa gosake arda awwaaneessi bukki hiyyammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:4">booji'o ha'nooxxinna bukki hitaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:4">mannikinna ise hanna shiixxaramma awaanessishsha burraqaan.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ale iima ofo'leexxi lummedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:5">Tsiyooni'a qullummatanna dhugaa'a wonshaan.<verse eid="ISA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />Isi ati'a addatendeexxa booso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">anjiratike, ege'natikennaa beekumiinke mazigaba kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">Duuchchi Woddika Gootta sodaatatinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottinaa'n kaddeexxe karran.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookaan Duuchchi Woddika Gootta sodaatanna tenne karraxxe qulfen.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Kunnise insa'neek goottuwwi ora ora'n raraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:7">nage'iinke ergaluwwinna hiiqqinse oo'naan.<verse eid="ISA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Lumollami oruwwi duwwike kade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">oruwwake'n manji hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">wel aagonna diigende;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">gorsaluwwi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wele tikuwwa qachchuwwake hitaan.</char></note>tuffatemeedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">ulfatemeek hedhebaan.<verse eid="ISA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Iikki bogi oodhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">Libaanoosinna salphatte; qoorte;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:9">Saarooni Arbiinke bogishsha qiilla gammoojje kadde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">Baasanixxennaa Qermeeloosixxxe koobuwwa'n hedheek haqqichchuwwi ifi fika shafa harcaalse.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Naphuwwa Ifika Xexxe'achchiise</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />«Ta'a yooni ani ke'aanen,»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:10">«Ta'a lummedhanno;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:10">ta'a ulfaatannon hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Huura siila'witine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:11">kunbakanna ildine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:11">ha'nook hafuuranna ha'no ittaaxxe giiran.<verse eid="ISA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Arduwwi boo'e hunjendamake kinjishsha gubataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:12">qu'muudotixxe waaccoshsha giirate'n gubataan.»<verse eid="ISA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Ha'no bayya hexxineeki hujennexxa laqqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:13">ha'noonna bira hexxineeki hunna anxa ege'ne!<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Tsiyooni hexxeexxe cubbaalleeyye alalte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">magno afebaak manni soda'a insa'ne'n ibbee'naa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:14">«No'o giddii'n ittaaxxe giiranni welt aate hedha dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">Duuchchi woddixxe giiranni welt ayyete hedha danda'a?» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Qullummati me'aak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">dhugaatixxa yaane haaso'ak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">Dharak daggaaxxa la'o tuffataak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">matta adhdha gophaatee anga bukki assedhaak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">Manna anga sa'atixxa yaane laqa gophatee mansha ifixxa tulphaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">fuggoxxa uuda gophatee ille ifixxa himmi hiyyaak,<verse eid="ISA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />Iitta hedheek manji eettenne qephphitte bakka'n hedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">koobatixxe kollonna isixxe irko kadda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:16">Itaachchinna isi'a uwwemaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">wodi'ikinna isi'a gophemabaan.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulfinni Wo'meeka Edi'a Dagaaka Baro</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Ille atixxi ookkone moyanjo danchumma isixxenninni isoo uudaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:17">bayya fayemeeka boganna undaan.<verse eid="ISA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Edi woddixxi rakko qaabata'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">«Iikki umik akeekisaji haba hedhe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">Irbo adhamakita haba'a me'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">Iikki heqatixxe xeleephok umi haba hedha?» hitaton.<verse eid="ISA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Ikki haaso'i insa'neekiir aagabaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">hinaaxxi ege'nendeebaakiir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">aagabaaka laagada haaso'aakiir aafeeshshanni galaaka arda ta'anni edi'a affaboxxon.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Ege'nemeeka magenoonfachchotika ayyaanuwwa ulfeessinanneka Tsiyoonika qachcha uudde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">nage'iinke galdumixxe bakkaxxe duunkaane kaddeexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">dhaaddo isexxi goshendabaaxxa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">Isixxi wodaronna mittetinna midde tanshendabaaxxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">Iyyerusaalemi'i ille atixxi uddaan.<verse eid="ISA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ookko no'oxxe hunna kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">iikki shafisuwwiinxi hoboluwwa saxxamabaaxxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">lumolluwwa hoboluwwanna foofamabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">ba'lallama galaanuwwannaa yaasumuwwa no'o'a kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti no'ok hayyichchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'aa seerike uwwallon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'oke moyanjon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">no'oo anjiraakinna isoten.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Atixxi dhisatixxe wodaro luffe'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">iikki utuphinna jabeesenme otemeba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">sharkinna dhisemebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">eettenne yanna lumoxxe booji'o qoodendaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">naafikinna midde gatebaang booji'e qoodema.<verse eid="ISA 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Tsiyooni hedheexxi, «Ela gophenen» hiyyaaki hedhdhabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:24">ookkonna hedhaake manni cubbo duuchchi gattowwaal hiyyendaan.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Gosa Gosake Arda'ni Murte Uwwaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Koo ha'no gosa gosake arda amme caqasse!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">Ha'no koo manna qalbeefatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">buttatinna ise giddo hedhaaki duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">butta duuchcha isenaa'n mudhaachchi duuchchi laqowwaal.<verse eid="ISA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti gosa gosaka arda duuchcha'n mufate'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">isixxi mufenna insa'neeke loliinke manna duuchcha'niten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">isinna insa'nee bakka balleessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">dulemo'anna sa'isse insa'nee uwwaan.<verse eid="ISA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />Insa'nenaa'n shiyemekiir gadho hunemaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:3">renshi insa'neekinna booncho biraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:3">koobuwwatinna mundeti munde kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Iimatixxe urjuwwa duuchchi shudhudhdhi hitaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">iima mirqisanjo maxaafishsha mirqendaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:4">Urjuwwatik sannachchi duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">qoore harca'emmake woyinetike shafishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">bageexxi ibemmake balasetike shafishsha kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottik wolaantichchi iimate'ni asso'a heedeexxa asseechchi uduma ba'netee mureemmake Eedoomike arda'ni murte muro'a dirraan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">Isa. 63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Erm. 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Hiz. 25:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo. 1:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:14">Ibr. 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mil. 1:2-5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik wolaantichchi mundeti mundete kade'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">ha'yokanna godde'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">Gedheebiinke buruusixxenna re'etixxe mundenni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">gedhebiinke korbeessixxe kalattek ha'yinni buqende'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Bootsirake qachchike tolchinni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">Eedoomi giddonna jabaxxa murte qophpheesse'een.<verse eid="ISA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Gafarsiixxi sannenni welti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">laliink korminna goronsik welti ibaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:7">Bogi insa'neekinna mundeti corco hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">buttin insa'neekinna ha'yiki ha'yoke kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti halo fulo'a barra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:8">Tsiyoonixxenna moromaaxxi wogga afe'een.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Edoomixxi muummuwwa renje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:9">buttin isekinna ha'yaake kinjo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:9">bog isekinna ha'yitaaxxe leeyyanni.<verse eid="ISA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />Giira isexxinna hashshanna barra xoxxabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">wiliile isseexxinna duuchchi woddi'a tuqu tuqu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:10">Ilatenaa'n ilati qico'n ise onake kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">ayyinna langaxxa ookko'n sa'aabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:11">Wal. 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:3">19:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Joluwwatinna dhaddo ise giddo aaggaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">guutiguutalenna qoodhandi ise giddo mine ijaadhaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:11">Mageni Edoomi'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">isexxe diigenshaxxa wodaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">isexxe ba'nexxa tunbenna diriirsaan.<verse eid="ISA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Isexxi hayyoolenna mootummaxxe hiyyeme ye'emaaxxa dandeessaaxxa yaane affabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:12">akeekisanjuwwi isek duuchchinna kutti hiyyee ba'aan.<verse eid="ISA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Kinjiinke dalla'inni ijaremeeke iseke qachchiinxa ute</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">golluwwa isexxanna laalessikinna hagali liqinsaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">jeedaluwwiinxi bale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">guutiguutaluwwike galdumanna kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Qiilla gammoojjek biniinchuwwinna woraabeessuwwiki welti mitteba hedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">qiilla gammoojjexxe re'e fakkataak duriisuwwinna weli'aa weli ye'edhaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:14">Hashshixxi daduwwanna galduma ifika ookko assexxaanni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">umo ifikeenna he'naaxxa bakka alfinaan.<verse eid="ISA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Guutiguutalenna ookko mine ijaadhdhiteexxi quuphphe ibisaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">quqquussexaan, beltanna ifixxanna keela ifike'n kabbitaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:15">Allaattuwwatinna qaphpho qaphpho kaddaann</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">hortete ookko bukki hitaan.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottike maxaafa'n tennete hiyyende borreesendeexxa haasosse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">konnelchuwwanaa'n mittikinna xe'yabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">Mitti mitti geelchinna ifixxa qaphpho gophphabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">kunni ajaji afo'o isikenaa'n fule'een</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">konnelchuwwa Hafuuri isiki mitteba bukki assaan.<verse eid="ISA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />Konnelchuwwi isi qoobbo qoobbo insa'ne'a uggaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">anga isixxinna mikkeexxi konnelchuwwi'a qoodaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:17">Isenna duuchchi woddi'a konnelchuwwixxe kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">ilatenaa'n ilati qico'ni kunnelchuwwi ookko hedhaan.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s1">Woyyichcha Boga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Iikki qiilla gammoojjenna bago bogi gammadaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:1">qiilla gommoojjenna gammade pha'a hiyya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:1">Hadatishshanna dararaan.<verse eid="ISA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />Gammoojjetinna faaroti gammadaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Libaanoosiki ulfiinninna isi'a uwwemaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">Qermeeloosikannaa Saaroonika ulfinna oddowwaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Duuchchi Woddika Gootta no'okika lumoka gaachchanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">Mageniinka ulfinnanna undaan.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />Gophpheexxa hirre ha'nooxxa jabeessedhdhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:3">shaqqeeka mikituwwa jabeesse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:12">Ibr. 12:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />Sodaattaaxxa qalbe afeekara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">«Worbe mee sodaatte;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Mageni ha'noong dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">halo fulo'a dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Isinna halo fula abixxeexxi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Ha'noo anjiro'a dagaan.»<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />Eettene yanna balla'uwwinxi ille banendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:5">mansha duuddemmakixxi banendaan;<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Naafi gedummatishsha utalaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">afo'o duudeeki baneme'naa gammashshoti faarsaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">Qiilla gommoojjenaa'n muumme fuldaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">muummuwwatinna qiilla gammoojjenaa'n burqitaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mat. 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:22">Luq. 7:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Holatak maanchik bog balleessa kaddaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">baqaqeek buttinni wode'a burqisaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:7">Jedaluwwi diiphammaxxe baluwwa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">bada'a shonboqikinna qoocce lattaan.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Ookkonna lumok ora kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">«Woyyichcha hodhdhichcha» hiyyemee ye'emaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">batto'eekkirinna iso'n me'abaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Iikki ori isi hana me'aake mannike calla kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">ba'lak manninna ookkone oranaa'n milqiba'a.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Neenquwwikinna ookko hedhabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">bultaaki biniichchi iso'n galabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">kunniir eettenne bakka'n afemabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">anjireemek calli ookko hana me'aan.<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti wodeekir ille iima higaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">Faarsina'inna Tsiyooni'a e'yinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">duuchchi woddixxa gammashshonna kallachchiinsha umoke'ni uggudhdhinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">fenxe hiyyanna gammashsho alfinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">yaaddotinna ruphphi hiyya ookko'n bayyattaan.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s1">Senaakire Iyyerusaalemii'n Afo'o Fulchedhdhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:13-27">2 Moy. 18:13-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:1-19">2 Odo. 32:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />Hiziqiyaasi moyeexxe tommenna shoole wogga'n, Asoorik moyanji Seenaakireemi Yihuda giddo hedhemmaka jabake kinjiinke dalla'uwwika qachchuwwa loldineexxi injifatine ifiti hiissedhdhe. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />Moyanji Hiziqiyaasi anga uuwwo'a laqaashsha Asoorik moyanji isika loliinka manna ajajammaka, lumoke loliinke manninni welti Lakishii'n Iyyerusaalemi'a erge; isinna aligamike baleessiki wodi'i yaa'ammake dareeri qarqara seemma borcammake manjichchike fichchi bira uure. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Mootummatike miniki sooreessa ajajallo kademmaki Hilqiyaaki belti Eliyaaqemi, borreessanji Saaminaasinna jirte borreesa'aammaki Asaafiki belti Yoo'aahi isibaa mare. <verse eid="ISA 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Asooriki ajajalli hiyyee qici, «Moyanjo Hiziqiyaasi'a, ‹Asoorik moyanjo'n hitine kuldinaa qici, konnee qico riffi gophphettelchi ayyee addatteete? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />Haaso'i callinni loliinka malanna hunate ate'n labbe; isi ati anxa laqa gibbaatteki ayye'n adde assexxeete? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />Dedha Gibtsee ane gargartaani hite addatteten; yaane kinni Gbtse'n addata shombooqiinxe siqqo'ni irkati qixxete kaddeexxa ege'ni; shombooqi butute anga atixxa o'ootaan malee mittelchi'anna la'o fulabaan; Gibtseka moyaanjonna addataaka tennende heqqitaan› hitine kulle» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Asooriki ajajalli lebeexxi haaso'a'n hiyyee qici, « ‹Ati kinni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta no'oke Mageno addateennen› hitattoxxe hexxeen; yoona Yihudakinna Iyyerusaalemiki ardi konne mitte tolchimalchi edo calla magenoofataashsha assaate Duuchchi Woddike Gottika tolchimalchuwwa diiggettaki ati Hiziqiyaasindebaa? <verse eid="ISA 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />Tennexxee Asoorike moyanjike asso'a hasa'neexxa ate'ni kulo; gulufa dande'e gulufaaka manna affottole lame kuma fadhado ati'a uwwannon. <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />Ati hara shiixxoke hinaaka Asoorike ajajallika duuliinka manna dandeette ifi iimi'ni hoyyexxaboxxoken; tinni iita hexxe'naan Gibtseeki manni ani'a sarageeluwwakanna fadhado gulufamaka manna ani'a ergaan hita'n addatteetten. <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Ante kadoonnolenna konne boga lole balleessa dande'enneki Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe fedhi belo ati'a fakkaatta? Egendottoleqqa konne boga lole balleessannoshsha ane ajajeeki umo isikenni Duuchchi Woddike Goottan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Eliyaaqemi, Shebinanna Yo'aahi Asoorika loliinke mannika ajajallo, «No'o Sooryaka afo'o egennennaaxxee Sooryaake afo'inni haasottattoshsha kadhantaannen; dalla'ake'n ofo'leeki manni laqaashsha Ibrawotiinke laagadinni haasottoxxe'e» hine.<verse eid="ISA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Asoorike loliinke mannik ajajallinna, «Asooriki moyaanji tennee duuchcha ha'no'ninna moyanjo ha'nooke'n calla kulannoshsha anee ergechcho ha'no'n fakkattaata? Ha'nooshshanni foole'a ifika ito'anna shi'na ifinxa ha'wo'a ookkone dalla'i hana ofo'leeki ardi duuchchi'annatebaata?» hiyye hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Asoorike loliinke mannik ajajalli ofo'lemmabaa'n iimi'a ke'exxi uurre: qonqo qeerriseexxi Ibrawotiinke laagadinni hiyyee qici, «Ulfeessemeeki Asooriki moyaanji ha'no'a hiyyeexxa laqqe! <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />Hiziqiyaasi hiyyaxxe'ni sobendinoqqe'e; isi ha'noo anjira dande'abaan; <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />Hizqiyaasi ‹Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n addatte; isi no'o anjiraani; Asoorik lola'neeki manni qachchuwwa no'oke'n e'yabaashsha assaan› hiyya'n haaso'aaxxa laqqinoqqe'e. <verse eid="ISA 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />Hizqiyaasi hiyyaaxxa laqqinoqqe! Asoorik moyanji hiyya'nee qici, ammee anibaa daggine weli aage'naa hedhdhe: tennee ani hiyyannoxxa assitinnole duuchchiingi woyyinetike hiddichchixxannaa balasetike haqichchixxa gumma ittinaan; muummuwwa ha'nooxxika wode'e ha'witinaan. <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />Tinnina kaddaaki moyanji ha'nooka boga fakkaataake boga'n ha'noo iyyemare ofo'lshooleten; ookkone boga'n woyinetixxa booka ha'witinaashsha woyinetike hiddichchuwwanna gelteexxa midha wiilsatiki fichchuwwi hedhen. <verse eid="ISA 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />Tennexxee Hizqiyaasi ‹Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti yo'oxxenaa'n ha'noo anjiraan!› hiyya'n ha'noo gowwisoqqe; isi gosa gosake arduwwike magenuwwi giddii'ni mittekanna midde Asoorike moyanjixxe anganaa'n dande'e gatiseeki hedhee? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Yoonata Hamaatikinnaa Arifaadik bogiki magenuwwi haba hedhe? Sefaariwayiki mageni haba geye? Yoona konne magenuwwinna'ni mittikinna midde Semaariya anxe anganaa'n dande'e gatiseeki hedhee? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Konne duuchchiinge bogiki magenuwwi anxe anganaa'n boga ifika dande'e gatinseexxi yanna hexxe? Yoonata ha'no ‹Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Iyyerusaalemi gatisaani› hitina'neekita hittate?»<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Ardi kinna edi wodda moyanji Hizqiyaasi insa'nee ajajemmashsha mitte hiyyichchonna buccuqqi hiyyebaang sammi hiyye. <verse eid="ISA 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Ookkonneechchi uduma galchatike mineke ajajallo kade'eemmak Hilqiyaaki belti Eliyaaqeemi, borreessanji Shebinanna, jirtetik borreesanji Asaafiki belti Yoo'aahi yaadoti ifi ifixxa seemma daddarreexxi moyanjo Hiziqiyaasibaa dange; Asoorike loliinke mannik ajajalli haasoe'emmaxxa duuchchanna iso'n kulle.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s1">Moyanji Hizqiyaasi Issayaasii'i Gorsa Qodhdhee Qico</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:1-7">2 Moy. 19:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Moyanji Hizqiyaasi tennee duuchcha laqeexxa yanna yaadoti seemma ifixxa dadare; dooniyyatanna oddo'weexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottike woyyichchi galmiba'a me'e. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />Mootummatike miniki ajajalli Eliyaaqemii'i, mootummatike minika borreessanjo Shebinanna qeese giddii'ni ege'nemeeke kadeeka manna Amootsika belto wabeeka Issayaasiba'a erge; insa'nena dooniya odo'winemaani. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />Ins'nenna Hiziqiyaasixxa erga Issayyaasi'n hine kullee qici, «Tinni barra wixixxi hiyyatixxe, xixxichchiinxenna salphiniinxe barran; ildaaxxi yanna gelte'naa ciniiffachchotee hunna gophpheexxe manjichchoshsha kandeennen; <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />Asooriki moyanji konne hedhotika Asoorika loliinka sooreessa ajajallo Duuchchi Woddik Gootti yowwo'a ergeen; aki magaada Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atik Mageni konne yowwichcho laqeexxi yowwammaka xixaaxxe hexxeen; tennexxee arda no'okixxe oddonaa'n lubbo gataake mannixxee Mageno soodaat.»<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Wabeeki Issayaasi moyanji Hizqiyaasi hiyye ergee qico laqeexxi, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />Isinni wirri asse hiyye ergee qici, «Asoorike moyanjiki erganjuwwi anee yowwemmaka yowwichcho laqqetaxxee sodaattoxxe ‹hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti› hiyye. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Boga isike'n hexxeexxe yaanexxa hame laqe weekemaashshanna boga ifikixxa odo laqeexxi weekemmaashshana illee iima hige ifike bogiba'a me'aashshanna wolantichchoke'ni reyaashsha assannon.»<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoorik Mann Haloofachchotixxa Wele Erga Ergeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:8-19">2 Moy. 19:8-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Asoorik ajajalli Lakishii'n ke'e bira hedheeke Libiinake qachcha mare lolate'n hedheexxa laqe; tennexxee ookko'a me'e. <verse eid="ISA 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Isinna Tophiyiinki moyanji Tirihaaqi atee lolatee dage'een hitaaxx odo laqe; tennee laqee yanna Hiziqiyaasibaa konneechchi butta hexxeexxa erga erganjuwwake'n hiyyeexxi ergee qici, <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />«Yihudiinke moyanjo Hiziqiyaasii! Ati addattatteki mageni ‹Iyyerusaalemi Asoorike moyanjixxe anga'n sa'isse uwwabaan! Hite addattattek mee atee sobowwaal!› <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Asoorik moyanjuwwi mitte boga lole balleessatee ke'aa wodda duuchcha hitta ookkonee boga bakka balleessaaxxa laqqeeten; atita tennenaa'n fuldattochcho ate'n fakkaattaata? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Ediki annuwwi anki Gozaanika, Karaanikanna Retsefiinka qachchchuwwa bakka balleessineen; Telaasar hedhammaka Edeenika arda shinneen; tinni duuchchi kaddaa wodda insa'neke magenuwwinaa'n mittikinna midde insa'nee gatisa dandeemmata? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Hamaatiki, Arifaadik, Sefariwayimiki Heenakinna Iwwaake qachchuwwiki moyanjuwwi haba hedhe?»<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hizqiyaasixxa Soodaachcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Moyanji Hizqiyaasi borreessa iyyemaremmake mannixxe anganaa'n adheexxi haasesse; woyyichchi galmi giddi'a borreessa adhdhe me'exxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo uggeexxi, <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />hiyyeexxi soodaate qici: <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />«Dada Duuchcha Ajajatoke Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Magenoo! Kurubelite hinaaxxe keela affeexxe dada hana hexxettek Mageni ate callan; butta duuchcha'n hedheeke moyanjuwwi duuchchi'a Duuchchi Woddiki Gooti ateten; iimanna butta daddetteki ateten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Fula. 25:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Ee Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa! Seenaakireemi! Ate hedhotika Mageno maa hiyye yowweexxa laqi.<verse eid="ISA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />«Ee Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa! Asoorik moyanjuwwi heddo moyanjuwwa bireexxi insa'neka boganna urmake assineexxa lanqeennen. <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />Haqqetanna, kino bonce giisse'ne magenooffatammaka gosa gosaka dharichchuwwa magenuwwa gunbe balleessineen. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Ee Duuchchi Woddike Gootta no'oke Magenoo! Atin calli Magenoke kaddettexxa buttatiki ardi duuchchi ate ege'naashsha ta'a konne Asoorike mannixxe anganaa'n inbabo'noshsha no'o gargari.»<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Issayyaasi Moyanjo Hizqiyaasibaa Ergeexxa Erga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:2-37">2 Moy. 19:2-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Amootsiki belti Issayaasi moyanjo Hiziqiyaasibaa ergeexxi ergaa: «Duuchchi Woddiki Isira'eeliki Gootti Magenikinna moyanjo Asoorikixxa soodaachcho laqeennen, <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti isixxee hiyyeeki hiyyichchi konneechchi butta hedheeken:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">«Senaakiremi! Iyyerusaalemiki ardi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">atee cee'ma'n atee gebaan ati baqattatto woddanna ati uduma hedhe umo ate'ni le'misaan.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />Holati ille atixxa bandettexxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">qonqo atixxa qeerisse cancita'n,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:23">Yowwita'ninna hegaa uuddetteki ayyete ati'a fakkaate?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Isira'eelike woyyichcha Magenobaa?<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />Ati'a ergatammaka manna ergite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">Duuchchi Woddika Gootta</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Hite yowwitette qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">‹Anxe loliinxe gareke jabeenninni lumollamma Libaanoosixxa koobuwwa abixxennen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Qeqeraramma Libaanoosixxa haqquwwanna elollamma birbrissuwwa kakkarennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">yo'oshsha himmi hiyyeeke gongomi giddo mare geyennen.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />Annafee boguwwaa'n bale u'menne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">ookko'ni wode'e fulche ha'wennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">lumoke anke loliinke manniki hirbi Gibtseke bogika wodu'uwwa basseen› hita'n ifi saaddetten.<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />«Qeerraaxxe yanna edi gama tenne duuchcha murenneki ante kadennexxa laqqeebexxoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">Konne yaada qophpheesse muuxamiin qico'n geessisenneki anten:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Kinijiinke dalla'ika qachchuwwa diige oletixxe tuulo kadaashsha hunna ati'a uwwenneki anten.<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Ookkone qachchuwwik ardi hunna gopheen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">alaannenna kandaaxxa gonpheen shoonkeen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Diidi giddike daraarishsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">reefixxe lattoshsha, mini iima fulde ikki woddi baggammaxxe badda'ashshaten.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />«Ani atixxa duuchchiinxa yaane ege'neennen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">maa assitattoxxanna haba'a me'itaattexxa uudaannen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:28">Ane'n mufetti kexxettexxanna ege'neennen.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />Ane'n mufate kexxettaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">ifi saada atixxe mansha anxe'n laqendemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">Sano atixxe'n hookko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">afo'o atike'ninna bixaala anka uggannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">Daggettenga ora illee iima higgattoshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">atee assannon.<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />«Ookkonneechchi uduma Issayyaasi moyanjo Hizqiyaasi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">«Tinni duuchchi muuxendaaki beesis konnechchi butta hedheeken,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">«tenne wogga'ninna daggaaxxe wogga'n ifitti lattaaxxa midha ittinaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">Sakkaxxe wogga'n kinni wiilsitine aasexxinaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">woyyinetika hiddichcho karisexxinaan gumma ittinaan.<verse eid="ISA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Haaroba Yihudake ardixxa hafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:31">hidda ifika butti'a oltaan; iimi darre'ninna gumma gummisaan.<verse eid="ISA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Tinni duuchcha muuxendaashsha Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti mureme'en.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:32">Iyyerusaalemi giddonna Tsiyoonixxe kooba hana ba'netenaa'n gataaki manni hedheen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:32">Tinne duuchcha muuxendaashsha assitaaxxi dada duuchcha ajajaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe gaaben.<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />«Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Asoorike moyanjixxee haaso'eexxi konneechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:33">«Senaakire konne qachcha'n haranga e'yabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:33">Gabe midde darbatabaan: wonte abixxeeki loliinki manninna qachchinba'a shiqabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">buttina tullubaan.<verse eid="ISA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Isi dagemange ora higaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:34">konne qachchiba'anna e'yabaan»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:34">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />«Ani umo ankeenna erganjo anke Daawwitixxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:35">konne qachcha gollanno; isoo anjirannon!» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />Eettene hashsha'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki erganji Asoorik manni hedheeke dhibbanna saddeeta tommenna onde kuma loliinka manna shiye: gorsa manni diiphii'ni ke'aa wodda duuchchiingi renshi leelle. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Asoorik moyanji Seenaakireemi udumaa enqedhe me'e Nenewe ofo'le.<verse eid="ISA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Mitte barra Niserook hiyyemaake ifike galmi giddo isi magenoonfachchote'ni hedhee'naa lame isixxi oose Adiraameelekinna Saaratsaari wolaantichchik isoo shilteexxi Araarat hiyyemaake bogibaa baajje me'ite; isixxa bakkanna isixxe oosenaa'n mitti Asiradooni hiyyemaak moye.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s1">Moyaanji Hizqiyaasi Ela gophe Fayyee qico</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:1-11">2 Moy. 20:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:24-26">2 Odo. 32:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />Ookkone baro'n moyaanji Hizqiyaasi jaba qicinni ela gonphe reyo shiqeemman: Amootsiki belti Wabeekichchi Issayaasi iso Yihudo'a isiba mareexxi «Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ‹tenne ela gonphenaa'n fayyitaboxxon; rertattaxxee mine atika giissedhi› hiyyeen» hiyyeexxi kule.<verse eid="ISA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Hiziqiyaasinna albi gimotiba'a wirri hiyye Duuchchi Woddike Goottiba'a soodata'n hiyyee qici, <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />«Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Mitte godobinninna addatenshati ati'a ergatemennexxa, ati gammaddattoxxa yaane assennexxa kassi hiyyi» hiniqqifate oodhe.<verse eid="ISA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Issayaasi'i hiyye ajajee qici: <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />«Hiziqiyaasiba marte, ‹Kunniseten edik ani atiki Daawwitiki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ani Mageni sooddachcho atixxa laqennen; indiddo atixxanna uudennen; tennexxee tommenna onde wogga edi'a hexxattoshsha ati'a lebeennen. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />Ateenna konne Iyyerusaalemika qachcha Asoorike moyanjixxe anganaa'n gatisannon; qachchakanna golle heqqannon.<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />« ‹Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti asso'a uwweeka addachchiis isika hiyyichcho muuxo'a ati'a uwwa'neeke beesis konneechchin butti'a hedheeken: <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Moyaanji Akaazi giissisemmaxxee iimi'a mine isikiba'a da'minammake riqiinki gaaddisi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti higgeen tomme taakkarro udumi'a higaashsha assaan› » tennexxee gaadiddotinna tomme koobowwa saxxe udumi'a higge.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Hiziqiyaasinna elagonphetenaa'n fayyeeshshanni konneechchi butta hexxeexxa faaro borreesse.<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />Ani «Anqan woggaake gamisa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:10">reyotixxe hulabaa'n sa'a ani'a hasisaata?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:10">Ank gateek bari anenaa'n adhdhema hasisaata?» hiyyenne.<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />Aninna hiyyennee qici, «Higgeen Duuchchi Woddika Gootta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">Duuchchi Woddik Gootta hedhaake manxe bita'n uudabe'no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:11">Ta'anni edi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">manjiinxa sanne uudabe'non;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">tenne butta'n hedheekiirinninna hedhaba'non.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Mini ank allalisnajiinke duunkanishsha goshemeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">aninaa'ninna adhdhemeen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Hedho anxannaa seemma gamake manjishsha mirqedhenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">isinna mirqisanjokenaa'n anee kute'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">gorsinaa'n galgali qico'ni anee qubi assatee wiinandette.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />Soodaa qico'n raara'nanni galaanan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">neenqinsha miqe anxa duuchcha enqitetten:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">hashsha yookaan barra shiltattochcho labbeemman.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Huummotishsha raarannan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">faachchiinxe amashsha yaaddoti yuusannen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">Iimi'a ceeqqisatenaa'n kexxeexxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">ille anxi yo'oshsha gophpheemman.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">Ee duuchchike Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa maganneten tenne rakko duuchchaana'n anee gatisi!»<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />Tennexxee maayyannota?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">Duuchchi Woddike ane'n haaso'edheen; umo isikenni isi tenne asse'een</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">Anxe lubboxxe wixxinni'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">baro anka duuchcha shaqqunteti me'anno.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Ani atixxee hedhotike kadeennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">hedho anxa hafuura adhdhisi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:16">Anee fayyise hedhannoshsha assi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">hedhotanna ani'a uwwi.<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Kunnise wixixxi hiyyat rakkatennexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">anxe la'o kadde;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">Ba'netixxe balenaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">atixxe jaalalanni anee heqqitette;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">Cubbo anxa duuchchanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">ifi udumi'a hundette.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Wiidda bale atee galateefataba'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">reyo atee ajajeba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">hunda balete'n dhidhimaakiir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">atixxa xuurameessumma addatabaan.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Ani atee assaanelsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">hedhoti hedheekiir atee galatefataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">atixxe addatenshaxxenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">anuwwi oose ifixxe kulaan.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee anjiraan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">tennexxee no'o baro duuchcha'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galma'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">jimmaatetike faarotike miyinni faarsannon.<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Issayaasi «Raxxeexxa balase runbe miserake'n hana gannoole fayyanni insa'ne'a kuleemmani» hiyyeeman.<verse eid="ISA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Moyaanji Hiziqiyaasinna, «Fayye galmiba'a me'a dande'annoxxa ege'nishshaaki beesisi maachcho?» hiyye Issayyaasi qore.<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s1">Baabiloonii'n Erga Dageka Manna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">2 Moy. 20:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />Eettene yanna'n Baabiloonik moyanji Balaadaki belti Meerodaak Baladaani moyanji Hizqiyaasi elagophe fayyeexxa laqe; tennexxee isi'a uwwati welti borro borreesse erge. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Hizqiyaasinna erga dagemmaka manna gammashshoti qophedhe; mootummatik miyiinke miyi giddo hexxeexxa karra duuchcha birretika siblljonna worqe fishitaaxxa qurunfuuduwwanna shitto loliinka miyiwwanna miyuwwiinke mini giddo hexxeexxa karra duuchcha insa'ne'ni leellishe: mootummatike miyi giddo kaddo mootumma ifixxi giddo heene bakka'ninna hexxeexxa karra duuchcha Hizqiyaasi insa'ne'ni leellishebaangi gateechchi mittiichchinna hedhemmabaani. <verse eid="ISA 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Ookkonneechchi uduma wabeekichchi Issayaasi moyanjo Hizqiyaasibaa mareexxi «Kunni manni habaa'n dageeke? Atee maa hiyye?» hiyyeexxi qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:3">Hiziqiyaasinna «Kunni manni dageek Baabilooni hiyyemaake bayyike boginaa'niten» hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="ISA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Issayyaasinna «Galchatike mini giddo maachchcho uunde?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:4">Hiziqiyaasinna «Duuchchin geechcho uundeen; miwwuwiinke mini giddo hexxeexxa karra duuchcha insa'ne'a leellishshebo'nolchi mittichchinna hedhebaani» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Issayaasinna moyanjo, «Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qico laqi, <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />Ediki annuwwi techchi qico'n mootummatike mine'n hexxeexxa karra duuchcha mittetinna gattebaangi Baabilooni'a bukki assine adhdhendaaxxe barra daggaan; mittichchi gataachchi hedhebaan, hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />Atixxe horte giddii'n mitti mitti booji'emeexxi Baabiloonike moyanjinke mootummatike mine'n adhdhemeexxi middisaake kade ergatemaashsha assemaan.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:1-7">Dan. 1:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">2 Moy. 24:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Odo. 36:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Moyanji Hizqiyaasi baro, isike'n nage'ikinna ti'ni hiyye hedha hexxeexxa ege'nemmaxxee «Duuchchi Woddiki Goottaa ane'ni ergitettek hiyyichchi eloken» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s1">Mageniinka Arda Dayyeessaaka Hiyyichcho</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Dayyeesse arda anka dayyeesse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:1">hiyya'neen ha'nook Mageni.<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />Iyyerusaalemi'a shaqake haaso'inni ise'n kulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">ise'ninna lallabbe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">Garbumati ergatendammak isek bar muuxemeedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">isexxe cubbok hirinna uwwemedheen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">Ifixxe cubbo duuchchixxee Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe anganaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">lame anga mura woxa adhdhite'een.<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Lallaba kulaa'neeke manjiki hafuuri hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">«Duuchchi Woddike Gootitka ora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">qiilla gammoojje'n qophpheesse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">No'oke Mageni'a lumooka ora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">qiilla gammoojje'n giisse!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:3">Mat. 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:3">Mar. 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:23">Yoh. 1:23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Dhooquwwa duuchcha wo'mitaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">koobuwwatinna tullichchuwwi tiriggi hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">bobboqqichchi boginna dirrete kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">gooruwwatinna diidake kaddaan.<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti gaachchaninna leellaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:5">manji duuchcinna isoo mitteba uudaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:5">Duuchchi Woddike Goottik afo'inna tenne haaso'edheen.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:4-6">Luq. 3:4-6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Mitti hafuurinna anee'e «Raar!» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">Aninna «Maa hiyye raaranno?» hiyyenne.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 40:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">«Manji duuchchi badda'atishshaten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">isik gaachchanninna badda'atike daraarishshaten.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />Badda'a baggaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">daraarikinna harca'aan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hafuuri itti diidalleessedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">dhugaande, ardi badda'aten.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Badda'a baggaan; daraarikinna harca'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:8">No'oke Mageniki hiyyichchi kinni duuchchi woddi'a hedhaan.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:10-11">Ya'i. 1:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:24-25">1 Phex. 1:24-25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />Ati koo Tsiyooni'n eloxxa odo kuldaatek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">lumoxxe kooba hani'a qabati;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Koo ati Iyyerusaalemi'a eloxxa yaane iyyedagaattek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">atika hafuura gikki assite raar;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Gikki assi meenni sodaat;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">Yihudake qachchuwwa'ninna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">«Kunnise ha'nook Mageni!» hiyyi.<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Kunnise Lumok Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hunnat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">Isixxi hirre isi'a galchitaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">kunnise isik hiri isinni welti hedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">isi uwwaaki hirinna isinni welt hedheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:11">Isa. 62:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">Wal. 22:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />Ifika hore alalsanjishsha bobbaalsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">gedhebiinka buruusuwwanna ifixxe anganni bukki assaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">Hanqalfenna insa'nee abixxaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">unu'naakaaranna xexxe'achchoti akeekaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:15">Hiz. 34:15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:11">Yoh. 10:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Magenik Qixxo'aak Ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Wode'uwwa oobot mikeeki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">iimuwwatanna ifixxe taakkonni mikeek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">Buttatika buttinuwwa safaranjik bukk asse abideek;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">koobuwwa kiiloti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">tullichchuwwakanna mikisanjik mikeek ayyete?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />Duuchchi Woddika Goottika hafuura qalbeefateek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:13">isi'a gorsa uwweexxi isoo barsiiseek aate?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:34">Rom. 11:34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:16">1 Qor. 2:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Ege'na alfo'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti gorsa ayyena'n laqedhe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">toggichcha ora isoo aate barsiise?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">Isoo ege'na barsiseek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">qalbeefachchotika ora isi'a leellisheek aatemma?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Kunnise gosa gosak arduwwi waabi giddo hexxeexxe cingoshaten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">kiilot hana hedheeke huurishsha laakko'emaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">giddichchuwwatanna bukotishsha mikaan.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Libaanoosi hedheek haqqichchuwwi tolchimalchiinxe haqqe'a geyaba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:16">Libaanosi hedheeke horik laakkossinna cincatike tolchi'a heeno'maan.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Gosa gosak arduwwi duuchchi isi edo mitteechchonabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">insaa'ne isi edo laakkossa afeebaachchishshaten.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />Yoona Mageno ayyinni welti qixxeessitina?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:18">heene fakkenni weltita weli afensissina?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Bocendeexxa misile angatixxe ogek hujalli bocaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">worqe tumaakinna ise'e worqe buqaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">biretika sibiljika haachchabanna ise'a qixxesaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:29">Erga. Huj. 17:29</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Iitta hexxeexxa uwwa shiqisha dande'aabak buxxanji hiyyeessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">quqi itabaaka haqichcho filaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:20">Ibbabaaxxa fakkenna uurrisatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">ege'nemeeka angatixxa oge afeeka manjo hasaan.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Ha'no egendineeba'a adana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">Laqqineebaa adana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:21">Olminaa'n ha'non kullebaa adana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">butta dadeendeexxe yannaa'n qalbeefatinebaa adana?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />Isi buttatike ququbbinni iimi darre eettene ifixxe moote'n ofo'laan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">buttatik arduwwinna awwaanesiishshaten.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">Iimuwwatanna gogiinsha dhisaakenna galdumiinke duunkaanishshanna otaaken;<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />Isi lumollamma galchammaka manna salphise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:23">he'nebaashsha assaan.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Insa'ne reefi latee hidda adda oltebaake hiddichchishshaten:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti diidallo ergaa wodda iikki woddi bangaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">huuriinshsha inbeebi gopheman.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />«Yoona, anee ayyinni qixxe assitina'nee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:25">Ayyinnita fakkesesitina?» hiyya'neeni woyyichchi Mageni.<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Toggi hitine Iimi'a uude:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">uudina'neexxa urijuwwa dadeki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">Isi tenne urjuwwa sannachchinsha bobbaasaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">laakkossik me'eke kaddeexxa ege'ne'en:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">mitte mittenda summiki ye'aani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">isi hunnaameesakenna yo'oshsha lumoke kademmaxxee:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">tenne urjuwwanaa'ni mitte midde baxxaaxxi hexxabaan.<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Ya'iqoobixxe sanne koo Isira'eelike arda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">«Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee uuda'nebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">anxa yaane butta ugge waalen»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">hita'n mayee gungundatto?<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Egendeboxxoo? Laqqeeboxxoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">Mageni Duuchchi Woddike Goottan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">isi buttatanna ise giddo hedheechcho duuchcha dadeeken:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">Isi haranga shaqqabaan yookaan gophabaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">yaada isika ayyinna dande'e ege'naak hedhebaani.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />Isi hunna gopheeke hunna uwwaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:29">jabeenna afebaake jabeenna lebaan.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Dargaggeyye midde hunna gophphaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:30">ka'umuwwikinna jabenna gophe ibaan:<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'ni addante he'naake'e kinni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">haaroonse'ma'ne me'inaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">Sinbiriinsha keelik ke'naan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">gonginaani gonphabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">me'inaani shaqqinabaani.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Isira'eelixe Addachchiise Haaso'eeka Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />Mageni hiyya'nee qici: «Ha'no giddichchuwwa giddo hexxina'neeke gosa gosak ardaa! Ca'li hitine laqqee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">ardi hunna ifixxa haaroonsedhowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">Edo dange haasonnowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">murtetixxe songo'n mitteba shinqo.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />«Lole injifataaka ke'isseexxi borotenaa'n iyyedagaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">ergatemo'a ifi'a ye'eeki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Gosa gosaka arda anga isixxe'n sa'isse uwwaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">moyanjuwwikinna isi hunda gallaashsha assaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">wolaantichchi ifikinni bukotishsha gabetanna huurinsha xeeraani.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />Konneechchi edo lekka ifixxeenni mare ege'nebaaka ora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:3">insa'nee gusse shorraa wodda mittilchinna isoo miidhaachchi hedhebaani.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Tinni kaddaashsha asseeki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">Hundii'ninni manji beltixxa jirte towatammaki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Ani Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti sirende'n hedhennan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">udumanna hedhannoki anenden.»<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />Giddichchuwwa giddik ardi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:5">ani assennexxa duuchcha uude'en:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:5">tennexxee yo'oshsha alaayye culphisen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:5">Mitteba bukki hiyye aniba'a dageen.<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />Mitti mitte gargaaraan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:6">dayyokanna, «Meeco'o jabaati!» hiyyaan.<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Haqqetixxe ogeki manji worqe tume giissammaka jajjabeessaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">magenoonfantamaxxa fakke qoceti boce ca'a asse giissammakinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">tumatik siblji hana tummammakanna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">Mee co'o jabaati, «Elo qico tunde'eten!» hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">magenoonfantammaxxi fakke lele'mitabaa qico'ni mismareti ganaan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tumatike sibilji hana eebe diimateke sibljo mitteba loobatike sibljon.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />«Yaane kinni ati, koo erganjo anke Isira'eeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">Anke arda kaddotta'a atee fi'lenneken</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">jaalo anke Abirihaamixxe horten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:7">2 Odo. 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Ya'i. 2:23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />Buttatixxe gabalanaa'n ate iyyedagennen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">shooliinge kasanaa'n atee ye'enneni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">‹Erganjo anke kaddatton› hiyye atte fi'lenne malee gibebo'non.<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Ani atinninn welti hedhennen sodaattoxxe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">Ani atike Magenon, alaaltoxxe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">Ani atee jabessannon, gargaarannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">jabaxxe anxe hirrenni atee kiphannon.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />«Ate'n aareti ke'aaki duuchchi injifatemee salphataan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:11">ate'ninna fuggoxxin ke'aaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:11">ba'aani.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Ate'ni ke'aaka naphuwwa hassenna midde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">affabexxon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:12">Atee lolo'a ke'ammakaranna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">inbeeba gophphatton:<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />‹Meecco'o sodaattoxxe, alaaltoxxe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">middixxa atixxa anga abide atee gargaarannon›</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:13">Hiyya'n atee jajjabeessaneeki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Mageno atiken.<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />Corroqatishsha hunna afebexxoke koo Ya'iqoobi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">Koo shiixexxetteke Isira'eel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">Ani atee gargaarannon sodaattoxxe,» hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">atee wodannok ante Isira'eelike woyyichcha Magenon.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />«Kunnise, haaroxxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">qaraxxa isso affeexxe haaroxxe midha uxxinammaxxe maashineshsha atee assannon:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">Koobuwwatanna hirbeessite bulleessitattoni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">tulluwwatanna huurake assitatton.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Iimi'a xeertatton:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">diidallotinna bukki assite adhdhite me'itaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">hobonbaltetinna xeerte birtaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">Ati kinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n gammaddatton:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">anke Isira'eelike woyyichchi summinni elle alfitatton.<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />«Hiyyeeyyenna rakkiyye wode'e haalsexxaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">kaddo malee mittechchonna alfinabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">wode'e dheebotte qonqo insa'neexxi baggaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">Yaane kinni ani Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti soodaachcho insa'neexxa laqannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">aninna Isira'eeliki Mageni haranga insa'nee waalabe'non.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Bagoxxe tulluwwa hana wodi'i ya'aashsha assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">dhooquwwa giddii'ninna muummetki wodi'i sa'aan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">Qiilla gammoojje wodi'i eelaaxxe bakka kaddaashsha assannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">bagoki buttininna muumme phu'issaake kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />Qiilla gammoojje'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">birbirsuwwa, waaccuwwa, dakkadhatixxa haqqenna ejeersuwwi lataashsha assannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">gammoojjichcha boga'ni hi'neessa, qeerraro hi'neessanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">ejeersuwwa mitteba kaassannon.<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />Tennee manni uudaan; ege'naan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi angan tenne assiteexxa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">Isira'eeliki woyyichchi konnechchuwwa dadeexxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">duuchchiingi qalbeefataan, hubate galchedhaan.<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Dharichcha magenuwwa Gibaaxxa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />«Ha'no moronsha ifixxa shiqishshe» hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:21">«Ha'nooxxa dhugaanna iyyedaaqqe» hiyya'neen Ya'iqoobik moyanji.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />Edi'a kaddaaxxa duuchcha no'o'n kuldo'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">magenoofatinammaxxa fakkuwwa iyyedagge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Hubantonna'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">muuxama insa'neekanna egennonna'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">edo kadde saxxeexxa yaanuwwa no'a haaso'we</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Daggaaxxe yaanuwwaxxenna no'a ca'a asse.<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />Magenumma ha'nooxxa egennona'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">edi'a kaddaaxxa duuchcha no'o'ni kuldinaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">eloxxa yaane assitinaata:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">Yookaani uundennexxi alaanne culphinsannoshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">fuggoxxa yaane assitnaata.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Ha'no laakossi giddo e'itnabani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">huje ha'nooxxi haranga mitte la'o affeexxebaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">ha'no fi'liteneek corifachchisa'neeken.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />«Ani mitte middii'ni ke'isse'naa isinna dage'en;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">arishsho fuldamma darre'n daga'neek Isi summa anka ye'aaken</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">Waatichchi dhoqqe hirbeessammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">isi boga galchammaka manna dhoqqetishsha liissaan.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />No'o egennannoshsha tenne'e sirende'ni haaso'ek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">‹isi dhugaaten› hinannoshsha edise haaso'ek ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">Mittikinna bucuqqi hiyye haaso'ebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">edise kuleengi hedhebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">haaso'a ha'nokanna laqeek hedhebaan.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />Sirende'ni, ‹konnechchuwwa uudi›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:27">hiyyennexxi Tsiyooni'n kulennak anitemman</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:27">Iyyerusaalemi'ana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:27">eloxxa odo sa'issaak uwwe'ennen.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Uudennenni ayyinna hedhemmabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">oddo insa'neexxe'ni gargaraak hedhebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">laqanno woddanna hiissichcho uwwaak mittikinna hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Kunnise magenuwwi duuchchi woyi fulakebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">huje insa'neexxinna onaken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">insa'neexxi fakkuwwa diidallo duwwixxen.<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Erganjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />«Ani kiphe abideennek fi'leennekinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">iso'ni gammadaanneki anke erganji kunnise;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">Hafuura anka isi'a uwwennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">isi gosa gosake ardi duuchchi'a dhugaat muraan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luq. 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">9:35</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />Cance haaso'abaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:2">yookaan ora me'ammakiir laqaashsha hafuura ifika gikki assabaan;<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />Filiinxe shonbooqiinxa midde xe'e asse enqabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">jululli hiyyeeka xassanna xolsabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">dhugaatixxi murte addatend hujendaashsha assaan.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />Buttate'n dhugaa hujendaashsha assaa qico'n;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:4">Isi gophabaan; iso uurrisaakinna hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:4">giddichchuwwa seera isika addataan.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:18-21">Mat. 12:18-21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />Iimuwwa dadeexxi kasakenaa'n kasiin qico'n dhiseek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">Buttatanna ise giddo hedhachcho duuchcha dadeek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">hedhotanna hafuura uwweeki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni hiyya'nee qici:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:24-25">Erga. Huj. 17:24-25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />«Ani Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti qullummati atee ye'eennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">anga atixxa abide atee heqqannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">Ardi duuchchi'a ati darre'ni kakateennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">gosa gosake arda'a ati darree'ni ifa iyyedagannon.<verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />Tennexxee balla'uwwa ille bandatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">dukkana bale giddo usuremeemmakaara fulchitatton.<verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />«Ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottan; summi ankinna konenden.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">Ulfinna anka welekee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">galata ankanna fakkuwwatee uwwabe'non<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Kunnise edise ani haaso'ennexxi yaanuwwa duuchcha muuxendeen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:9">Ta'anna edi'aanna kaddaaxxe haarooxxe yaanuwwaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">ise kaddeebaa edi darre haaso'aannen.»<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galatiinxa Faaro</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />Abbaayyati hana me'itinaakinna galaanuwwi qarqaranna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">oddooluwwi giddo hexxineeki duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a haarooxxa faaro faarse!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">Buttatik ardi duuchchinna galatiinxa faaro faarse!<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Qiilla gammoojjenna gammoojjek qachchuwwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">iittanni Qeedariki arduwwi hedha'neeki olla'i hafuura gikki assowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">Sela'ike qachchi giddo hedha'neeki manni gammashshoti faarsowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">koobuwwatixxe xungo'n ililinsowwaal.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Insa'nenna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ulfessinowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:12">galaanike manna'ninna galata isika lassinowwaal.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti janniinsha fulaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">qonqo qeerriseexxi duulokee lallabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">naphuwwa isikanna injifataan.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Arda Ifika Gargaaratee Uwweexxa Addachchiisa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />«Qeerraaxxe yanna'a osseennen sammi hiyyenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">ca'li hiyyenne ifi abide turennen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">Ta'a kinni cinfattexxe meyyaxxe manjoshsha aadannen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">aare hafuura qucci hiyyennen<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />Koobuwwatanna tullichchuwwa balleessannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">itti hana lateechcho duuchcha bassannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">wode'uwwakanna bago buttinna hiissannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">baleessuwwakanna basse xo'o assannon.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />Balla'uwwi me'e egennebaaka ora'n akeekannon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">edo ege'nebaak ora insa'nee iyyedagannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">insa'ne edo dukkanna ifake assannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Bobboqichcha boga dirrete assannon.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">Tinni yaane duuchchi ani muuxannoxxen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">insa'nee waalabo'non.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Adibaaruwwa addete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:17">misluwwa, ‹Ha'noo magenuwwa no'okeni› hiyyaakiri salphataan.»<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edike Dedhinaa'n Isira'eelixxa Jiila Gopha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />«Ha'no mansha duudde'eki caqasse!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:18">Ha'no balla'uwwikinna hubatte uudde!<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Anke erganjishsha balla'i ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">Erga'enneke anka erganjishsha mansha duudeeki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">Ani'a xuurameessake kadeeke manjishsha balla'i ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">Yookaan Duuchchi Woddike Goottike erganjishsha balla'i ayyete?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />Koo sira'eel! Lumoxxa yaane uudeetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:20">yaane kinn galchexxebexxon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:20">mansha laqqaanxe affeeten; yaane kinni ati laqqabexxon.»<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti qullumma ifixxee hiyyeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">seera ifika lumokanna ulfaateke assate'n gammade.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Ardi kunni saamememeekenna mulqemeeken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">wolo'o giddo fonxoreme'eeken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">usuriinke mine'ni leellabaashhsa cufeme'eeken</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">saamemme'eeken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Ayyinna insa'nee anjiraak hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Boji'emeedheen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">«Insa'ne ille iima hiisse» hiyyaaki hedhebaan.<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Ha'no giddii'n tennee dho'o hiyye laqeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:23">daggaaxxe yannexxee qalbeeffachchoti caqasaaki ayyete?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Isira'eelika arda saamatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">Iisira'eeli'i booji'ote sa'isse uwweek ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Cubbo hunje balleessinennek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">Duuchchi Woddike Goottabaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">ora isika hordofatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">seera isikenna ajajema gonphennaxxeeten.<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Tennexxee giiratishsha bubba'neexxa ifixxa mufe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">lolaase bagedo insa'ne'n dune.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">Giiratik bubenjinni insa'nee buqe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">Insa'ne kinni tenne qalbeefantebaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">giiratinna insa'nee gubbeen; insa'ne kinni qaabbantebaan.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Arda Ifika Anjiro'a Addachchiise Haaso'eeka Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Ta'a kinni, koo Ya'iqoobi! Tee dadenexxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">Isira'eel! Atee giisek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">«Atee wodeennaxxee sodaattoxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">Summi atikenni atee ye'ennen; ati anken.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Wodi'iinxe dhi'mo giddii'n saxxinaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">ani ha'nonni welti hedhannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">Galaani giddi'n me'itina wodda ha'no adhdhabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">giira giddii'n saxxinaa wodda ha'no gubbabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">bubenjikinna ha'noo midhabaan.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Ani ha'nook Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isira'eeliki woyyichchi Mageni ha'nooke anjirallon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">ha'noo wodonna'a Gibtsee Tophiyakanna Saaba ha'no'a uwwannon.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Ati ille anxee fiixakenna ulfo kaddettaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">aninna atee eeyyannaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">Manna atixxee tukkesse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">ardakanna eeyyennaxxee lubbo atixxee wodannon.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />Ani ha'noonni welti hedhennaxxee sodattinoqqe'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">oose atixxanna borotenaa'n iyyedagannon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">dhidhimii darrenaa'n bukki assannon.<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Ani atee middi darree'n hedheeka boga ‹iyyedagi›,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">bita'i darree'n hedheeka boguwwa ‹wocci assi› hiyyannon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">Labbaxxa anxa oose bayyii'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">meyyaxxa anxa oose bogiinxe gabalanaa'ni<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />Anke summinni ye'emeeka duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">ulfinna anke daxxeenneken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">anga anxinni loobennekennaa giisenneke arda.»<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eeli Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a Dhugaate Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Mageni hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:8">«Ille afeenni hedhe uudabaaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:8">Mansha afeenni hedhe laqabaaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:8">anka arda mitteba bukki asse!<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Gosa gosak ardi duuchchi mitteba bukki hiyyowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">insa'nee giddii'ni ta'axxanna edo kadde saxxeexxa yaanuwwa kaddebaa edi darre haaso'e leellisheek ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Insa'nenna lanqeexxi, ‹Tinni dhugaaten› hinaashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">dhugaalessumma insa'neexxi kokeesendaashsha dhugaa insa'neexxa shiqinshowwaal.<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />«Ane egendino'aannaa ane'n amandino'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">isi ante kadeennexxa wo'mitino'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Ha'no anxe dhugaa kula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">fi'lenneke anke erganjuwwan,» hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">«Ani edi darre mageni giissemebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">ani udumanna hedhabaan.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />Ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:11">ane malee weli ha'noo wodaaki hedhebaan.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />Ani edi'a kaddaaxxara ediseenni kuleennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">ha'noo wodenneki anten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">alagiink magenuwwanaa'n mittikinna midde iitta asseeki hedhebaan»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti, «Tenne duuchchiinxee ani Mageni dhugaaten.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />Ani edi'ninni hedhenneke Magenon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">anxe anganaa'n ayyinna ayye'e fulchabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">ani assennexxa dande'e jijjiiraaki hedhebaan.»<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baabilooninaa'n Baaje Fula</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />Isira'eeliki woyyichchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">ha'noo anjiraak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">«Ha'no'a hiyye Baabilooni lolaka loliinka manna ergannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">Baabiloonike qachchixxa huluwwa eenqe birannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">Baabiloonike mannixxi saadino oodhishshatiba'a jijjiirendaan.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootti ha'nooke Woyyichcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:15">Isira'eelii dadennek ani ha'nooke moyanjon.»<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />Abbaayya giddii'ni ora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">danbala'i giddonna xurre giisseek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici;<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />Langaxxa lanqabaashsha ookkone diinphaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">uffu hiyyemoole xo'ammake xassishsha ba'neen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">Fadhadiinxa gaaruwwanna fadhado</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">loliinki sannachchuwwinna jannuwwi mundaashsha bobbaasseek hiyya'nee qici:<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />«Qara hexxemmaxxa yaane kassi hitinoqqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:18">saxxeexxanna heddinoqqe.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Kunnise ani haarooxxa yaane assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">isenna ta'a lattaan; qalbeefatinabaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">qiilla gammoojje giddo ora qophpheessannon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">bago bogga'ninna muummuwwa burqitaashsha assannon.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Qiilla gammoojje giddo buttatik biniinchuwwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">jeedalikinnaa urungo anee ulfeessitaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">Gammoojje giddo wode'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">gongomi giddonna muumme uwwannon yaa'aashsha assanno wodda;<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />Ani insa'nee ifi'a daxxenneke arda kandemmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:21">anee galatefantaan.<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelixxa Cubbo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />«Koo Ya'iqoobi; ati kinni anee yexxeeboxxen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:22">koo Isira'eelike arda ha'no anka summa ye'edha goofineen,<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Ciincatike tolchi'a kadaaka gedhebo ani'a shiqisinebaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">tolchuwwi ha'nookinna anee ulfessitinebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">Ani'a tolche hiyye ha'no rakkissebo'noni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">hixxaana ani'a uwwe hiyye ha'noo ko'wisebe'non.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Maallaqik fishshaaka hixaana ani'a hirtebexxon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">yookaani ha'yi tolchinni anee goddissebexxon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">Yaane kinni cubboti anee rakkissetten.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">Balleessati anee ko'wiseen.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />«Tinni duuchchi kaddee'naan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:25">cubbo ha'nooxxa gattowwaali hiyyannoki Mageni anten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:25">tenneenna assanneki ha'nooxxete kadebaangi anumma anxeeten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:25">cubbo atixxa qaabbattabo'non.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />Ammee anee ku'le;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">yaada ha'nooka shiqilshitne seera adhdhitino'a dhugaa ha'nooxxi kuldowwaali.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />Edik annuwwi ha'nooki cubbo hujen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:27">ha'nook barachchisanjuwwinna balleessa huje anee yaadisseen.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Tennexxee galmiinka umo umo kadeeke manna salphisannon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Ya'iqoobi'i ba'netee'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Isira'eeli'i yowwiinke assannon.<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Calli Mageno kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />«Yaane kinni higgeen anke erganjo Ya'iqoobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:1">fi'lenneke koo Isira'eelike arda! Caqasi.<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />Amati gadaameessi giddo ha'no dadennekenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">ha'noo gargaarenneki ante Duuchchi Woddike Goottan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">anke erganjuwwa kaddinemmaxxeenna ha'no fi'leenneke koo, Yishuruun sodaatinoqqe.<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />Wode'e gopheeke bogi'a wode'e uwwannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">bagok buttinanaa'n muummuwwa yaataashsha assannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">Hafuura anka oose atixxe'n dunannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">eebba anxa oose atixixxe oosuwwa'a uwwannon.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />Insa'ne wode'e adda ha'winseexxe badda'ashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:4">lagin qarqara hedhemmake hokkokotike haqichchishsha lantaan.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Mitti, ‹Ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottiken› hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">weli Ya'iqoobike summinn ifi ye'naan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">Weli kinni, ‹Ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottike manjon› hiyyaaka beesisa angate'n naqqase borreesedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">Ifinna Isira'eeli hiyyemeeke summinni ye'emaan.»<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Magenoofachchotixxe Fakkeba'a</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />«Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Isira'eeliki moyanjinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">anjiral Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">Edikinna udumik anten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">ane malee weli Mageni hedhebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:12">Isa. 48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Wal. 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Anishsha hedheeki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">Hedheexxe kaddoole haaso'owwaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">arda anka olma dadenne wodda maachchi kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">Edi'a maachchi kadaaxxa haaso'owwaal; ani edo barrisowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">Edi'a kaddaaxxeenna ediseenn haaso'o'wwaal.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Ha'no sodaatine, alaaltinoqqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">ediseen edike baro'ni ha'no'n kuleennabaa? Yookaani farri asse ha'no'ni haaso'ebe'no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Tennexxeenna ha'no dhugaa anxen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">anee malee weli Mageni hedheessi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Ani gadhi darre wele jabaxxi rassa hexxebaan.»<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Magenoofataxxi Fakke La'o Affebaaxxa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Magenoofataxxa fakkuwwa giissaaki duuchchi woyi fulaakeerabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">giissinaaxxi yaanuwwa hira afebaachchon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:9">Insa'ne'a haaso'a'neek manninna balla'uwwaken</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">ege'na afeekeerabaan shoonkaan.<verse eid="ISA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Manji mitti mitte la'onna uutabaaxxa magenoofachchotixxa fakke yookaan misile hucca?<verse eid="ISA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Insa'ne magenoofataaki duuchchi salphataan; magenoofataxxa fakkuwwa giissaaki manjoke malee Magenokebaan; mee insa'ne duuchchiingi ani edo uurrinowwal; insa'ne duuchchiingi alaanne culphinsee salphantaan.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Sibilo tumammaki manji magenoofataaxxa fakkuwwa giisso'a sibilo giirate'n finiinsan. Sibilokanna afeexxe hunnanni burrisikinna tume bifa afaashsha assa; tennee iitta assa wodda solo'waan, dheebo'waan, gophaani.<verse eid="ISA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Haqqe bocatixxe ogeki manji haqichcho mikaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">itti hana xerri assa'n borreessaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:13">Bocammake miyinninna toora toora fulchaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">soofexxinna giissaan toora toora fulche seesaani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">Dedhi hedhebaaxxa kokeessaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:13">Dancha manjixxa fakke afaashsha asse giissaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">isoonna magenoofatammaxxe fakkuwwake mine'n uggaani.<verse eid="ISA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />Tennexxee assatte birbirsa, weddeessa yookaani qilxa gongomakenaa'ni fi'laan; iitta kada gophphoole haqqetixxe ogeka manjo hi'neessa kaasise xeenik nophphaa qico'ni heqqedhaan.<verse eid="ISA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Manji haqichcho gamisa giidhdhaan, gamisa magenoofachchotixxa fakkuwwa giissedhaan; gamisa giira giire ita ra'isedhaan; isoonni magenoofataaxxa fakke giissedheexxi magenoofataan.<verse eid="ISA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Gamisa giireexxi ita ra'issedhaani; maalakanna dudhdhiirshe goddaa qico'n itaan; guba'le eebbeechchi uduma, «Yo'oshsha mambe'iinxe giiran! Hittata eebita'ne!»<verse eid="ISA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Gatemmaka haqichcho magenoofataaxxe fakke assedhe giissedheexxi isi edo sagada'n magenoonfataan; «Ati anke magenon; anee anjir!» hiyya'n ise soodaataani.<verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Iitta hedheeki manni ille insa'neexxi abidedemmaxxee uuda dandeennabaan; woyi fuldabaaxxa fakkuwwa magenoofantaa woddanna qalbeenfantabaan;<verse eid="ISA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />«Konne haqichchika gamisa giireenneni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">isike kashilo'ninna ita ra'isedhenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">maalakanna ise'n dudhdhiirshe itennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">yoona ta'a gatemmaka itisanjo magenoofatammaxxe fakke assedhanno?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:19">Konne mitte itisanji haqichchi edo ibe magenoofatanno?»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">hiyye hedaaka beekkuma yookaan yaada afeeki mitti manji hedhebaan.<verse eid="ISA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Gubate bululoke kadaaka haqichcho magenoonfataa qico'n manji hitta gowwomma; gowwumamtiki yaadi isoo dedhiseen; dande'e ifi anjirabaan; yookaani «Kunni anxe middixxe anga'n hedhdhechchi magenoofataaxxe fakke malee magenokebaan» hiyya dande'abaan.<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Dadallokenna Anjiralloke Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />«Koo Isira'eeli! Ati anke erganjonn, koo Ya'iqoob tenne hiyyannexxa duuchcha qaabbat:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">ani atee dadenneki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">atinna anke erganjo kaddettexxa deetoxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">aninna atee dedhabe'non.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Balleessa atixxa dumanchiinsha cubbo atixxa gorisixxe hurreshsha atenaa'n fugusseennen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">atee wodeennakee anibaa higi.»<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />Iimuwwa! Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti arda ifika Isira'eeli anjire'naa ardikinna isoo ulfeessammaxxee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">gammadik faaro faarsi; buttatinna hundii'n ililisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">koobuwwa, gongomi giddo hexxineexxi haqquwwa duuchcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">gammadik burraaqqe.<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />«Atixxe amake gadaameessi giddo atee dadeek atenna wodeek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 44:24" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">«Ani Duuchchi Woddik Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">Ani duuchchiingechcho dadenneki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">ani calli iimuwwa dhiseenneki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">buttatanna ani calli diriirsenneki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">ani Magenoken.<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />«Dhariyye wabeekoka beesisuwwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">morammake mannixxa moro tola gatisannon.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">Beekkoletenaa'n ege'nanna hoyyaannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">ege'na insa'neexxanna gowwummate'n jijjiirannoni;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:20">1 Qor. 1:20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />Ergatoole anxika hiyyichcho duudhannon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">wabeeko anxiki wabeekummanni muuxendaashsha assannon.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 44:26" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">«Insa'neenna Iyyerusaalemii'i, ‹Ardi hedhaaba kaddattoni›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">Yihudiinka qachchuwwa, ‹haarooba ijaarraani›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">findigememmaka qachchuwanna, ‹qammalchemaan› hiyyannon.<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />Lumoxxa abbaayya, ‹atinna bagi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:27">ani abbaayyuwwatanna bassannon› hiyyannon.<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />Qiroosii, ‹Ati anke horike allalisanjoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">yaada anka duuchcha muuxxatton;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:28">Iyyerusaaleminna, «Ati haarooba ijaarendattoni.»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">Isi galmakanna, «Booso atixxi safenduun» hiyyaan› hiyyannon.<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Qiroosii Moyanjumammtee Fileexxa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />«Gosa gosak ardi isi hunda galaashsha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">Moyanjuwwa galchatenaa'n hoyyaashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">qachchuwwiinke dalla'ixxi huluwwa isi'a banedaashsha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">Middixxa isixxa anga abide hariire moyanjo asseka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">Qiroosi'i Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici,<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />Ani ati edo me'annon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">koobuwwatanna dirrete assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">sageettotike sibiljxxa huluwwanna sibiljiinka danqarsanjuwwa eenqannon.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />Dukkanate'ninna qoonnete'n tuulendeexxa karra ati'a uwwannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">ookkonechchi uduma atee summa atikenni ye'eneki Isira'eelike Duuchchi Woddike Gootta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">Mageni ante kadennexxa egendatton.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />Fi'leenneka anka Isira'eelika arda gargartattoshsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">ati anee ege'na gophphoottolenna midde summa atika gane atee ye'ennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">ulfinniinka summanna ati'a uwweennen.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />Ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottan, ani gadho weli ayyinna hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">anee malee weli Mageni hedhebaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:5">Ati anee'e ege'na gophphottolenna midde jabeenna ati'a uwwannon.<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />Tennenna assaaneki arishsho fuldaabaa'n arishsho aggaa qico'n hedheeki mitti mittingi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">Ani calli Duuchchi Woddike Gootta kaddeennexxanna anee malee weli Mageni hedhebaaxxa ege'naashshaten.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />Ani nage'akanna yaaddo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">eloxxanna elobaaxxa iyyedagannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">an Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti tenne duuchcha assannon.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />«Ha'no iimate'ni hexxineexxe iimuwwa! Qullumma xeenishsha iimii'n butti'a gansiise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">duumanchikinna butti'a coccobowwaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">buttinikinna haanni hiyyowwaal; anjiratinna lattowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">ani Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti dadeennake kadennaxxe'e qullummatinna anjira welti lattowwaal.<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Dadatikenna Jirtetike Anna Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />«Isoo giissemmake moromakee aanne'e!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">Isiqqa wele faariinke miyishshande;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Mitti faariinki miyi giissammaka manjo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">‹Maachcho assitatte?›</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">‹Anga affebexxoo?› hiyye dande'e qoraa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:20">Rom. 9:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Anna ifika belti, ‹mayee i'litette› hiyyaakee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">ama ifixxanna, ‹mayee ildette?› hiyyaakee isi'a aanee.<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />«Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Woyyichchi Isira'eeliki Magenina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">Dadekinna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">Anxe oosexxe ane qortino'aanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">yookini anga anxenni hujenedeexxa huje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">anee ajajjino'a seeri ha'noo uwwa?<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />Butta dadenekinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">manjokanna dade buttate'n hedhdhaashsha assenneki anten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:12">Anga ani iimuwwa diriirsite'en;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">iimate'n hedheechcho duuchcha ajajanneki anten.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna Qiroosii qullummatixxe huje'a ke'issennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">orakanna isi'a qajelchannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Qachcha anka Iyyerussaalemi haaroba ijaraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">booji'emeeka anka arda booji'otenaa'n fulchaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">tennenna assa'neexxe ayyinna maallaqa isi'a uwwo'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">yookaani eloxxa isi'a asso'atebaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />Duuchchi Wooddiki Gootti, hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">«Gibtsexxinna Tophiyiinxi karra ha'nooxxe kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Ejjuma qeqerarami Saabaki manninna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">insa'nenna atiba dangaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Atike kandaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">insa'nenna ate udumii'ni hordonfaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">haachchabik usuremme atiba dangee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">ati edo saganda'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">‹Dhugaandinni Mageni atinni welti hedheen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">isi gadho weli Mageni hedhebaan› hine atee kadhantaan.»<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Isira'eeli'i anjirtatoke Mageno!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:15">Dhugaandinni ati ifi shoxxatoke Magenon.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Magenoonfantaaxxa fakkuwwa giisaki duuchchi shookee salphataani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:16">duuchchingi mitteba salphataani.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Ha'no Isira'eelike arda ani Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti kinni hunna anxenni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">duuchchi wodda ha'noo anjirannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">duuchchi woddi'anna shookinna salphinni ha'no geyabaani.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Iimuwwa dadeeki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">isi Duuchchi Woddike Goottaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">buttatanna bifa affashsha giiseeki, dadeeki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">boosotanna giiseek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">manji ise giddo hedho'ate malee'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">Duwwike kaddo'atebaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">«hiyya'nen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">Ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">anee malee weli hedhebaani.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />Dukkana giddo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">sho'iki haaso'ebo'noni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Ya'iqoobixxe sanne'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">‹Tola bodichcha ane'e halse› hiyyebo'noni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Ani Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti dhugaate haaso'annoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">seerinxa yaane kulannon.<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />«Bogi bogii'n booji'otena'n gattine daggineeki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">mitteba bukki hitine amme!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Magenoonfantaxxa haqichchiinxa fakke abixxe mammaremma'nekanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">dandeette fayyissabaaxxa fakkuwwaba soodata'neek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">ardi ege'na anfeekebaani.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Yaada ha'noka farri assitine haa'so'we;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">mittebanna bukki hitine mar'atte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">bireke baro'n haaso'eki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Ante Duchchi Woddike Goottabaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">qullichchakenna anjiraake kadeek Mageni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">anee malee weli hedhebaani.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />«Anee malee weli Mageni hedha gopheemmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">ha'no buttatixxe gabala qico'n hexxineeki duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">aniba'a higgine fayye<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />Jijjiremabaaka hiyyichcho afo'o ankeni haaso'enaxxe'e ifi'n kakateeneni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">Tennexxee gulubi duuchchi ani'a gulufataani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">arabi duuchchi summa ankenni kakataani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:11">Rom. 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:10-11">Fil. 2:10-11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />Insa'ne anxe'e hina'ni haasonnaa qici, ‹Qullumatanna hunna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">uwwaaki lumok Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a callan› »</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Insa'ne'ni mufeti ke'aak duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">isiba dageexxi shookaani.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Yaane kinni Isira'eelixxi horte duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:25">anee Duuchchi Woddike Goottini qulloome ulfaantaan.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s1">Baabiloonixxa Magenoonfachchotixxa Fakkuwwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Beeli salphate Neebo yo'osha enqeme</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">magenoonfantammaxxi insa'neexxi fakkuwwa horeke'ni fe'ende'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">Insa'nee adhdhe mammarendaaxxi fakkuwwa heddoten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">gopheeke horuwwi'a ha'uraake fe'isan.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Tinni fakkuwwa salphatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">ifinaa'n dandeette hoyyedha gophpheemmaxxee'e booji'ende adhdhende.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />«Amatike godobi giddo, ilendineechchi udumi'aanna ha'noo heqqennexxe Ya'iqoobixxe horte gattineke Isira'eelike arda! Hiyyaannexxa laqqe.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />Cindine'e arree fulchitinaa qico'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">ha'noo heqqannoki anten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">ha'no dadennen; ha'noo ba'edhannon; gargaarannon anjirannon.<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />«Ayyinni anee qixxe assitinaa'ne? Ayyinnita herregina'ne?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:5">ayyinnita fakkeessitina?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Manni subba ifika tilqe worqe kii'lan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">birretika sibiljonna kiiloti minkaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">Magenoonfataaxxa fakkuwwa insa'ne'a tumme giissinaashsha tumaaka uunaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">giissemechchin uduma heeshshi qokki hina'n magenoonfantaan.<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />Aa'ne dugumote'n dulkinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">mitte bakka'n uurrinsoole ookkonni uurraan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">Fedhee boonchi'n le'ma dande'abaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">Manji isiba'a soodatoole soodachcho laqabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">yookaani ayyeenna ba'netenaa'n woda dande'abaan.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />«Ha'no cubbaalleeyye! Tennee qaabbatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:8">godobake'ninna galchedhdhe.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Ani calli Magenoke kadennexxanna anee malee weli Mageni hedhebaaxxa ege'ne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">edike baro'n kaddeexxa edixxa yaane kassi hiyye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">ani Magenoken; anee fakkataaki weli hedhebaan.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Uduma kaddaaxxa yaane ediseen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">Edi'a mayi kadaaxxa edonni haaso'eneenn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">aninna: yaadi anki mishikki hiyyakebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">anee gammachchiissaxxa duuchchanna assannon.<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />Borotenaa'ni joletishsha bute adhdhaaka manjichcho ye'annon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">isinna yaada anka muuxaake, bayyike boginaa'n dagaake manjon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">Ani haaso'ennexxa assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">hedennexxanna muuxannon.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />Ha'no dhugaatenaa'n bayyatine'eki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:12">godoba jabaatinaaki ardi hiyyaannexxa laqqe.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />Ani qullumma anxa ha'no'a shiqisheennen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">isenna bayya hexxebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">Anjira anxi xu'unna turtabaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">Iyyerussaalemi anjrannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">Isira'eelinna ulfaataashsha assannon.<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s1">Baabiloonixxa Iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />«Tee Baabiloonnixxe duuddo dubarichcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">dirri bukote'ni hana ofo'li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Koo Baabiloonike manna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">mootumma atixxenaa'ni dirri butta ofo'li</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">ta'inni elqi'a dancha yookaan lollobbe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">hiyyende ye'endaboxxon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:1</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:1-14:23">Isa. 13:1—14:23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:1-51:64">Erm. 50:1—51:64</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Yooni daama adhdhite bulle dayi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">hagooqiteettexxa seemma fulchite butta uggi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">ka'liteettaxxa seemma iimi'a enqeexxe gudeedi leela'naa wode'e foof.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />Ardi duuchchi duwwitti hexxee'naa uudaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">saali belo gattaatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">ani ayyi'aanna mararebo'noni halo fulannon.»<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Anjiraaki Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddiki Goottan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:4">summi isikinna Isira'eelike Woyyichchan.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">«Tee Baabiloonii! Dukkana giddo ofo'li cuqqi hitoxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">konnechchinni edi'a buttatixxe mootitte hiyyedaboxxon.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />Ani anke arda'n mufatennaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">insa'ne batto'eechchishsha uudennexxi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">Anga atixxe'ninna sa'isse uwwennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">ati kinni insa'nee mararteboxxon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">gedhuwwate'ninna ha'ureeka qanbara geessisseten.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Isinna, ‹Ani duuchchi woddixxe mootitte kadannon!› hitette;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">kaddo malee assitettexxe yaane'ninna mittetanna heddeeboxxon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">tinni uduma maa kaddaaxxanna qaabbateboxxon.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />«Ati godobi giddo anishsha hedheeki ayyinna hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">aro'o shi'witeexxe manjichcho kade hedhabo'non;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">‹yookaan ane'ni oose miidhendabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">ifi addatte ofoldettexxe tee qananitte!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">Tennee laqi› hitetten.<verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Tinni lame yaane dedhange'n mitte barra ate'n geltaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">fedhee qico quba saxxeettexxe gojaameettetenna mortaattexxe kaddottolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">aro'o atikanna oose atixxa reretee'naa gophphatton.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:7-8">Wal. 18:7-8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />Fuggoxxe atixxe huje'n ifi addatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">‹Ayyinna anee afaak hedhebaani› hita'ne</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">Ifi saaddetten atixxi ege'nanna beekkumi atiki atee dedhiseen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">‹Godob giddonna anishsha hedheeki ayyinna hedhebaan› hitetten.<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Gojoti ifi iimii'n hoyyexxaboxxoxxi fuggoxxi yaane ate'n geltaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">ifinaa'n hoyyedha dandeettaboxxoxxe rakkonna ate'n futti hitaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">hara heddeboxxoxxi ba'nenna ate'n dedhange'n geltaan.<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />«Amo mee oosummatenaa'n duuchchi wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">la'onfata'n hexxettaxxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">hawwi assite doochchisatixxa hujenna gojo hucci;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">Aki magaada tinni yaanuwwa gargaartaaxxe hexxeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">yookaani naapha atika konneechchuwwinni sodaachchissatton.<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />Adhdhitetteki gorsi duuchchi eleessaake malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">mitte la'o ati'a uwwaakebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">agenjo agenjoge'n urje uudda'ni edi'a kaddaaxxa moraaki manni dagabaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">daggaaxxa rakko atenaa'n gatisaqqata.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />«Insa'nee huuriinsha giira ittaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">giiratike bubenonaa'n ifi gatisa dandeennabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">huurikinna gubadhdhatee kashilo afebaan.<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Baro atike duuchcha'n ati'a gorsa uwwammakir;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">duuchchiingi ora ora'nininni xeeremaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">mittikinna atee anjiraaki hedhabaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Dadeekenna Anjreeke Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />«Isira'eelike arda Yihudaxxe sanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">ha'no Ya'iqoobixxi oose! Laqqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">ha'no dhugaatite kadebaaki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">Duuchchi Woddika Isira'eelika Gootta magenoonfantannen hitinaa'n;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">Magenike summinninna kakattina'neen.<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />Ha'no ifi Woyyichchi qachchi giddo he'naanneken hitina'neeki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">Dada Duuchcha Ajajaaki Duuchchi Woddike Isira'eelike Gootta'n addantannen hitina'n hollitine'e.<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isira'eelii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">edi'a kadda'neexxa yaane qeerraaxxe yanna edigama haaso'ennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">iseenna hirbange'n muuxendaashsha assenen.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Mirqemabaake jabake sibiljishsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">godoba jajjabatinaake manna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">kaddineexxa ege'nennen.<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />Tenne yaanuwwaxxa duuchcha ediseen ha'no'a haaso'eennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">kaddebaa edi gama ha'no'a ege'nisheennen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">Tenne assenechchinna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">‹Anxi magenoonfatannaxxi fakkuwwa tenne assiteen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">haqqetixxinna sibiliinxi misiluwwa tennee assiteen hitaboxxoshshaten.›<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />Ani haaso'ennexxa laqqine'en; tinninna muuxendee'naa uuddine'en;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">heddine dhugaate kaddeexxa kuldaboxxoo?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">«Ta'a edi wodda sho'onde hexxemmaxxa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">ha'no egendinebaaxxa haarooxxa yaane, ha'no'n leelishannon.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Kunnichchuwwi bire hedhemmachchuwwa kadebaaki ta'a dademeechchuwwan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">‹ha'nonna edi woddanni egeneennachchuwwa› hitinabaashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">edigama konneechchuwwixxa haranga laqqine egendinebaan.<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Ani haaso'annexxa laqqinabaan; egendino'anna hassinebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">hundii'ninni ha'nooxxi mansha duudde'exxen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">Tinninna kaddeechchi ha'no xaqartiyyete kaddinexxanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">ilendineexxenninni jalliyyete hiyyendinaaxxa ege'neennen.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />«Anike summike ulfinni'a hiyye muddame mufatabo'non;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">manni anee galateefato'a aare ha'no birabo'noshsha enqedhannon.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Birretike sibiljishshate kadebaaki rakkotixxe giiranni ha'noo ca'a assennen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:10">abaratinna ha'noo hega uudeennen.<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Ani umo ankee hiyye tennee assanon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">mayee summi anki tuffatema?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">Ani gatee'naa weli ulfeesemo'a waalabo'non» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qiroosii Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Fi'leeke Erganjo Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />«Koo Ya'iqoobi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">ye'ennek Isira'eelike arda! Hiyyaaanexxa laqi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:12">Ani aneden;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">Ani calli Magenoken edikenna udumiken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa. 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Wal. 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />Anxe anganni buttatixxa booso dadennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">iimatanna diriirissennen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">Ye'ano wodda iimatinna butta ani'a ajajendaan.<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />«Duuchchiingi bukki hitine amme laqqe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">Konneechchuwixxe edise haaso'eki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">Magenoonfachchotixxe fakkuwwa giddii'n hoonte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">Ani Duuchchi Woddik gootti filenneki manji Baabiloonii yaada anka muuxaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">Baabiloonike arda'ninna lolaan.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />Ani umo anigenninni iso'ni haaso'eennen; isoonna ye'ennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:15">ani isoo iyyedagannon; isi assaaxxanna qajeldaashsha assannon.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />«Ani bira shiqqine hiyyaannexxa laqqe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">«Edinaa'ninni ani haaso'enneki sho'ikitebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">hiyyennexxi muuxendaa woddanna ani ookkonni hedhennan.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Ta'anna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni hafuuri isiki anee erge'en.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Ha'no anjiraaki Isira'eeliki Woyyichchi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Magen, hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">«Ati'a la'ote kaddaaxxa duuchcha barachchiisannekinna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">me'iyyo hasisaaka ora'n me'itotta'a akeekaanneki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni anten.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Ajaja anka laqqineele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">nage'i ha'no'a xo'abaake galaani wodi'ishsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">qullumma ha'no'a abbaayyatike danbala'ishsha bira saxxe daggamman!<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Horte atixxa buttatike maanchishsha laakkonne dhaqqambamabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">ardi ha'nook mudee'naa summi insa'neekinna dedhemamabaan!»<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Yooni Baabilooni'n fulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">Baabiloonike mannanaa'ninna baaje!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">Tennenna ililitiki ege'nishshe, lallabbe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">tennenne bogiinxe gabala qico'ni haaso'we;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">«Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti erganjo ifika Isira'eeli anjire'en.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:4">Wal. 18:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti gammoojje qiilla boga'n insa'nee akeekamma wodda wode'e dheebonitemabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">wodi'i insa'ne'a rassa shate fulaashsha asse.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">Rassa shate wodi'i insa'ne'a phu'isiise.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />«Fuggaalleeyetee nage'i hedhabaan» hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:21">Isa. 57:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddike Goottike Erganjixxa Huje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />Giddichchote'n hexxina'neeke gosa gosake arda hiyyaaneexxa laqqe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">Bayyike boga'n hexxina'neeke arda qalbeefatte;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">Ilemebo'noning Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee ye'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">anxe amake gadaamessi giddonni hedhe'naa summa anka fulcheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:5">Erm. 1:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />Arrabo anka qareeke wolaantichcho asseen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">ifixxe angake gaaddis giddo anee sho'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">Qarsemeeke mogido anee gonofi giddo sho'edheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:12">Ibr. 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:16">Wal. 1:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />Isinna anee «Isira'eeli! Ati anke erganjo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:3">atixxe hiyye arduwwi anee ulfeessaan» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Ani kinni «Tolanga elo'ennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">la'o belo hunna anxa birennen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">Kaddoolenna anki hiri Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n hedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">elo anxiki hirinna iso'inni hedheen» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />Ama anxike gadaameessi giddo hedhee'naa Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee fileen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">Xexxeeremeeka Isira'eelika arda bukki assonnaa anee erganjo ifike assedheen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">Ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ulfaateenneken.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">Isinna anxe hunnan.<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna anee hiyyee qici, «Ya'iqoobixxe gosaka arda haaroba ulfaatashsha assitottaanna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">Isira'eelike ardinaa'n gateeka hiissitotta'a erganjo anke kadde huja calli geltabaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">Kinni tennenaa'n saxxaaxxa anjrumma anxa buttatixxe gabala qico'n geessissattoshsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">gosa gosake ardi duuchchi'a ati ifake kaddattoshsha assennen» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa. 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:32">Luq. 2:32</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:47">Erga. Huj. 13:47</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:23">26:23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Gosa gosake arda'n lumoshsha tuffatende jibbendetteka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">Arda galchammakiiri'anna erganjoke kaddeetteka atee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Anjiralli Isira'eeliki Woyyichchi Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">«Moyanjuwwi atee uudaa wodda iimi'a ke'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">Mooyanjuwwi atee'e uuda wodda ati'a qophphi hitaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">moottoleeyye atee uude sagadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">tinni kaddeechchi atee fi'leeke xuurameesi Isira'eeliki woyyichchi Magenixxeeten» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyerussaalemixxa Qammachchema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyyanee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">«Eeyennexxe yanna'n soodachcho atixxee hiissichcho uwwannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">anjirannoxxe barra'ninna atee gargaarannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">Ati gosa gosake ardi'a kakotike kaddattoshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">boga haaroba ijaartattoshsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">hujemebaak turemmaka boga annannake'n hiissitattoshsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">atee heqqannon giissannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:2">2 Qor. 6:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />Atinna usurrii mine hedhemmakara, ‹Tikemme!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">dukkana giddo he'dheeka, ‹ifake'n fulle!› hitattoshsha assennen.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 49:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">«Insa'nenna ora ora'ninni indaachcho alfinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">bagoxxe kooba'n hana re'etishsha bobbaanaan.<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />Insa'nenna solo'winabaan dheebontabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">arishsho yookaani qiilla gammoojjexxi diidallo insa'nee miitabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">tinninna kaddeechchi insa'ne'a marareeki isi wodi'inxi muumme hexxemmaxxe bakkaba'a insa'nee akeekemmaxxeeten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:16-17">Wal. 7:16-17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Koobuwwa anxa diriirse'e dirre ora assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:11">ba'laki anki oruwwinna lummedhaan.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Ardi anki bayyike boganaa'n dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">middi'ninna dhidhimii'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">ittanni Sinimi'ni dangaan.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sinimi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta'ixxe yanna'n Asiwaami hiyyemaake Gibtseke qachchaani.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti arda jajjabeessammaxxenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">rakkatemmakee mararammaxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">tee iima! Faaro faarsi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">Tee butta! Gammadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">koobuwwaa! Ilillisse.<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Iyyeruussaalemiki ardi kinni, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anee waale'en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:14">Goottikinna anee dedheen» hiyyeen.<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />«Ama ununstaaka ifika finna deetaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">Yookaani ildeexxe anno'aa marartabaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">Ise deetolenna midde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">Ani kinn atee dedhabo'non! Hiyya'nee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Iyyerussaalem ani kinni anxe angake baatani hana borreessedheennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:16">dalla'a atikanna duuchchi wodda qaabbatannon.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />Atika qachcha qammachchaakiir rakee dagaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:17">findigeeki kinni atenaa'n bayyatee me'aan.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Ille atixxenni toggi hite qarqara atika uudi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">oose atixxi duuchchi bukki hite atiba'a daggaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">Ani hedhannek kada anxenni kakataanen»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">tenne duuchcha ati seesiinsha oddo'witattoni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">«Waajubiinshanni fugattatton hiyya'nen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />«Ati diigende olete kaddottole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">bogi atiki kutti hiyye ba'eele</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">Telcho arda atike cu'matte kaddotolenna midde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">atika qachcha findigeekiiriki atebaa'n bayyate me'aan.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />Booji'ote'n ilendemmaxxi atixxi oose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">‹kunni boonchi no'o'a cu'matemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">he'nannoka baa'laka boga no'o'a uwwi› hitaan.<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Ookkonneechchi uduma atinna godobi giddo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">‹Tennee oose ayyete ani'a ile?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Heddo anxa oose gophphe ildebaaxxe masento kadeennan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">shorreme, jibbeme hedhennan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">tenne ooseta ayyete nosse?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Ani calli qofinni gateennan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">tinni ooseta habaa'n dagge?› »<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">«Atixxa labbaxxa oose angate'n luu'me'ne, dubarra atikanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">gurumote'n dulkine iyyedangaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">gosa gosake moyanjuwwake arduwwa'n beesisa leellishannon.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Moyanjuwwi ha'no'a annake kandaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">moyanjuwwiinxi arenna ha'no'a amate kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Albi buttina tuqaa qico'n heeshshi hinaa'ni ha'noo ulfeessinaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">Lekka ha'nooxxixxa bukonna arraaphphinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">tennenaa'n kexxeexxe'n ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootta kadennexxa egendatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">gargaronna'a anee heqqedhaaki shookabaan.»<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Janniinxe anganaa'n boji'o dandeenne adhdhinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:24">Yookaan hunnaameesiinxe anganaa'n boji'emeeka manjo dandeenne fulchinaa?<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti kinni hiisse hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">«Atinni lolemammakenni ani lolemannaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">janni booji'eexxi boji'o midde adhendaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">Hunnaameessi manjixxe anganaa'ninna boji'o hiissendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">aninna oose atixxa anjirannon.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Atee micaammaki weli'aanni weli shiyaashsha assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">woyinetixxa booka ha'wine machchoonnammashsha ifinxa munde ha'wine machchoonnaashsha assannon.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootti atike anjirallonna gargaarsanjo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">Isira'eelike hunnaameessa Mageno kadennexxa buttatiki ardi duuchchi ege'naan.»<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">«Labbaki are ifixxa waale shorrammashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">ani arda anka ha'noo shoreennechcho fakkatte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">Iittate kaddoole waalennexxa ege'nishshaaxxi borro habata hexxe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">Manji oose ifinxa garbumate gurgurammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">ani ha'no booji'endino'a gurgurennechcho fakkate?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">Iitta kaddooleta hoone liqeesanji'a ha'noo gurgudhdhenne?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">Ha'noo booji'ootee gurgurendineechchi cubbo ha'nooxxixxe buuto'aaten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">shorrendinechchinna hujinemmaxxe balleessa'aten.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Ani dagenne wodda mitti manjinna ookko hedha gopheechchi maye'aate?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Ye'enne woddanna mitti manjinna hiissichcho uwwa gopheechchi mayete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Ani anjira dande'abo'noo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Dande'e wodannoxxa hunna afebo'noo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Ajaja callinni abbaayya bassannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">wodu'uwwa qiilla gammoojjumma'ni jijjiirannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">qulxu'muwwatinna wode'e gophatenaa'n kexxeexxa rerte aloottaan.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />Iimuwwate'ni dukkana oddeessannon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:3">iimuwwatiki golinna yaaddotixxe seemma fakkaataashsha assannon» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />Gophaaleeyye jajjabeessa ege'nannoshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni haaso'iki anee cabbeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">gorsa gorsa diphokenaa'n ane dammassaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">Baratichchiinshanna caqasonna'a mansha anxa banaan. <verse eid="ISA 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ille mansha anee baneen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:5">ani xaqaritichchake kade isonaa'n bayyatebo'non.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />Anee jadhafaake dudduro anka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">areeda coraakenna boqo anxa uwwennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">yowwaakenna anee'n cirqataake alba buqedhebo'non.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:67">Mat. 26:67</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mar. 14:65</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni anee gargarammaxxee salphatebo'non;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">tennexxee ani jabaake kinjishsha ifi jabeesseennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">shookabo'noxxanna ege'neenen. <verse eid="ISA 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />Balleessa afebo'noxxa muraaki Mageni shiqa hedheeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">ayyeteta ane ku'laaki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Ane ku'laaki hedhexxe kaddoole murtetixxe songo edo afeeme'naa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">dhugaa adhdhowwaali.<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee gargaaraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">ayyeteta balleessanjoke asse ane'ni muraaki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">Dhariki ane ku'laakiiri seemmatishsha mudaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">biletinna insa'nee ittaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:33-34">Rom. 8:33-34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Ha'no giddii'ni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta sodaataakinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">isike erganjike hiyyichchi'aa ajajemaaki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">Ifa waalini dukkana giddonna me'oole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'ni addatowwaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">Mageno ifike'ninna irkatowwaali.<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Ha'no duuchchiingi manjoke'n yaane giiratishsha ha'yishina'neekinna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">bubbi assitineken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">ha'yishinemmaxxe giira'ninna bubbi assitinemmake bubeninninni baxxinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">aninni tinni ha'no'n geltaashsha assannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">ha'nonna lumo qico rakkatinaan.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddi'a Tsiyooninxa Anjirensha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">«Anenna qullumma harsitinaa'neeki caqqasse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">Isonaa'ni afendinemmaka kinjonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">fuldinemmaxxa bale uudde.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Abirihaami ha'nooka annanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">ha'no ildemmaxxa Saara uudde;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">Abraami ye'enne wodda ila afemabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">yaane kinni ani isoo eebbisennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">horte isixxanna bira sa'issennen.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />Ani Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Tsiyooninna diigendemmake iseke boonchuwwaa'ni hedheeka duuchcha jajjabessannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">uruma isekanna Edeenike eloke hiddichchiinke fichchishsha assannoon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">ookko gammashshotinna ilileette hexxaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">iittanni galatiinxi faaronna laqendaan.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />«Anke arda! Laqqe! Ha'no'a hiyyaannexxanna caqase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">seera ante fulchannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">qullumma anxinna gosa gosake ardi duuchchi'a ifake kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />Rake dageneexxi ha'noo anjirannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">qullumma anxi hirbange'n daggaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">Hunna anxenni gosa gosaka arda duuchcha galichchannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">giddichchuwwate'n hedhammak gosa gosak ardi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">Daga anxe heqqedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">hunna anxanna addataan.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Toggi hitine iimuwwa, buttatanna uudde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">iimuwwa wilileetishsha higgeeba gonphaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">buttatinna seemmatishsha muddaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">ise'n hedhaaki duuchchi iittichchiinsha kutti hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">anjira anxi kinni duuchchi woddi'a hexxaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">qullumma anxinna baro baro'ninni hexxaaxxeni.<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />«Ha'no qullumma egendineekinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">seera anka qalbete'n abixxitineeke manna ani hiyyaannexxa caqase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">manniinka miidhdhaama sodaatinoqqe; yookaani yowwichcho insa'neeke riffi hitinoqqe.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Insa'ne bile itteexxe seemmashshanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">corroqa ittemmake gedhebiinxe ordan giissemeeke mi'yishsha kandaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">injifaachcho anxi kinni duuchchi woddixxen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">anjirumma anxiinna ila ila'ni hexxaaxxen» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Ke'i kexxettexxi hunna atixxa leellishi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">Edike baro'n hexxemmaxxe ila'ni assiteteeshshaani ke'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">Re'aabi hinammaxxa abbaayyatixxa jawwe kukkutte bulleessitetteki ateteni.<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />Ati woddetteki ardi foofaashsha abbaayyatanna dhi'mootika wode'e bassite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">insa'ne'a ora fulchitetteki atetebaa?<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />Tennexxee ati Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anjirtetteki ardi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">faarsaa'n Tsiyooni'a higaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">Duuchchi woddi'anna gammadaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">Duuchchi woddi'a gammada'ninnaa ililinsa'ni hedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">yaaddonna rakko kinni insa'nenaa'n baxxaan.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />«Ha'no dayyeessaanneki anten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">yoona badda'atishsha qoorakanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">reyaaka manjota mayee sodaatina?<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Buttatixxa booso dadekanna iimuwwa dhiseeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">ha'no dadeeka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta deetineen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">Ha'noo balleeso'a qophphefateeke ha'no miicammake mannixxe mufenaa'n kexxeexxa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Duuchchi wodda soda'ati hexxinaa'neen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">Insa'neexxi mufe ta'a haba hexxe?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Usuriinke minki manni usurrakenaa'ni rake tikeeman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:14">usurememmaxxe balee giddonna reyaabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:14">itaachchonna gonphabaan.<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />«Abbaayya le'mise danbala'i ganemaashsha assaanneki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">ani Dada Duuchcha Ajajak Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Magenon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">summi ankinna dada duuchcha ajajannoke Duuchchi Woddike Goottan.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Hiyyichcho anka afo'o atike'n uggannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">Iyyerussaam atenna anga anxike gaaddisinni golannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">Iimuwwa dhisenneki, buttatixxa boosonna dadeenneki anten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">Tsiyooninna, ‹ati anke ardani hiyyannoni.› »<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageniinxe Mufexxa Buuda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />Ati Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe angaxxe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">machchessite gatantarsitaaxxe mufe tixxe buudanaa'n,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">Lummoke qasha'n cingise ha'witettexxe Iyyerusaalemi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">Dammaqi; kexxetexxi uurri!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:10">Wal. 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:19">16:19</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />Ate akeekaaki haranga hedhebaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">ilde nossitettexxe oose duuchchanaa'n;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">anga atixxa abide atee akeekaaxxi afemebaan.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Rakkotinna ba'ne, solo'ikinna bagedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">tinni lame yaane ate'n gelteen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">yaaddato wodda atinni yaadaak ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">Ayyete atee jajjabeessa?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />Oose atixxi fonxoro abiddeexxe geedummashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">ora ora'in gophphe ibbe'en;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">Duuchchi Woddike Gootti Mageninna insa'nee mufate xixeen.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Tennexxee woyinetika bulbulonni ha'witinebaangi rakkoti machchootineeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:21">ha'no hiyyaanexxa laqqe.<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />Ardiinxe ku'la'a baassaaki ha'nooki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">ha'nooki Mageni, hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">«Machcho'eke manjishsha gatantaarsitaaxxa uwwennexxa rakkotixxa buuda ha'nonaa'ni adhdhenneni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">konnechchinni edi'a lumoxxe anxe mufeke lummoke qashanaa'ni ha'witinabaan.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />Rakkotixxi buudanna ati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">‹Heeshshi hitee'naa ha'nee dudduro atiki hana me'ino›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">hiyya'n atee rakkisammake mannixxe anga'n uwwaannen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">Atinna ati hana ha'na'n me'ino'a dudduuro atika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">insa'ne'a buttiniinshanna oriinsha assitetten.»<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Iyyerussaalemii Gatilsaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Tee Tsiyooni! Ke'i; dammaqi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">Hunnatanna oddo'wi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Woyyichcha Iyyerusaalemike qachcha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">Atixxa danchitte seemma oddo'wi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Jila ofo'lebaakinna batto'eki manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">konneechchi edi'a atike dalla'i giddi'a e'yabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Wal. 21:2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:27">27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Tee booji'endeettexxe Iyyerusaalemi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">Kexxetexxi buko atixxa hargulfi mootete'ninna ofo'li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">Ha'no booji'endineeke Tsiyoonike manna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">goobake'ni usudhdhitinemmaka haachchaba fulchite huni.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti arda ifika hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:3">«Hiri belo gurgurendeemman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:3">Maallaqi belo wodendinaan.»<verse eid="ISA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Dada duuchchik duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:4">«Sirnde'ni anki ardi hedho'a aade Gibtsee me'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:4">udumii'n Asoori mitte buutobelo arda anka wixxixxi asse galche.<verse eid="ISA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />«Ani ta'a kabaa maa afeene?» hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:5">«Ardi ank mitte buuto belo adhdheme'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">isoo galcheekiir insa'ne'n gacifate'een»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:5">«Barra duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">summi ank cita belo yowema'neen. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:24">Rom. 2:24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Tennexxee ardi anki summa anka ege'naan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">eettene barranna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:6">Edisennexxi haaso'ennek ante kadennexxa qalbeefanta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">kunse anende» hiyyye.<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Koobuwwate'n uurteexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">eloxxa odo aaxxe daggaaxxe lekkaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">Nage'a haasotaaxxiir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">eloxxa odo lallabbaaxxiir</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">Anjire lassitaaxxiir</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">Tsiyooni'ninna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">«Atiki Magen moyedheen» hiyyaakiir hittata biifomeekera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:15">Nah. 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:15">Rom. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:15">Efe. 6:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Laqi, atik heqqanjuwwi hafuura gikki asseexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">mitteba ilillisat faarsaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Tsiyooni'a illee iima higaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">ille ifixxeninna uundaan.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Ha'no tee Iyyerusaalemixxe ole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">mittebanna ililisati faarse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti arda ifika dayyeese'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">Iyyerusaaleminna wode'een.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti mootummuwwa duuchchi edo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">woyyitte ifixxa hirre leelisha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:10">Buttatixxe gabala qico'n hedheekiir duuchchi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">Mageno no'okixxa anjira uundaan.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Ha'no Duuchchi Woddike Gootitka miya ba'exxinaakiir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">foyemme, foyyemme; ookkoo'n fulle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">battitte yaane tuqqi hiyyee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">ookko'n fulle luqqinnayye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:17">2 Qor. 6:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Kaddo malee wiinamik fuldinabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">baajinenna me'itinabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'noo edii'n me'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">Isira'eelik Mageni ha'no'aa kiphaake kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rakko Iso'ni Geltaaka Erganjo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />Uudde, garbichchi ank hujaak qalbeefachchotiten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:13">isi gurra fuleeke kadaan; kubbisemaan; lumoshsha ulfeesemaan.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Heddi manni iso'n henkekki hiyyaa qico'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">dhagga isixxi ayyee'ninna manjokenaa'n gargar higgeexxe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">manjiinke belto duuchchanaa'n cuqurto'een.<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />Tennexxe heddo gosa gosaxxi mootummuwwa saadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">isixxe buuto'a mootummuwwa afo'o abixxitaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">Insa'ne'n kulendebaaxxe anfaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">lanqebaaxxanna qalbeefantaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:21">Rom. 15:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="s1">Mageniinki Erganji Manjokee Asseexxa Eloxxa Yaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />No'o lanqennexxa yaane aate amane?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:1">Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe hirre ayyaa iffe?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:38">Yoh. 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:16">Rom. 10:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />Isi edo isi mudhiinsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">bagoke buttinanaa'n fuleeke hiddishsha nophpheen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">Ille aaxxaaxxa danchumma yookaan gaachchanna afeemmabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">isoo eenannoshsha assitaaxxa dhagganna afe'emmabaan.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Isi mannake'n tuffatemeekennaa gibemeeke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">yaaddotike manjonnaa abari isonaa'n gatebaakemman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">Manni alba isonaa'ni sho'edhaa qico'ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">Tuffatemeemmakeman; no'onnaa isoo ulfeessinebo'no.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />Dhugaandinn isi dhibo no'oxxa adhdhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">elagonphe no'oxxanna ba'edhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">no'o kinni Mageni isoo ga'neeshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">isoo ote'eshsha, madeesseeshsha assinenne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:17">Mat. 8:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Yaane kinni isi no'oxxee sa'eexxi oteme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">no'oxxe balleessaxxe bullo'e;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">Iso'n ibbeexxi mura woxxa no'o'a nage'a iyyedagge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">mada isixxenninna fayyinenne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Phex. 2:24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />No'o duuchchiingi gedhebiinsha orakenaa'n gorre ba'nenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">mitti mittingi no'onna ifi fike oriba'a me'inennen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:6">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'oo duuchchingixxa balleessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">isi hana fe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:25">1 Phex. 2:25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />Isi abara uude; wixxixxi hiyye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">yaane kinni bucuqqi hiyyebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">Buruusinshanna dulenshatee oofeme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">isinaa'n orda cirammaki edo sammi hiyyammake gedhechchiinsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">bucuqqi hiyyebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:6">Wal. 5:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Abaratinna murtet adhdheme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">anke ardixxe sannexxee ganeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">Hedhotik mannixxe buttanaa'n fuggussemeexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">isixxe hortenaa'n aate qalbeefate?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:32-33">Erga. Huj. 8:32-33</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />Afo'o isike'n shokko afendeba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">seeribeloxxa yaane assebaangi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:9">Reya isixxi fuggaalleeyyet,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">mooggi isikinna dureeyyetikenni welt kade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:22">1 Phex. 2:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Isixxe bullo'anna isixxi abara uuda kinni Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe fedhiiman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti lubbo isixxa cubbotike tolcha assexxe kadoolenna midde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">Isi horte isixxa uuda; wogga isixxanna qeerrisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe fedhinna anga isixxe'n muuxema.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Isixxe lubboke abari uduma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">hedhotika ifa uuda; gammashshotanna gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">qullichchi ank garbichchi ifixxe ege'nanni heddo manna qulloonsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">sanne insa'nexxanna ba'edha.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />Tennexxee ani qoobbo isika jajjabuwwiinxe oddo'n isi'a uwwanno;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">isinna eettene booji'o jajjabuwwik welti qoodema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Reyoti qico'n lubbo ifixxa sa'isse uwwemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">fuggoxxa asseek mannirinna laakko'ememmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Heddi mannixxa cubbo ba'edhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">sanne mannixxeenna kadhate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:28">Mar. 15:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:37">Luq. 22:37</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />«Tee ati maseento manjichcho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">ati tee ilde egendebexxoxxi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Faaro faars; ilillis, gammashshotinna hanga'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">tee ati ciniifatte egendebexxoxxi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Aro'o affeexxe manjichcho erra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">qofi hexxeexxe manjichchoxxe oose birsaxxaa'n»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:27">Gel. 4:27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />Atike duunkaanixxa bakka ba'lis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">atike duunkanika golowwanna lumo qico qeerris;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">heeno'maashsha haranga assitoxxe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">Wodaruwwa atixxara qeerris;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">chikaala atikaranna jabeessi.<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />Middi bita'aanna ba'lattatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">horte atixxiir gosa gosaka arduwwa daldee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:3">Insa'neeke duwwike qachchuwwa'ninna hexxaan.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />«Mee co'o, sodaattoxxe; shooki ate'n geyabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">salphinni ate'n geya gophammxxee mee cuqurto'i;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">Dargaggeessumma atixxika shooko deetatto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">aro'o shi'witette woddixxa atixxa yowwema ta'anni edi'a qaabbattabexxo.<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Ate dadeek atike aro'o kadeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">summi isikinna Dada Duuchhca Ajajaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">Atee wodaakinna ookkone Isira'eelike Woyyichchan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">isinna butta duuchchike Mageno hiyyema.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Eettene diqatendeexxe muttaara areshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">irrik cuqurtottexxenna jibbendeexxe areshsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee higgeen ye'a»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">hiyya'neen atik Magen.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />«Heenooxxe yanna'a atee waaleennan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:7">yaane kinni lumoxxe mararittenni atee ille iima hiissedhanno.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Heenooxxe yanna'a lummoshsha aarennaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">alba atenaa'n sho'edheenne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">Yaane kinni duuchchi woddixxe anxe ba'lummanni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">ati'a o'wanno»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">hiyya'neen atee wodaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />«Tinni ani'a Nohike wodi'i butta langaxxa danbala'abaashsha kakatennake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">Nohike barishshaten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">Tennexxe ate'n langaxxa mufatabe'noshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">atee xixabe'noshshanna kakateenne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:8-17">Dada. 9:8-17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Koobuwwa sheke sheke hitoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">tulluchchuwwi ifi fixxe bakkanaa'n midde fuggusemoole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">Hojjoggi hitabaaxxi ani ati'a afennexxi jaalala sheke sheke hitabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">ati'a aagenexxi nage'iinxi kakonna diigendabaan»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">hiyya'neen ati'a o'waak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haarooxxa Iyyerusaalem</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />«Koo ati wixixxi hiteetteke qachchaa, jabaxxe diidallonni rassa'naa'a dayyate'ebexxokee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">kunnise eettene fiixa konnenni atee danchoose ijaarannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">Senper hiyyemaake fiixa kinjinninna booso atixxa giissanno.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54:11</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:18-21">Wal. 21:18-21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />Anixxe fooqexxe guutoxxa bokko diimooke kinjinni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">atike dalla'ixxa huluwwa cala cala hiyyaake fiixxa seesuwwinni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">dalla'uwwa atikanna fiixa kinonni ijarannon.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />«Atixxi labbaxxi oose duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Goottinaa'n baratteexxe kadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:13">atixxe oosek nage'inna birasa'eeke kada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:45">Yoh. 6:45</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />Ati qullummati ijaarendatto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">seeribeloxxi galcha atenaa'n fuggussenda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">atee sodaachchisaachchi hedhabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">Weekensha atenaa'n bayyatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">qarqara atike'ninna shiqabaan.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Ayinna ate'n ke'eexxi miidhoole, itti anenaa'nitebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:15">atee miidheek duuchchi ati'a anga uwwa.<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />«Kunnise anee ookkone kashili qassiisemaashsha buufaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">loliinka miya giissaaka, sibilo tumaaka dadennek anten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">ba'ne iyyedagaashshanna isoo dadennek ante;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">biraakanna dadennek ante;<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Ate'n otaashsha giissemeek loliink miyi hujabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">atee ku'laaka arbonna injifattatto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">Ta'anni edi'a Duuchchi Woddike Goottike garbuwwik qoobbi konnete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">insa'ne anenaa'n alfinaaxxi insa'neexxi qullumma tenneten;»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">Hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s1">Gattowwaalitee Mageniinka Ye'injo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />«Ha'no dhebotineeki duuchchi amme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">ha'no maallaqa afinebaak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">Wodi'uwwiba'a amme</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">daginne hidhdhe; ha'we;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">Dagineexxi maallaqi belonna hiri belo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">woyinetixxa booka hidhdhe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:6">Wal. 21:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:17">22:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />La'o affebaaxxe ita'a maallaqa ha'nooka mayee fulchitina?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">Goddissabaaxxe ita'a maallaqa ha'nooka mayee fulchitina?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">Ta'anna hiyyanexxa xexxe'atine laqqine eloxxa ita itte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">eloxxe itanni ifi gammachchiise.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />Manshatenaa'ni qonta hoyyexxine laqqine, aniba'a amme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">hedhoti hexxino'a anka hiyyichcho caqasse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">Daawwiti'a aagennexxe anxe jaalalanni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">ha'noonni welti duuchchi woddixxa kako ha'no'a aaggannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:34">Erga. Huj. 13:34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />Daawwiti gosa gosake ardi'a anxe dhugaa kadaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:4">insa'neeke sooressanna akekisanjo assennen.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Kunnise egendeboxxoxxa mootumuwwa yexxatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">atee egendebaaxxi mootumuwwanna rakke atibaa daggaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">Tinni kaddaachchinna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atik Mageni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">Isira'eelik Woyyichchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">atee ulfeesse lummise'een.»<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti afemaa wodda halse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:6">shiqaa woddanna ye'edhdhe.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Fuggaalleeyye fuggoka ifika me'injo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">cubbaalleeyye fuggoka ifika yaada waldowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">Yo'oshsha mararaake kademmaxxee insa'ne'a gattowwaali hiyyo'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">Duuchchi Woddike no'oke Goottiba'a hingowwaal.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />«Yaadi anki ha'nookishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">ori ankinna ha'nooke orishatebaan,»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />«Iima buttatenaa'ni bayyattammashshanni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">ori anki ha'nooke oranaa'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">yaadi anki ha'nooke yaadanaa'ni lumooshsha bayyate'eken.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />Xeeni kaadeti iimii'n dageeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">butta lashshi assati</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">Gumma gummisaasha asseexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">rokammakee saanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">itammakee itaachcho uutaashsha assebaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">iimi'a iile iima higeexxi me'ammaabaashshanni,<verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />Anke afo'inaa'ni fuleeki hiyyichchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">tola aniba'a higabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:11">Yaane kinni ani hedannexxa assaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">ergemeeka yaadanna muxaan.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />Ha'noonna gammashshoti fuldinaan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">Nage'iki geegessendinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">koobuwwatinna tulichchuwwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">ha'no edo faaro faarsa'ni ililisaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">Badda'atixxi haqquwwa duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">caldaan.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Ute afebak hi'neessi haqichcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">utetixxa bakka barsineetik haqichchi lata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">Tinni Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi qalli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">Ba'a dande'aake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">duuchchi woddike beesisa kadaan.»<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s1">Ajajemaak Duuchchi Alfaaxxa Anjirensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">«Dhugaa asse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">eloxxa asse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">Anjira anxi shiqo hexxeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">qullumma anxinna rakke leellitaan.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Edi Sanbata battosebaangi ulfeessaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">fuggoxxa assatenaa'n anga ifixxa bukki assaak, hoyyedhaak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:2">Tenneera assaak manji isi eebbisemeeken.»<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa higeek alagi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">«Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee ifike ardanaa'n foyaan» hiyyoqqe'e middisikinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">«Ani bagoke haqichchonni» hiyyoqqe'e.<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:4">«Anka Edi Sanbata ulfeessaak middisuwwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">ane'e gammachchisaxxaara fi'laak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">kako anxanna heqqedhaak,<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />Anke mine'ninna anke dalla'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">labbaxxenna meyyaxxe oose caala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">qalli hiyyemmaak summa insa'ne'a uwwannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:5">Duuchchi woddi'anna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">ba'abaaka summa insa'ne'a uwwannon.<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />Isi'a ergatematee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">Duuchchi Woddike Goottinni welti ifi guduunfeek alaguwwi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">Duuchchi Woddike Goottika summa eeyyati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">isonna magenooffatati</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">Edi Sanbatuwwa battoossinebaak ulfeessaakara duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">kako anxanna heqqedhaakaara,<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />Insa'ne anke woyyichchi koobaba'a iyyedganno;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">anke soodachchotike mini giddonna insa'nee gammachchisanno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">Ciincatika insa'neeka tolchanna wele tolchuwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">anke tolchimalcho'n tolchinoole insa'nee'n adhdhanno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">Mini ank gosa gosake arduwwi duuchchi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">soodachchotike mine hiyyeme ye'emaan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">56:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mat. 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:17">Mar. 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:46">Luq. 19:46</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />Xexxeerememmaka Isira'eelika arda bukki assammaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:8">«Bukki hiyyemmakeraani lebeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">wele manna higeen bukki assanno» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Isira'eelike Akeekisanjuwwa Aallaateexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Ha'no buttatik biniinchuwwi duuchchi amme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:9">ha'no badda'atik biniinchuwwi duuchchi daggineexxi ninniffe.<verse eid="ISA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />Isira'eelike akeekisanjuwwi balla'akeeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">ege'na anfebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">Duuchchiing hafuura afebaake wonshuwwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">duta dande'abaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">ciinseexxi oojjontaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">diiphicallikeeranna.<verse eid="ISA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Insa'ne haranga lumo qico godobisanjo wonshan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">godobisanjo egenebaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:11">Qalbeefatabaaxxe allalisanon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">duuchchiing ifi fika ora me'ine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">mitti mittingi ifi fixxa la'o harsine.<verse eid="ISA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />Insa'nenna weli'aan weli, «Amme woyinetixxa booka ha'wino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">machchonnanno qico'ni ha'wino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:12">Sooddonna iittanni techchishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">akimagaada no'a woyyotaaxxe barra kaddaan» hinaan.<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="s1">Isira'eeli'i</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Qulliyye rertaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">tenne kinni ayyinna qalbeefataata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">Qulliyye fuggoxxenaa'n gatatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">adhdhemiyyo insa'nexxa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">Ayyinna qalbeefatabaan.<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />Cimobelo me'aakir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:2">insa'ne'a nage'ake kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:2">Insa'nenna ifixxe taqe'n hafuura adhdhinaan.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />«Ha'no eettene gojaamettexxi oose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:3">ha'no ookkone yababulikinna yabaabulto manjichchoxxi horte ha'no kaba'a amme.<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Ha'no gacifatina'een ayye'nite?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Ha'no afo'o fulchexxina'neek ayye'nite?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Arrabo fulchitineexxi gacifatina'neek ayye'nite?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:4">Ha'no xaqartiyyetixxi oose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">ha'no dhariyyetixxe hortebaata?<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Qilxuwwiinke haqichchuwwi giddo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">ookkone shafi barqaaqeke haqichchi hunda yabaabulleti gubatinaak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:5">Dhooquwwate'n, rassatike baqaquwwi giddo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">oose ha'nooxxa tolchina'mekebaa?<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Dhooqati giddo hedheeke shaqqaxxe kino</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">giddo hexxeexxi fakkuwwa atixxen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Kunnichchuwwinna atik qoobbuwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">dhugaaten, konneelchuwwa ha'watika tolcha dhangalaase'eten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">midhatika tolchuwwanna shiqishsheten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Anita konnechchuwwixxee sammi hiyyannota?<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />Taqe atixxa qephphinake'ninna qeerraaxxe kooba hana falteten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:7">ookkonna tolcha atika shiqishshottaa da'mitattonni.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />Cufana atikena'ninna mikikkilanjuwwi atik uduma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">magenoonfattaxxa aatixxa fakkuwwa fannisseteen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Ma'na atixxanna farri assexxeten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Yabaabuletee'e hira weli aagee yorte atixxa bidhdhitetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">saala insa'nekanna uuddetten.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Ejeersiinxa zayite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">shitto lebbettexxi Molekibaa martetten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:9">Atika erganjuwwinna bayyike bogiba'a ergitette;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">ati ifi wiiddi dimmi giddi'a dhidhindette.<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />Oriinxe birasa'nenaa'n ifi gophphette;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">yaane kinni, ‹Addachchissaaxxeba'a› hiteboxxo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:10">Uduudakanna alfitette;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">tennexxe corco hiteboxxon.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />«Anee sobbettek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">ayyee sodaatte, ayyee rifit hiteette?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Ane qaabbatteboxxok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">tennenna qalbefata gophphettechchi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Anee sodaata gophphettechchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">ani sammi hiyyennexxeetebaa?<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />Eloxxenni hitinaa'ni assitina'neexxa ha'nooxxa huje farri assannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:12">magenooffatinammaxxi fakkuwwanna ha'no dandette gargartabaan.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Gargaassake raartattoxxa yanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">ifi bukki asseteexxa magenoofachchotixxi fakkuwwa atee anjirtaqqata!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Konnelchuwwa diidallo filte adhdhite me'itaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">hafuurkinna konnelchuwwa xeeraan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Anee gollake assedheek manji kinni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">ookkonee boga dhaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">anxa woyyitte koobanna adhdhaan.»<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageni Arda Ifika Gargaaro'aanna Fayyiso'a Haaso'eeka Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Hiyyanee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:14">«Giisse, giisse! Ora qophpheesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:14">anke ardike orinaa'n gufo fugusse!»<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Lumodheekinnaa duuchchingenaa'n xalli hiyyeek isi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">summi isikinna Woyyichcha kadeek duuchchi woddi'a hedhaak hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">«Salphateeke mannika irra qophphi assatee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">Enqendeexxa qalbe afeekaara dammassatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">ettene qephphitte bakka'ninna ookkone woyyichcha booncho'n hedhanno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">Enqendexxa qalbe afeekeerininna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">ifike irrinni salphateekerinni welti hedhannon.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Manjiink irri ani edo ifi gophabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">dadeennek manjik hafuurinna uurrabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:16">Duuchchi woddi'a aallatabe'no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">duuchchi woddanna mufatabe'no.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Cubbo itti hexxeexxe kaddemmaxxee haafensha isixxe'n mufaten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">isenna mura woxxisenne; alba ankanna mufeti isinaa'n sho'edhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">kaddo malee ora ifika me'a waalebaan.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />Ani ora isika afe'ennen, kaddo malee isoo fayyisanno;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">isoo akeekanno; isi'aanna isixxee oodhakara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">dayyeefachcho insa'ne ille iima hiissanno.<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />Isira'eelike oodhalchuwwinke afo'o'ni galata dadanon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:19">Shiqonnaa bayya hedheekeeri'aa nage'i kadowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">Ani insa'nee fayyisannon»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Fuggaalleeyye kinni ikk danbala'i dhoqqennaa kora fulchammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">sammi hiyya dande'ammabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">insa'nee daaqqammaxxe abbaayyashshaten.<verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />Ank Mageni, «Fuggaalleyyetee nage'i hedhebaan» hiyyaan.<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s1">Dhugatixxa Agabo goddo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />«Hunnati raar; gatilsitoxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">hafuura atikanna malagatuffa laqis;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:1">Arda ankee xaqaro insa'neexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">Ya'iqoobike ardi'aanna cubbo insa'neexxa haaso'i.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Insa'nee barra barra'n anee harsinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">ora ankanna ege'natee yorraake lanbaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">toggitte yaane assaake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">ifike Magenika ajaja waalebaake ardi duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Dhugaatixxa murte anee kadhataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">insa'nee Mageni insa'neebaa shiqaashsha eeyyaake labaan.<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />Ardikinna, ‹Ati adhdha gophphaatechchinni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">mayeeta agabo goddo honsenne?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">Ati mittechchishshanna laakko'a gophphetechchinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">mayeeta ifi salphinsenne?› hiyyaan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">«Kaddo malee ha'nooxxe agabo goddo hosatixxa barra eetineexxa assitina;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">erganjuwwa ha'nookanna miicinaan.<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Ha'nooxxi agabo goddo hosa lolikinna moronshat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">seerbeloxxa assatinna tuntummoti weli ganati muuxendaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:4">Ta'ani edi'a techchixxe agabo goddo hosaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">hafuuri ha'nook alalle laqisaaxxa addatinoqqe'e.<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Ani filennexxi agabo goddo hosa iitta hexxeexxeeta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">Manjita ifi salphisaak iitta hexxeexxe barra baro callata?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Qooccuffa ifi umo hangulli assateeta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">Yookaan yaaddotixxa seemma oddo'wati bululoke'n gangalachchoteeta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">Agabo goddo hosate hitettexxi yexxaattexxita tenneteeta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">Duuchchi Woddik Goottitta adhdhaaxxi iitta hexxeexxe barrata?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />«Yoona ani fi'leenexxi agabo goddo hosa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">miiccamiinka haachchaba tanshitinaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">qanbariinxa wodaro tikinaashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">Miicemeekara leexa fulchitinaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">qanbara duuchcha enqitinaashshatebaata?<verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />Atixxa ita sol'weeke qooddattoshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">doonsa kiyyaa hiyaaka hiyyeessa mi'ne atike'n adhdhitottaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:7">Daareeka affotole oddeessitattoshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">fira atikenaa'n alba sho'exxabexxoshshatebaa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">58:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:15-17">Rom. 3:15-17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />«Tennee assitottole ifi atiki soodimariinke ifishsha ifaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">fayya ati'a rakkee daggaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:8">Ati'a muraakinna ati edo me'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">Duuchchi Woddike Goottik gaachchanni gollake kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />Eettene yanna ye'exxatton; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna hiissichcho ati'a uwwaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">gargaarsakee raartato; isinna ‹Ani ati'a hedhennen› hiyyaan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:9">«Miicenshatik qanbar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">fuggoxxi haaso'anna manjoke'n qubichcho toga ifinaa'n bayyissottole;<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />Solo'weeke marartotole;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">rabemeekiir goddaashsha assitottole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">ifi atik dukkanate'ni ifa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">hashshatinnaa saafo'iinxe arishsho kadda.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />Duuchchi woddik Gootti duuchchiin wodda atee akeekaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">arishsho gubbeexxe butta'n isi yorte atixxa wonsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">micco atikanna jabeessannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">Wode'e goddeeke hiddichchiinxe bakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">haranga guuttabaaxxe muumme kaddatto.<verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Ardi atik edixxa oluwwa ille iima hiisse ijaaraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">olmixxa boosonna ofo'linsha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:12">Atinna digemeek dalla'uwwike giissallo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">lumolla oruwwike qamalchallo hiyyendatto.<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edi Sanbata Ulfeessat Afemaaka Hira</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />«Lekkuwwa atixxi Edi Eanbatuwwa jijjiirtabaashsha hoyyexxottole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">woyyoondeexxe anxe barra'n atixxe qalbeka yaada assa gophphotoole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">Edi Sanbata gammashshote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa woyyitte barra ulfaatteexxe hite yexxottole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">Ora ifike'n me'atenaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">fedhii atixxishsha assatenaa'ninnaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">woyi fuldabaaxxe yaanenaa'n ifi qussottole,<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />Eettene yanna Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n gammaddaton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">buttatike qephphinnuwwa'n gulufattoshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">anna atika Ya'iqoobika qadaada goddite ittattoshsha assannon»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">Duuchchi Woddike Goottik afo'o tenne haaso'edheen.<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s1">Wabeeki Ardiinxa Cubbo Daabbate</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Kunnise Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi anga anjirate haru'mitabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:1">mansha isixinna gophphabaan.<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />Yaane kinni balleessa ha'nooxxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">Mageno ha'nookenaa'n ha'noo foote'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">cubbo ha'nooxxi alba isika ha'noonaa'n shoxxe'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:2">Tennexxee isi laqabaan.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Anguwwa ha'nooxxi mundeti munde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">qubbuwwa ha'nooxxinna balleessati balleessate kadde'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:3">Afo'i ha'nook dhara haaso'edheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">arabi ha'nookinna fuggoxxa yaane laqiseen.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Dhugaati ye'a'neek ayyinna hedhebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">yaada ifika qajeelummati shiqisha'neek hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:4">Insa'ne woyi fuldabaaxxe yaane addante; dharakanna haasonne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">rakko siila'wineexxi fuggotanna ille.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Bofiinke quuphe'n kabbine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">magenjooletika haadanna sunqe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:5">Konnechchuwwika quuphphuwwanna itaakiir reyaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">quuphphikinna enqemeexxa yanna dhudhdhuufi fulaa.<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Haadi magenjooletikinna seemmatee kadabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">hujjaaxxe yaanuwwanna biso ifika buqecca dandetabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:6">Huje insa'neexxi fuggoxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">anga insa'neexxinna xaqarotixxi huje wo'mite'een.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />Lekka insa'neexxinna cubbotiba'a gongita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">balleessa beloxxa mundenna dunatee wiinandaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:7">Insa'ne hendaak fuggoke yaada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">balleessatanna diiga insa'neek orike beesisaken.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />Nage'inka ora egennebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">ora insa'neeke'n dhugaa assa hexxebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:8">Ora ifika midaamiddichchake assine'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">ookkonna me'aak nage'a afebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:15-17">Rom. 3:15-17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ardi Cubbo Ifixxe Aadde Aage</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Tennexxee dhugaa assa no'onaa'n bayyate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">qullummatinna no'obaa daggabaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:9">Ifa halsinenne, yaane kinni dukkana calla kadde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">wa'a hiyyeeka ifa halsinennen, me'inaanne kinni dimma dukkana'nite.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Dalla'ake'n balla'iinsha ganemmenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">me'inji no'okinna ille affammabaakishsha qaqqaphphate kadde;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:10">Bogi siphphi siphphi hiyyammaa wodda kaddammashsha barra saafo'a timmi timmi hinenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">jajjabbuwwi giddo rensha manna kandenne.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />No'o duuchchiingi dibi hiyyemaake biniichishsha hamuummantenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">guugenjotishshanna yuu hina'n oo'nenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">dhugaa assa halsine; yaane kinni anfebo'no;;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">anjirensha hansenne yaane kinni no'onaa'n bayyate.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Balleessa no'oxxi ati edo birasaxxe'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">cubbo no'oxxinna no'on dhugaa kulde'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:12">Balleessa no'oxxi no'onaa'n gargar higgebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">qarumma no'oxxanna egenneenne.<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n jalline'enne; dhara haasonnenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">Mageno no'oka hordofatenaa'n ille iima hingenne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:13">Xaqaronna seeri beloxxa assa haasonnenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">qalbe no'oxxi siila'witeeka dhara haasonnenne.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Tennexxee dhugaa assa no'onaa'n bayyate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">qullummatinna bayya urrite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:14">Dhugaa orake'n guggufateen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">qajeelummatinna e'ya dandeettebaan.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Dhugaa habanna afendabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">fuggoxxenaa'n bayyataak wele manni'a gacifachchotike kadaan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 59:15" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:15">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti uude;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">dhugaa assanna hedha gophphemmaxxee yaade.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />Ayyinna hedhebaaxxa afe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">isiba'a gurura'aak hedha gophemaxxee mancira hiyye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:16">Tennexxe ifixxi hirre isi'a anjira iyyedagge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">qullumma ifixxinna isoo kiphphe abidde.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:5">Isa. 63:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ISA 59:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />Qullumma seemmuffa oddo'we;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">anjiratixxa gullenna umo ifike'n uggudhdhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">halo fulatixxa seemmanna oddo'we;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">hana lebende oddo'wendammaxxe seemmashsha hinaafe hana lephphe oddo'we.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe. 6:14</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 6:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:8">1 Tes. 5:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />Insa'neexxe hujexxe qixxe'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">ifixxa aare ifike diinuwwa'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:18">Ifixxa halo fulanna fike naaphuwwa'n iittanni hira insa'ne'a uwwaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">giddichchuwwateenna insa'neexxe anga'ninxe hujeshanni uwwaan.<verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Dhidhimake'n hedheekiir Duuchchi Wooddike Goottika summa sodaata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">arishsho fuldamma darre'n hedheekiir ulfinna isike hirema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:19">Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hafuuri kofeme'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">wo'meeke lola'ishsha dagaan.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />«Anjiralli Tsiyooniba'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:20">cubbo ifixxa aadde aageeke Ya'iqoobike ardiba'a dagaan»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 59:20">Hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:26">Rom. 11:26</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Insa'ne'a aagennexxi kako; ta'anaa'n duuchchiin woddi'a ha'no'ni hedheeki anki Hafuuri afo'o ha'nooke'n uggeenneki anki hiyyichchi ha'nooke afo'onaa'n oose ha'nooxxike afo'uwwinaa'ninna ha'nooxxe oosexxe oose afo'uwwinaa'n ta'anaa'n duuchchin woddi'a iboqqe hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s1">Edi'a Kadaaka Iyyerussaalemika Ulfinna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />«Tee Iyyerussaalem!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:1">Ifi atik ifemmaxxee kexxe ifi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:1">Duuchchi Woddike Goottik ulfinni ate'n ife'en.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Kunnise Dukkana butta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">dimma dukkana arduwwa buqqaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:2">Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ate'n hana dage'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">gaachchanna ifikanna ate'n ifisaan.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Gosa gosaki arduwwi atike ifibaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:3">moyanjuwwikinna atike ifike wa'inniba'a dagaan.<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />«Qokki hite qarqara atika uudi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">duuchchiing bukki hiyyeexxi atiba'a dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">Labbaxxi atixxi oose bayyii'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">meyyaxxi atixxi oosenna hanqafende atibaa daggaan.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />Ookkonneechchi uduma atinna uuddatton; wa'a hitatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">qalbe atixxinna xoggitaan; gammashshotinna ise'n wo'mita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">abbaayyuwwate'n hexxeexxi karruwwa atibaa dagga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">moyanjuwwiink qabeenninna atike kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Gaaluwwiink haagan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">Midiyaamixxinna Eefaaxxi gaaluwwiinxi baltanna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">Boga atike'n wo'mitaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">worqenna hixaana aadhdheexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika galata lassaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">duuchchingi Saabanaa'n dagaan.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Qeedarik gedhebi duuchchi atiba'a bukki hiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">Nebayootixxi gedhebiinxi korbeeyye atee ergatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">kunnichchuwwinna anke tolchimalchi hana eeyyemeeke tolchuwwa kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">aninna anke ulfinnika galma danchoossanno.<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />«Guugenjuwwa ifike minbaa phirrissammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:8">duumanchiinsha me'a'neek kunni ayyeera?<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Dhugaaten giddichchuwwa anete addata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">isi gaachchanna ifika ate'n oddeessemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">Isira'eelike Woyyichcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atike Mageni'a ulfinni'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">bayyii'n atixxa labbaxxa oose;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">insa'neeke birretike sbiljinninnaa insa'neexxe worqenninni iyyedagatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">Terseesixxi lumoxxi hoboluwwa edissee fuldaan.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />«Alagi manni dalla'a atika ijaraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">moyajuwwi insa'neekiirinna ati'a ergataan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">Aare anxenni atee ganonnolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">mararte anxa jaalalati ate'n leellishanno.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />Atike dalla'ixxi huluwwa haanonna banendeeshshanni hexxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">hashsha barra haranga cufendabaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:11">Tinninna gosa gosaxxe mootummuwwaxxi karra atibaa daggaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">moyanjuwwa insa'neekirinna atiba'a injiffachchoti e'yinaashshaten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:25-26">Wal. 21:25-26</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Ati'a hiremabaak ardinna mootummuwwa baxxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:12">haranganna kutti hita.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />«Anke woyyichchi galmixxa bakka danchoossonnaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">Libaanoosika gaachanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">hi'neessi, asitikinna barsineeti hiyyemaaki haqichchuwwi atibaa dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">lekka anxi haxxaaxxa bakka ani ulfeessanno.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Atee miicammake mannixxe labbaxxi oose sagada'n atibaa daggaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">ate'e tufaataaki duuchchi lekka atixxe'n ibaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">Duuchchi Woddike Goottik qachchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">Isira'eelike woyyichchixxe maallaqa kaddetexxe Tsiyooni hinee atee ye'naan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:9">Wal. 3:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />«Waallendeettexxennaa gibendeettexxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">ayyinna ati giddii'n sa'abaaxxe kaddottolenna midde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">Ani duuchchi woddixxe atixxe ifi saada'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">ila ila duuchchixxe gammashsho atee assanon.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Ati gosa gosaxxe mootummuwwaxxe ado ha'witatto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">moyanjuwwiinka ununanna unu'nitatto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">Ookkoneechchi uduma ani Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anjirallo atike</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">wodallo atikinna ani Ya'iqoobixxe hunna kadeennexxa egendatto.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />Sageettotike sibilixxa bakka worqe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">sibiliinxa bakka birretika sibilo ati'a iyyedaganno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Na'ge'a ati'a galchallo atike</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">qullummatannaa atike akeekisanjo assanno.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />Ta'anni edi'a atike boga'n weekkensha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">atixxe gabaluwwa'ninna ba'netinna diigensha laqendaba'a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">Yaane kinni atika dalla'uwwa anjira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">atixxa dalla'iinxa huluwwa galateke hitee yexxatto.<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />Ta'anni edi'a barra arishshoti ifi ati'a hasisabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">hashshanna agenjiink ifi ati'a ifisabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti duuchchi woddike ifa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">atik Mageninna atike gaachchanna kada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:23">Wal. 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:5">22:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Arishsho atixxi ta'anni edi'a aagabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">agenji atikinna ifa uwwa uurrisabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati'a duuchchi woddike ifa kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">atixxe yaaddoxxi barranna gattaan.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />Arduwwi atik duuchchi qulliyyete kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">ookkonee boganna duuchchi woddi'a dhalaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">Ulfinna anka leellishaake kadaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">anxe angaxxe huje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">insa'nee ani kaasennexxe qosorruwwan.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Atik heenoke kadeek kumaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">duuchchingenaa'n udu'maak maa'n hunnaameette mootumma kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">Ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">yanna geltaa wodda tennee rakee assannon.»<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />Dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Hafuuri ane'n hedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">hiyyeeyyetee eloxxa odo lallabonna'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">Duuchchi Wodik Gootti anee hariiredheen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">Qalbe insa'neexxi enqendeekara qammachchannoshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">booji'emeekaranna leexumma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">usuremeekiiri'anna tikensha lallabannoshsha anee erge'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">61:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mat. 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:22">Luq. 7:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />Eeyyendeexxa Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa wogga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:2">no'oke Magenixxa halo fulatixxa barra lassannoshsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:2">Oodhaakara duuchcha dayyessonna'a anee ergeedheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">61:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:18-19">Luq. 4:18-19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />Tsiyooni giddonna yaadeekara jajjabeessannoshsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Bululiinxa bakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">danchummatika kallachcha insa'neeke umo'n uggonnaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Oodhishshatixxa bakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">gammashshotixxa zayite umo insa'neeki hana dhangalaasonna'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Cumummi hiyyeke irrixxa bakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">galatiinka ejja insa'ne hana lebe oddeessonna'a anee erge'een;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Insa'nenna isik ulfinni itti leellaake kandaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'nee kaaseeke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">qullummatike haqichchuwwa hiyyemme ye'emmaan.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />Insa'ne olmixxa ole hiissine ijjaarraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">edi wodda baxxemmaxxara haarooba urrinsaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:4">Heddo ila edi darre baxxemmaxxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">oluwwatik qachchuwwi langaxxa qammachchemaan.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Alagi manni ha'nooka gedhebo allalaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:5">wele bogik manni ha'nooke fichchcha'inna ha'nooke woyinetike hiddichchike fichcha'n ha'no'a hujaan.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Ha'noonna Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe qeese hiyyendinne ye'endinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">no'oke Magenixxe garboole hiyyendinaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">Gosa gosaxxe mootummuwwaxxa karra ittinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">insa'neeke qabeena'inna ifi saaddinaan.<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />Ardi ank ifike salphinnixxa bakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">lame anga qoobbo adhdhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">ifike saphinnixxa bakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">ifixxe karra'n gammadaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">Ifike bogika lame anga qoobbo dhaalaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">Duuchchi woddik gammadinna insa'neeke kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />«Ani Duuchchi Woddik Gootta dhugaa assa eeyyannaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">mulqedhatannaa balleessa huja jibbannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">Xuurameessumma anxeninna insa'nee'a hiissichcho uwwannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">insa'ne'aanna duuchchi woddixxa kako aaganno.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Insa'neexxi hortenna gosa gosaxxe mootummuwwa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">oose insa'neexxinna ardake'n ege'nendeexxe kaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">insa'nee uudeeki duuchchinna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti eebbiseeke manna kadeexxa ege'naan.»<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />Ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n lumoshsha gammadannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">lubbo anxinna anke Mageno'n adda gammaddaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Waajubichchi ifi danchoosedhammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">waajubbichchotinna seesuwwik ifi seefattammashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Isi anjiratixxa seemma ane'n oddeesse'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">qullummatixxa oddononna hana ane'n oddeese'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">61:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Wal. 21:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Anjirenshatee Haaso'endeexxa Eloxxa Odo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Buttin mudho latisammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">hiddichchuwwi lataaxxi bakkanna sanne nophphitashsha assitammashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna gosa gosaxxe mootummuwwa edo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">qullummatanna galata burqaashsha assaan.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="s1">Tsiyoonika Haarooka Summa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Isexxi qullumma soodimariinke ifishsha wa'a hitaa qico'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">anjirensh isexxi xabaake xassishsha leellaa qico'ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">Ani Tsiyoonixxee sammi hiyyabo'non;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">Iyyerusaalemixxeenna ca'li hiyyabo'non.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Gosa gosaxxi mootummuwwa qullumma atixxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">moyanjuwwikinna ulfinna atika uudaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">Duuchchi Woddiki Goottik afo'i ati'a fulchaake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">haarooke summinni ye'endatton.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe anga'n ulfinnika kallachcha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:3">atike Magenixxe anga'ninna mootummatike kallachcha kaddatton.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />Ta'anni elqi'a «Atee waalendettexxe» hiyyende ye'endaboxxon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">bogi atikinna «Urmake» hiyyemabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Ati ye'endattok haarok summi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">«Duuchchi Eoddik Gootti ise'ni gammadaan!» hiyyaaken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">bogi atikinna «Aro'o affeexxen» hiyyeme ye'emaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna ate'ni gammadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">bogi atikinna aro'o affeexxe manjichchoshsha kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Qee'lichchi dubarrichcho adhaammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">oose atixxinna iittanni atee dadeek Mageninna ati'a aro'oke kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">Waajubichchi waajubichchote'n gammadammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">Mageni atik ate'ninna gammadaan.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />Tee Iyyerusaalemi! Atika heqqalluwwa atike dalla'uwwi hana urrise'ennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">insa'ne hashshannaa barra haranga samminabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">Ha'no Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa maganne maganne hitinaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">haranga mee hafuura adhdhe.<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />Iyyerusaalemii ijaarre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">buttatike galata assaa qico'ni isi hafuura adhdhaashsha assitinoqqe'e.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ifixxe hunna'ninna mootuma'n hiyye kakatee qici;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">«Ta'anni edi'a midha atixxa naaphi itaashsha assabo'non;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">atika reefika woyinetika bulbulonna alagi ha'waashsha assabo'non.<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />Yaane kinni doonete'n aasse'neexxa midha insa'nenni indeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">ane'e Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galateeffantaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:9">Bukki asse'neexxe woyinetixxe roddeka woyinetika bulubulo umo insa'nengenninni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">woyyichcha anke galmixxe baxxe'n ha'winaan.<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Dalla'inxe hula darre'ni sa'we</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">ardake'e ora qophpheesse ba'laka ora giisse</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Kinjuwwa hoyye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">baandira gosa gosake ardi'a iimi'a abidde.<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti gosa gosake arduwwa'ni hiyye lallaba'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">Tsiyoonika arda ‹Ha'no'o anjiraak dagaan isi manjoke'e uwwaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">hiranna badhaasa anga abixxe'en› hitine kulle» hiyye.<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />Ardikinna «Woyyichcha Mageniike ardanna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Anjireeke»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">hiyyemaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">Atinna Iyyerusaalem «Hasendeeteexxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">waalendeboxxoke ookkone qachcha» hiyyendatton.<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddik Goottixxa Injifachchonna Anjira</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Kunni Eedoomi'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">diimmooka ejja fugatee Bootsiraa'n daga'neek aate?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Kunni gaachchanna oddo'week</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">ifixxe hunnake lumminninni tarkaafata'n daga'neek aate?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 63:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">«Qullummati haaso'aneek;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">anjiratenna hunna afeennek anendeqqa.»<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />Atixxi oddoono maye'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:2">woyinetike miicendemmaba woyine hirbeessammake mannixxe seemmashsha diimmatte?<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />«Ani woyinetike miicendammaba'a eettene woyine qofinni hirbeessenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">gosa gosaxxe mootummabaa'n ayyinna aninni hedhemmabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Mufe anxe'n insa'nee hirbeessenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">aare anxenninna insa'nee bulleessenne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Munde insa'neexxi oddoono anxe'n fiffixende'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">seemma anxanna daafe'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:20">Wal. 14:20</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:13">19:13</ref>, <ref loc="REV 19:15">15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Halo fulannoxxa barra qalbe anxe'n hexxeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:4">wodannoxxi wogganna gelte'een.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />Uudennen; gargaaraak kinni hedhemmabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">kiphaak hedha gopheemmaxxee'e mamba'a hiyyenne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:5">Tennexxe anixxi anga ani'a anjira iyydage;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">aninxi aare anee jabeessite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:16">Isa. 59:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Gosa gosaxxa mootummuwwa mufe anxenni hirbeessenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">aare anxenninna insa'nee machchoossenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">munde insa'neexxanna buttinake'n dhangalaasenne.»<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isira'eeli'a Ba'latee Qico</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottixxa ba'lunte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ani'a asseexxe duuchchi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">isi galatefatemmaaxxe isixxe hujexxe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">Isixxe jaalalaxxe isixxe ba'luntexxe qixxe'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">Isira'eelike ardi'a asseexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">eeti asseexxe eleoxxe yaanexxe haaso'annon.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna, «Insa'ne dhugaandin anke ardanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">dhara haasottabaaxxe anxe labbaxxe oosen» hiyye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">tennexxee insa'neeke anjirallo kade.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />Wixixxii insa'neexxe duuchcha isi wixixxii hiyye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">ifixxe afenshak iimik erganji insa'nee anjire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">Ifixxe jaalalanninna ifixxe marartenni insa'nee wode;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">edika baro duuchcha'n innsa'nee qophphi asse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">insa'neenna ba'edhe.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Insa'n kinni jalline;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">isika Woyyichcha Hafuuranna yaadinse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:10">Tennexxee isi insa'ne'n wirri hiyye'e naaphake kade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">isinni umo isingenni insa'ne lole.<verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottik erganji Muuse hedhema woddika olmike barixxa qaabante;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">ookkone gedhebik allallisanji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">abbaayyatenaa'n insa'nee fulcheek Isi haba hedhee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">Woyyichcha isika Hafuuranna oddo insa'neexxe'n uggeemmak Isi haba hedhee?<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />Ifixxa ulfateexxa hunnaamete hirre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">Muusexxe middixxe anga'n hexxaashsha asse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:12">Ifi'a duuchchi woddike gurra kadaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">wodu'uwwa insa'nee edo qoqqoode.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Fula. 14:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />Fadhadi qiilla gammoojje giddo sa'ammashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:13">Insa'nenna dhi'mo giddo sa'iseexxi akeeke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">tennexxee insa'ne gugufantebaan.<verse eid="ISA 63:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Dhooqa giddi'a adade me'ammake horishsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">Duuchchi woddike Goottike Hafuuri insa'ne'a hafuura adhdha uwwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:14">Arda atika konne qicinni akeekkettek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">summi atik ulfaateeke kadaashsha assateten.<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gattowwaliteenna Gargaarsaakee Shiqqeexxa Soodachcho</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />Woyyitte ulfaattexxenna lummoxxe atixxe mootenaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">iiminaa'n butti'a uudi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">Hunna atixxinna hinaaffe atixxi habaxxe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">Arjunte atixxainnaa ba'lunte atixxe habaxxe?<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Abirihaami no'o ege'nanna gophoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">Isira'eelinna midde no'o qaabbata gophoole midde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">atiqa no'oke Anna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:16">Ee, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Ati no'oke Annan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">Olmi'ninni summi atiki no'o wodaan.<verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />Ee, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Ora atikenaa'n fullonna'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">qalbe no'oxxa dilloossat mayee atee sodaantebo'noshsha no'o assitette?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:17">Atike gosa gosake mini hadixxee hite'e maganneten higi.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />Heenooxxe yanna'a ardi atik eettenee woyyitte bakka dhaaleemman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:18">ta'a kinni naaphuwwi no'ok atika woyyichcha galma hirbeesseen.<verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />No'oqa olmanni atike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">insa'nee kinni ati insa'nee galchiteboxxo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">insa'ne summa atikenninna ye'emmebaan.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />Ee iimuwwa haaqqasite silaan dirritettele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:1">silaat koobuwwa ati edo culphisseele!<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />Giira ha'ishendaa wodda haasumete'n bubbammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">wode'ekanna danfissammashsha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:2">Summi atik naapha atike'n ege'nemaashsha dirri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">gosa gosaxxi mootumuwwanna ati edo sheke sheke hitaashsha assi!<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />No'o heqqinebo'noxxa sodaachchisaxxa yaane assitette wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:3">ati dirritetten, koobuwwatinna ati'a culphisse.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />Olmii'ninni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">atee heqqedhaakiiri'a insa'ne dhaqqabaak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:4">Atishsha hedheeka Mageno uuddeexxi ille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">laqqexxi manshanna haranga hexxemabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">64:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:9">1 Qor. 2:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Gammashshoti eloxxa yaane assakeeri'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">atike ora'ninna hedhaakara gargaartatto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">No'o kinni insa'ne'n lenbe lenbe cubbo hunjennexxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">kunnise ati no'o'ni mufattetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">hittata anjirema dandeennanno?<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />No'o duuchchiing batto'eke manjishsha kandeenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">no'oxxe qullummaxxi hujenna xurik battotteexxe seemmashshaten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:6">Duuchchiing no'o shafiinsha harcane'en;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">cubbo no'oxxinna no'o diiddallotishsha filite'een.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Ayyinna soodachchoti summa atika ye'ebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">ateenna abixxatee yora'neek hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:7">Ati alba atika no'onaa'n sho'exxetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">no'oxxe cubboxxe no'o waalde'eten.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Tinni kaddenaa'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Ati Anna no'oken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">no'o faarake kandanno wodda ati faariinke hujallon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">no'o duuchchiingi atixxe angaxxe hujen.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />Ee, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta hara lumooshsha no'o'n aartoxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">cubbo no'oxxanna duuchchi woddi'a qallitoxxe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:9">Maganneten atee soodantaa'enen, alba atika no'obaa wirri assi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">no'o duuchchiingi atike ardani.<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />Atik woyyichchi qachchuwwi qiilla gammoojje kade'en;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">Tsiyooni midde qiilla gammoojje, Iyyerusaaleminna onake kadde'een.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />No'oki anuwwi atee itti galateeffantemmak woyyichchikinna ulfaateemmak no'ok galmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">giirati gubate'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">eeyyisammak no'ok boonchuwwi duuchchi bakka ba'edheen.<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />Ee, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta tinni duuchcha kaddechchi uduma higgaboxxoota?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:12">Sammite hara lumooshsha no'o mura woxxissattota?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s1">Mageniinxa Murtennaa Anjira</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici: «Anee kadhatebaakeri'aa ifi leellishenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">anee halsebaakeri'aanna insa'ne'aa afemenne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Summa anka ye'ebaake ardi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">‹Kunnise ani, kunnise ani› hiyyenne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:20">Rom. 10:20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Xaqartichchi ardi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">eloke kadebaake oruwwa'n me'abaakeri'a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:2">Qalbe ifixxixxa gaabbeera hordofakeeri'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">barra duuchcha anga anxa diriirsenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">duuchchi wodda ani edo anee mufachchiisaake arduwwi'a,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:21">Rom. 10:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />Kunni ardi hiddichchuwwiinke fichchi giddo tolcha tolcha'neek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">faariinke miyuwwi hana hixaana guba'neeke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">duuchchi wodda anee mufachchiisa'neeke ardan.<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />Iittanni insa'nee hirreessuwwixxe oddo'ni ofola'neeki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">hashsha hashsha qoonne bakka'n galaakiir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:4">Booyetika maalla itaakiir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">odoolcho ifixxe'n batto'eke maalika la'a wonshe ugga'neekeeran.<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />‹Gamake'ni; ane'n maxxandoxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">anibaa shiqqoxxe; ani ati irra woyyichchaken› hiyye mannan!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:5">Iitta hedheek manni anxe sano'n wiliilletishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">barra duuchcha ha'yitaammaxxee giirashshaten.<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />«Kunniseten balleessa insa'neexxik hiri ani edo borreesseme hedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">ani Sammi hiyyabo'noni; yaane kinni huje insa'neexxishshan hira isi'a uwwannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">anga insa'neexxika hira insa'ne'a uwwannon.<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />Ha'nooxxa cubbonna ha'nooke annuwwixxa cubboka hira uwwannon,»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">«Insa'ne koobati hana ciincessatika tolcha shiqinshemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">koobuwwate'ni hana yowwinemmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">Insa'ne saffaremange saffarsanjo'ni insa'ne'a saffarendaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">edixxe insa'neexxe hujexxe'e anga insa'neexxik hira alfinaan.»<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">«Woyinetiki bulbuli woyinetixxe roddeeni giissendammashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">mannikinna hiyyee qici, ‹Ise giddo eloxxi yaane hexxemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">hedheni ballesitinoqqe› hinammashshanni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">Aninna anke erganjuwwixxee hiyye iittanni assannon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">insa'nee madadiinga balleessabo'non<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />Ya'iqoobixxe sanne kadeekara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">kooba anxa dhalaakara Yihudake boganaa'ni iyyedaganoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:9">Ani fi'lenneki ardi boga ookkone abixxaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">erganjuwwi ankinna ookko hedhaan.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Ane'e jabeesse halsaak anke ardi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">Saarooni anke gedhebik bobbaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">Akoorixxe dhooqa hori anki dheeda booncho kadaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:24-25">Iya. 7:24-25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />«Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta waaldineek ha'no'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">woyyitte anxa kooba deetineek manni'a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:11">Qoobboken hiyyemeeke fakkeke boonchi'a qophpheessitineeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">hixaken hiyyendeexxe fakke'a makemeeka woyinet bulbulo sottake'ni wonshitineeke;<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />Ha'no ye'enne wodda hee hiyya gophphinemmaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">ha'no'ni haaso'enne wodda laqa gophphinemmaxxee'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Ani edo fuggoxxa yaane assitinemmaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">battoossitaaxxa yaane ha'no fi'litinemmaxxee'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Ha'no wolaantichchakee sa'isse uwwannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">duuchchiing gorra'ematee gulufatinaan.»<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Tennexxee dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">«Erganjuwwi anki ittanni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">ha'no kinni solo'witinaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">Erganjuwwi anki ha'waan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">ha'no kinni dheebo'witinaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">Erganjuwwi anki gammadaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">ha'no kinni salphatinaan.<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />Erganjuwwi anki:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">giddixxe qalbenaa'ni burqa'nee gammadinni faarsaani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:14">Ha'no kinni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">qalbe ha'nooxxe yaaddotenaa'ni kexxeexxa ooxxinaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">irri ha'nok enqeme'naa woo hitinaan.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />Summa ha'nokanna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">filemeek anki ardi badinotik asso'a waaldinan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:15">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni ha'no'o shiyan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">erganjuwwa anke kinn wele summa uwwaan.<verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Tennexxe konne boga'ni eeba ye'aak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">dhugaatik Magenike summinni biifoommaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Ookkone boga'ni kakataak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">dhugaatik Magenike summinni kakataan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Saxxeexxi yaanuwwa dedhende'en</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">ille anxenaa'ni sho'ome'een.<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haaroxxa Dada</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />Kunnise ani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">haaro haaroxxa iimuwwanna haaroxxa butta dadanon:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:17">Saxxeexxi yaanuwwa duuchcha dedhendaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">qalbefataak hedhebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:22">Isa. 66:22</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2 Phex. 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Wal. 21:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Yaane kinni dadenke'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">gammadde: duuchchi woddi'a ililisse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:18">Ani Iyyerusaalemii gammashshotee'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">arda isekanna ilileettettee'e dadannon.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />Ani Iyyerusaalemii'ni gammadannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">arda ankenna ililisannon:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:19">Oodhishshatikinna raaretik hafuuri laqemabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:4">Wal. 21:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />«Ta'anni elqi'a ookko'o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">heenoxxe yanna'a calla hedhoti hixxaaxxi oose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">yookaan wogga godditebaaxxi geedhe hexxabaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">Dhibba wogga geyeek manji reyoole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">kayyanni reyeeshsha uudemaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">Mitti manji dhibba wogga geyebaangi reyoole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">qoomemeeshsha laako'emaan.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />Manni mine ijaadhdhan: giddonna hedhaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:21">woyinetanna kaalsaan: gummatanna itaan.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />Insa'nenna ta'anni edi'a welekee'e galdumiinka mine ijaarrabaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">yookaan weli itaashsha kalsinabaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">Anke ardixxi wogga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">haqichchiinxe woggashsha qeerrexxaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">Ani insa'nee fi'leennek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">eloonne huccineexxe hujjenni qeerraxxe yanna'a gammandaan.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Elo insa'neexxi butta gattabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">qooma rertaaxxi oose ilendabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:23">Insa'nenna sanne insa'neexxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti eebbiseke arda kandaan.<verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Insa'ne anee soodaantebaa edi darre insa'ne'a hiissannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:24">haasonne birrebaangi laqannon.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Yayyenna gedhebiinx beltanna mitteba bobbaattaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">neenqi laliinsha badda'a dheedaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">bofi buttina arraaphphaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Woyyitte anxe kooba hana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">fuggooxxi yaane insa'nee geltabaan: bala daggabaan,»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">hiyya'neki Duuchchi Woddike Goottan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:6-9">Isa. 11:6-9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Gosa Gosake Arda'ni Murte Muree qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">«Iima anxe mooten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">buttatinna lekka anxi haxxaaban:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">Eega ha'no ani'a ijaartina'neek mini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">ani hafuura adhdhaanneki mini hitta hedheeke?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:34-35">Mat. 5:34-35</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">23:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Konneechchuwwa duuchcha anga anxi hujjebata?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">konnechchuwwi afemaashsha assennek antebaata?»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 66:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:2">«Yaane kinni ani konnee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">qajeela kadekibanna irri isiki eenqemeeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">hiyyichcho anke'ni culphisaake manjibaa uudannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:49-50">Erga. Huj. 7:49-50</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Yaane kinni jibichcha ani'a tolchaak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">manjo anga sa'eeshshaten:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Gedhebiinka beltanjo ani'a shiqishaak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">gooba wolchiinka miccireeke manjishshaten:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Midhatika tolcha ani'a qophpheessaak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">booyetixxa munde ani'a shiqisheeke manjishshaten:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Qallitika hixaana ani'a gunbaaki:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">magenuwwa magenoonfata'neeke manjishshaten;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Insa'ne ifika ora fi'line'een:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">Lubbo insa'neexxinna fuggoxxa assati gammaddaani.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Tennexxee ani rakko insa'ne'ni geltaashsha assannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">sodaantemalchonna insa'ne'n iyyedagannon:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Ani ye'enne wodda hee hiyyeek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">haaso'enne woddanna anxa laqeek manji hedha gophemmaxxe'e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Ani edo fuggoxxa yaane assineen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">anee gibissaaxxa yaane fi'line'en.»<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />Ha'no hiyyichcho isike'ni culphisina'neek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">konne Duuchchi Woddike Goottika hiyyichcho laqqe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">«Ha'no dayyuwwa ha'nooka jibbitineek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">anke summixxe hitine fojendineeki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">‹Amme mee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ulfaate'naa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">ha'nooka gammado uundo!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">kaddo malee shookkinebaak gattinabaan.<verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Qachchi giddo hexxeexxa raare laqqe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">Galmi giddika cancanna caqasse!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:6">Tinninna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ye'injon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">Isi naaphuwwa ifikee hasisaachcho duuchcha qoqqoodaan.<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />«Tsiyooni ciniinfatebaangi edo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:7">ildemmaxxe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:7">Ciniitoti wixixxi hitebaa edo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:7">labbaka belto ilde tikendaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:5">Wal. 12:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Iitta hexxeexxa yaane ayyi laqee ege'neta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">iitta hexxeenxa yaane ayyi uudeeta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Mitte bogiki ardi mitte barra'ni ilema dande'aata?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">yookaan gosa gosak ardi iikki woddi afemata?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Tsiyoonixxi ciniinto safonge'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">oose ifixanna ikki woddi ildaan.<verse eid="ISA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Ilatee shiqqeexxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">ildabaashsha assannoketa?» hiyya'neeni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:9">«Ilda wodda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">gadaameessa iseka cufannokeeta» hiyya'neen atik Mageni.<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />«Iseke hado kaddineek duuchchi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">Iyyerusaaleminni welti gammadde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">Isexxeenna ililise:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">Ise'a ooxinemmaki duuchchi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">isenni welti yo'oshsha gammadde.<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Dayyeessa'neeka iseka ununuwwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">unu'nitinaan: godditinaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:11">Godditinaa qico'ni ha'witinaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">bira saxxeexxe isexxe karranni gammaddinaani.»<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyye'nee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">«Kunnise nage'a gallaanike wodi'ishsha ise'a dinbiliqqi assannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">mootumuwwatixxa karranna yaasumiinke wodi'ishsha kanba kanba assannoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">Unu'nitinaani: isexxe boba giddo hanqalfendinaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">gulubo iseke'ni hana ofoldine kookisendinaan.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Ama finna ifika doggammashshanni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">aninna ha'no dogannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">Iyyerusaalemi giddonna dayyatinaan.»<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Tenne uuddinaa wodda, qalbe ha'nooxxi ililissaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">micci ha'nokinna badda'atishsha haanjedhaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:14">Duuchchi Woddike Gootixxi anga isike erganjuwwinni welti hexxeexxa egendaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">mufe isixxi kinni isoo gibaake manna'ni geltaani.<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Kunnise Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti giiratike bubenjinni dagaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">sarageeluwwinna hobonbaltetishshaten:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:15">Mufe isixxa aareti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">xixichchokanna giiratike bubenjinni leellishaan.<verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Giiratinna wolaantichchi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti murte isixxa manjo duuchcha'ni iyye dagaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">Duuchchi Woddike Goottik wolaantichchinni dulemaaki heddoke kadaan.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />«Booyyetika maalanna lama'e itaan wele battootteexxa yaane itaake manni giddii'ni mittiinxa duuka hiddichchuwwiinke fichchi giddi'a me'iyyotee ifi foyaakinna ifi ca'a assaaki metteba mudaan» hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />«Ani huje insa'neexxanna yaada insa'neeka ege'nennaxxee gargariti hedheeke laagadika arduwwa duuchcha bukki asse'naa dageexxi; ulfinna anka uundaan.<verse eid="ISA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />«Insa'ne giddo beesisa uggannon; reyebaaki gateekeribaa'n anxa yaane laqebaakenna ulfinna anka uuddebaake gargaritti hedheeke ardibaa Terseesike ardibaa, Libiyake ardibaa, gabe darbataake Lidiyaake ardibaa, Tubbaalike ardibaa. Girkeeke ardibaa, bayya hexxeexxe giddichchuwwabaa ergaannoni; insa'neenna konne gosa gosake arduuwwi giddo lummine anka lallanbaan. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />Insa'nenna ha'nooka Dayyuwwa duuchcha Iyyerusaalemi hedheeke anke Woyyichcha galmiba'a fadhaduwwake'n, fadhadiinxe gaaruwwa'ni, ganguwwate'n gaaluwwake'n gulufinse gargari hedheeke boganaa'n insa'ne iyyedagaan uwwatishsha iyyedangaan» hiyya'nen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti. «Isira'eeliki ardi ani'a midhatika tolcha seeriki ca'ichcha miya'ni Duuchchi Woddike Goottike Woyyichchi Galmibaa shiqinshammashshanni tennenna shiqinshaan tenne hiyyeneki ante Duuchchi Woddike Goottan. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Aninna insa'ne giddii'ni mitte mitte qeesenna Leewwitote kande ani'a ergantaashsha assannoni.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />«Ani dadaannexxi haaroxxi iimuwwannaa haaroxxi butta duuchchi woddi'a ani edo ti'ni hite hexxammashshanni» Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Iittanni ha'nooxxi hortenna ha'nooxxik summinna ti'ni hiyyee hedhaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa. 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2 Phex. 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Wal. 21:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ISA 66:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />Agenjo agenjo'ninni baate fuldaaxxe taakkaxxe barra'ni baate fuldaake ayyaani qico'ninna Sanbatakenaa'n Sanbaati qico'ni gosa gosaki ardi duuchchi anee magenoonfato'a ani edo dagaan» hiyyee'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti. <verse eid="ISA 66:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />«Insa'ne Fulle me'inna wodda anee gibemaake maniika rensha uundaan; insa'nee ittaaxxi coroqa hara rertaaxxebaan; insa'nee gubbaaxxi giiranna xoxxaaxxebaan; insa'nee uuddexxi manjiinxi sanne duuchchi corifataan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:48">Mar. 9:48</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>